{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B000056W4V', 'answerTime': 'Nov 20, 2013', 'unixTime': 1384934400, 'question': 'Do these bottles fit Medela breast pumps? I want to pump into glass bottles instead of plastic.', 'answerType': 'Y', 'answer': 'yes'}
{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B000056W4V', 'answerTime': 'Jan 11, 2014', 'unixTime': 1389427200, 'question': "What other nipples and caps fit these bottles? Do the Dr. Brown's preemie nipples fit?", 'answer': "I have found that any standard size nipples/cap will fit. I purchased Dr. Browns nipples and used the the cap that came with this bottle (basically just switched the nipple out) and it was fine. The is a standard bottle neck so just keep that in mind. The wide caps and nipples won't fit. Goof luck!"}
