{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B000056W4V', 'answerTime': 'Mar 26, 2015', 'unixTime': 1427353200, 'question': 'Are they thermo-resistant ? Will they shatter when I boil them or warm them in a bottle warmer?', 'answer': 'I have regularly boiled Evenflo bottles to sterilize them. I put clean bottles in a pan of warm water on the stove and let the temperature increase slowly. I would not plunge room-temperature bottles into boiling water. I do not know if this is the recommended procedure, but I did not crack any bottles during the years that I was sterilizing them in this manner.'}
{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B000056W4V', 'answerTime': 'Nov 30, 2014', 'unixTime': 1417334400, 'question': 'Does it have measurement markings?', 'answerType': 'Y', 'answer': 'yes, up to 4 ounces.'}
{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B000056W4V', 'answerTime': 'Oct 26, 2014', 'unixTime': 1414306800, 'question': 'Is 4 ounces really the limit or can these bottles fit 5?', 'answer': 'Almost 5 if you are not going to freeze it.'}
