{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B00005BTNA', 'answerTime': 'Jan 7, 2015', 'unixTime': 1420617600, 'question': 'Do these work just as good for a spitty baby as the ones with the drop in liners?', 'answerType': '?', 'answer': 'In my opinion, these bottles work much better and are leaps and bounds ahead of other brands and designs in helping reduce or eliminate spitting up. Venting air from the bottom makes swallowing air impossible unless your little one gets to the bottom of their milk/formula and continues to feed even when the bottle is empty. This product has made a huge difference in my daughter! She spits up very rarely and only teeny tiny amounts when she does.'}
