{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B000067PRC', 'answerTime': 'Apr 7, 2014', 'unixTime': 1396854000, 'question': 'All the reviews for the Kiddopotamus placemat are good, while all the reviews for the Summer Tiny Diner are bad. Are they the same placemat?', 'answerType': 'Y', 'answer': 'As far as I know they are the same. I have both. One that I bought a few years ago and one that I bought in the last year. The problem I\'m having with the newer one is that they made the rubber a lot thicker and less flexible so it doesn\'t stick to the table. The suction cups don\'t work. The one I bought recently is basically useless b/c it doesn\'t stick to the table and my toddler keeps pulling it off and putting it on her head. My sister just bought the same one and she\'s having the same problem. I\'m thinking they must\'ve tried to "improve" their product by making the rubber thicker but in fact did the opposite and now it is worse.'}
