{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B0001BUKA8', 'answerTime': 'May 20, 2013', 'unixTime': 1369033200, 'question': 'Is there extra large size of 30mm or large of 27mm?', 'answer': 'Unfortunately the one piece shield is only made in the medium (24mm) size. If you want the large size breastshield to use with your pump you will need to buy the Medela PersonalFit Breastshield (27mm) and the Medela PersonalFit Connectors. When you put those products together you will have the equivalent of the one piece shield. Likewise if you need the XL size (30mm) you can purchase the PersonalFit 30mm and the PersonalFit Connectors and that combination can also replace the one piece shield on your pump. Hope that helps. If not will be pleased to answer any follow up questions. Christine Cover at Baby Guru.'}
