{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B0001D12XA', 'answerTime': 'Mar 31, 2013', 'unixTime': 1364713200, 'question': 'Is it better to get the original or mini?', 'answer': "Myself I got the original instead of the mini. The reason I decided to go with the original is because its bigger but not as big as a crib. As far as the mini I didn't see getting much use out of it because in size its comparable to the size of a standard bassinet I. Couldn't see paying twice as much for basicly the same thing. As far as the original goes it can be used for a playpen or when baby starts sitting up you can lower the bed part and with the mini it does not have this option. As far as price the orginal cost a little more but overall I thought it was a better choice. Best wishes."}
