{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B0001D12XA', 'answerTime': 'Oct 7, 2008', 'unixTime': 1223362800, 'question': 'Can you attach a baby mobile to this co-sleeper or any play yard? Can a baby mobile be easily attached to this co-sleeper or any play yard?', 'answer': "You can't attach a mobile to a play yard or co-sleeper. The mobiles have a sort of nut and bolt design that you have to screw through the gaps in the rails on the crib to attach. Hope that makes sense, it's hard to explain. You can buy a canopy with a mobile to go with the co-sleeper, and some play yards come with mobiles, but with both they are nothing fancy."}
