{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B00073HJG8', 'answerTime': 'Sep 3, 2013', 'unixTime': 1378191600, 'question': 'I misplaced the instruction manual. I have no idea why the plastic things are provided with metal hooks . Need to know steps to install hammock .', 'answer': 'The plastic pieces are to tap into the drywall if you are not screwing the hooks directly into a stud. Once the plastic pieces are tapped into the drywall, you screw the metal hooks into the plastic pieces.'}
