{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B00081MHJI', 'answerTime': 'Feb 5, 2015', 'unixTime': 1423123200, 'question': 'What is the weight that this restraint will hold? E.g, how do I know if my dresser is too heavy?', 'answer': "Honestly, I wouldn't trust these to hold a dresser unless you put 4 or more on. And by that point, you've messed up your dresser and the wall way more than you need to. You are better off going to an actual store and paying a little more for good quality. I only use mine for a small, short book/toy shelf and my daughters wooden shelves that hold her toy bins. Nothing heavy. I don't trust them."}
