{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B000A6OLM2', 'answerTime': 'Aug 31, 2013', 'unixTime': 1377932400, 'question': 'I tried using my blender, but the food was still too chunky. Does this baby food processor blend the food to a fine puree?', 'answerType': '?', 'answer': "This is a nice unit that will do a reasonable job. However, for a bit more money, the Cuisinart model DLC-2A will do a much better job of pureeing in less time. And it is a 3-cup capacity instead of the 2-cup capacity of the Kidco. Plus it's available in colors."}
