{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B000A88JZU', 'answerTime': 'Oct 2, 2013', 'unixTime': 1380697200, 'question': 'how are these different than baby wipes or baby face wipes?', 'answer': 'These wipes are made specifically to disinfect and clean breast pumps. They can be used on manual or electric breast pump parts. They use a cleanser that doesn\'t need to be washed off, making it easier to clean your pump parts at work or on the go. Regular wipes or baby face wipes will clean the visible debris off the pump parts but not really "clean" them :)'}
