{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B000BV9Q80', 'answerTime': 'Dec 26, 2013', 'unixTime': 1388044800, 'question': 'Can you provide some more detail about what the foam in the mattress is made of? What materials are used?', 'answer': 'Of course not, but I also believe she deserves a good nights sleep, and this did not provide that for her! Way too FIRM! As I said before, she might as well have been sleeping on a slab of concrete. My child deserves both the most comfortable, as well as a safe design. This product may be safe, but does not meet the standards for any type of comfort.'}
{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B000BW51UQ', 'answerTime': 'Dec 12, 2013', 'unixTime': 1386835200, 'question': "There's another set on Amazon that sells for over $40. Is the only difference the canvas bag?", 'answerType': 'Y', 'answer': 'Yes, the Uncle Goose block sets are the same except for the roughly $30 dollar set is just 28 blocks and the approximately $40 set come with a canvas storage bag. There is also a $50 option and the 28 blocks come in a pull cart for storage. Just be careful when you order to get the language you want, the blocks also come in Spanish, French, Hebrew, Arabic, Braille and others. These are really good quality blocks like when I was little.'}
{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B000BW51UQ', 'answerTime': 'Sep 26, 2012', 'unixTime': 1348642800, 'question': 'Is this lower-case set or upper-case set, or both? From the product description I am not clear whether this is the 28 blocks lower-case set, or upper-case set, or both set (56 blocks)?', 'answer': 'Upper case only. There are multiple letters on each block (in different "fonts") plus animal pictures.'}
{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B000BW51UQ', 'answerTime': 'Dec 17, 2012', 'unixTime': 1355731200, 'question': "Are the corners and edges rounded, or are they sharp? Can't find a definitive statement.", 'answer': 'The corners and edges are sharp, but not enough to cause injury. My 2 yr old has been playing with them for almost a year and after all of the use the edges have become smoother. I recommend this product, great quality'}
