{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B000BXHPEU', 'answerTime': 'Feb 2, 2015', 'unixTime': 1422864000, 'question': 'Is there any problems with boys with this not having a pee guard', 'answerType': '?', 'answer': "We did not have any more issues with the Primo Folding potty than we did with our built in seat reducer at home. My son needed to be reminded to 'tuck' before he started to pee. It is a fairly small seat so we used it for about a month when he was first trained but now we no longer need a reducer since he is more accustomed to toilets in general."}
