{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B000CP2X9O', 'answerTime': 'May 26, 2014', 'unixTime': 1401087600, 'question': 'Are these bibs good for introducing solids? Will they fit a 6 month old?', 'answer': "I had started using these bibs when my baby was 4 months old(they were a little big) and now she's 8 months and fit fine. Still room to grow (she's on the petite side) but I would think they'd fit your 6 month old pretty well. As for solids, you just have to be careful of food that can stain - i.e. blueberries on a light colored bib, if you don't rinse off right away, there can be a stain. I didn't do that with one of the orange bibs and now there's a little dark stain where avocado was! but not big deal since there's 9 other bibs!"}
