{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B000F0DX7C', 'answerTime': 'Apr 14, 2014', 'unixTime': 1397458800, 'question': 'do you have also buy an installation kit?', 'answerType': '?', 'answer': 'No. It comes with everything you need except the drill and screwdriver. It works really well and is easy to take down when not in use. But, you need to install it carefully to be sure it fits the opening correctly and is adjusted top and bottom. Also, if the stairs are is used guests they will always have to ask how to use the latch. We are very hapy with it.'}
