{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B000F1O8JI', 'answerTime': 'Jan 21, 2014', 'unixTime': 1390291200, 'question': 'What are the washing instructions? And the Amazon listing says it is made in the USA...is that true?', 'answer': "I removed the pillows that are on each side and the lap belt. I washed it on warm and dried it on medium with the rest of his clothing. I have washed it many times in the last year and it comes out perfect still. I love this product and my son likes the pillows at each side to lean against. The toy attachments is a great feature, as is the pocket behind the seat. This product fits every cart I have ever put it into. I would recommend this product to any mother. I leave it in the car to take with us everywhere we go. This product was great when my son was at the age where he would chew on anything, knowing he didn't put his mouth on a filthy cart handle made it worth it to me. The support pillows also helped to keep my son upright and safe in a cart. This product is of good quality and in my opinion worth the money I paid. After a year I am still very happy with my purchase of this product."}
{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B000F1O8JI', 'answerTime': 'Mar 1, 2014', 'unixTime': 1393660800, 'question': 'What is the starting age for use of this cover?', 'answer': "There is no starting age it's just when you feel your baby is ready & able to almost sit on their own. Because the sides help support so they don't fully have to able to sit up on their own. It's all up to the parent to decide."}
{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B000F1O8JI', 'answerTime': 'Feb 5, 2013', 'unixTime': 1360051200, 'question': 'can this fit on a high chair?', 'answerType': 'Y', 'answer': 'You could. We used it at a restaurant and removed the pillows on the side so it would fit. There was a lot of fabric flopping over the edge, but it still worked great!'}
{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B000F1O8JI', 'answerTime': 'Jul 6, 2013', 'unixTime': 1373094000, 'question': "I'd like to know if this can be folded easily? and is it small enough to fit in a diaper bag?", 'answer': "It doesn't really 'fold', it kinda rolls up and you secure it with the Velcro strap. The two plush sides prevent you from folding it. It will not fit in a diaper bag, but the strap allows you to carry it like one. I love it though. It keeps my little one secure and it has the cover that goes over the handle of the cart, which is great because that's the first place my baby puts his mouth. It also has two straps to attach toys to keep them occupied. The downside is that it will not fit in a high chair because of the padded bumpers on each side."}
{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B000F1O8JI', 'answerTime': 'Apr 11, 2014', 'unixTime': 1397199600, 'question': "I like the pouch in back and the strap in front, but 18mo old doesn't need the side support. Can you (and would you) use it without the side pillows?", 'answerType': 'Y', 'answer': 'Yes, you can take the pillows out, but your little one might like them because they are soft.'}
