{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B000F1O8JI', 'answerTime': 'Jun 18, 2013', 'unixTime': 1371538800, 'question': 'Can you use this for high chairs at restaurants?', 'answerType': 'Y', 'answer': 'Yes I have done that and it fits in high chairs beautifully. You just have to take the side pillows out first.'}
