{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B000FGG8TG', 'answerTime': 'Jun 30, 2011', 'unixTime': 1309417200, 'question': 'Proposition 65 warning: Does anyone know why there is a CA proposition 65 warning posted with this product (see under Product Details)?', 'answer': 'I contacted The First Years, and here is a portion of their response: "I can assure you that our Products have met and exceed all safety standards and regulations and this is an incorrect warning posted on Amazon. We have been in contact with them and will be removing the warning on this product from the website." Although the statement about "safety standards and regulations" is meaningless, they do directly say that Amazon is in error. Since Amazon has a history of this problem with some baby products, I\'m pretty confident that The First Years is correct and telling the truth.'}
