{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B000FT9J3K', 'answerTime': 'Jan 27, 2011', 'unixTime': 1296115200, 'question': 'When did you lower the mattress? When did you lower the mattress height?', 'answer': "I think we lowered the mattress when our son was able to reach up and grab the bumper - we anticipated that he would be pulling up - sometime before he pulled up on the sides. My second son is 4 months and hasn't rolled over yet, so we haven't lowered it yet. If you have to ask yourself twice, that usually means just do it! You'll feel better. What's it going to hurt? It's better to lower it too early than too late."}
{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B000FT9J3K', 'answerTime': 'Dec 1, 2010', 'unixTime': 1291190400, 'question': 'Please help with a mobile that fits this crib: Can someone please share the name of a baby mobile that fits on this crib?', 'answer': 'Well, this may be way too late judging by the post date but my Fisher Price Precious Planet 2-in-1 Projection Mobile fits perfectly.'}
{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B000FT9J3K', 'answerTime': 'Jan 2, 2015', 'unixTime': 1420185600, 'question': 'What is included with this purchase? Are all parts included to convert from crib to toddler bed to day bed to full size?', 'answer': "You should look for description. If I understand correctly it has the part to convert the crib to toddler bed, but you have to order one more part to convert to full size (sold separately). I've bought the bed about 7 months ago and that part was available at Amazon also then."}
{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B000FT9J08', 'answerTime': 'Apr 13, 2014', 'unixTime': 1397372400, 'question': 'When the mattress platform is at the lowest position what is the height from the platform to the top of the side railing?', 'answer': "Ours measures 27 and 5/16 inches from the platform at it's lowest position to the top of the side rail. Hope that helps."}
{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B000FT9J08', 'answerTime': 'Sep 29, 2014', 'unixTime': 1411974000, 'question': 'How many mattress positions are there to choose from? Or can you adjust the height to wherever you want?', 'answer': 'HI, There are 4 Mattress Height Positions to choose from. Let me know if you still have any questions. Rishy'}
