{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B000FT9J08', 'answerTime': 'Aug 20, 2014', 'unixTime': 1408518000, 'question': 'Is this crib JPMA certified? Does it really matter if it isnt?', 'answer': 'JPMA standards include appropriate spacing between crib slats and structural stability. This crib, although not officially endorsed by JPMA, abides by the slat spaces and is very sturdy. I read many, many reviews on cribs and I was pleased with what customers had to say about this one in particular. We are very happy with this product. I believe it was made in Australia. Personally, I would ignore certifications as long as the product meets them.'}
{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B000FT9J08', 'answerTime': 'Feb 14, 2015', 'unixTime': 1423900800, 'question': 'What is the exact measurement length wise. From the outside edge to the other outside edge length. I have a 41" space to put it in. Thank you.', 'answer': "it is 40 inches long 28 inches across and 34 inches high if the space is 41 inches you would have to build it in that spot because moving it won't be an option. and it may not rock unless you have more then 35 inches of floor space for it to rock back and forth."}
{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B000FT9J08', 'answerTime': 'Feb 17, 2014', 'unixTime': 1392624000, 'question': 'I just purchased this crib along with the Naturepedic mattress, but it is too large. What mattress besides the Davinci mattresses work with this?', 'answer': 'I purchesed the "Dream on me 3" spring coil portable crib mattress." it was perfect!!!'}
{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B000FT9J08', 'answerTime': 'May 28, 2013', 'unixTime': 1369724400, 'question': 'Is this crib 16 CFR 1220 compliant?', 'answerType': 'Y', 'answer': 'As far as I found: Yes. All juvenile products are required by federal law to abide by the rules of the CPSC (Consumer Product Safety Commission) in order for them to be sold to consumers. They are manufactured to comply with the federal guidelines and standards set forth by the CPSC, as well as the ASTM (American Society of Testing Materials)"'}
{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B000FT9J08', 'answerTime': 'Mar 13, 2014', 'unixTime': 1394694000, 'question': 'Do the two side panels have plastic teething rails (The manual says they have, but my two orders, including a replacement, do not have)?', 'answerType': '?', 'answer': 'mine did not come with teething rails'}
{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B000FT9J08', 'answerTime': 'Oct 5, 2010', 'unixTime': 1286262000, 'question': 'Wheels? In the picture, it looks like there are wheels on the bottom?', 'answer': "it comes with 4 casters you can use or not. if you put them in, the crib will not rock. there is also a small piece that you can use to lock it into a stationary position so it won't just rock while your little one is sleeping."}
{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B000FT9J08', 'answerTime': 'Jul 1, 2012', 'unixTime': 1341126000, 'question': 'sheets and bedding: What bedding fits the mini crib????', 'answer': '24" by 38" are the size of the sheets for this bed if you have a 3" mattress and not just the pad. The pad is not good it\'s a thin pad. Mattress is necessary. Amazon has mini crib sheets gerber does too.'}
{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B000FT9J3U', 'answerTime': 'Dec 18, 2013', 'unixTime': 1387353600, 'question': 'Can anyone recommend an organic mattress that will fit this? I found an LA BAby that said organic, but it was just the cover. Thanks.', 'answerType': '?', 'answer': 'We went with Naturepedic Organic Cotton Portacrib Mattress. The filling is organic cotton. The waterproof lining is polyethylene, rather than PVC. The fit to the DaVinci crib is perfect.'}
