{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B000FT9J3U', 'answerTime': 'Aug 5, 2013', 'unixTime': 1375686000, 'question': 'Can this be converted to a toddler bed as well?', 'answerType': '?', 'answer': 'I still use it as a crib, but it is supposed to be able to convert to a twin size bed when you purchase the conversion rails. They cost about 85.00 I believe. This I am sure of.'}
