{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B000FTD1PM', 'answerTime': 'Sep 17, 2013', 'unixTime': 1379401200, 'question': 'can eight month old baby sleep in it?', 'answerType': '?', 'answer': 'Most likely, no. If your baby is starting to sit up & pull up on things, I would be afraid that he or she would fall out of it. The cradle was ideal for my baby when he was first born until he started getting more mobile. Hope this helps.'}
