{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B000FTD1PM', 'answerTime': 'Dec 14, 2014', 'unixTime': 1418544000, 'question': 'inches between rungs?', 'answer': 'I assume by "rung" you mean the vertical rods on the two side panels (the ones to the right and left side of a lying baby). I just measured it with a tape. The inner distance between the rungs is 1/8" less than 2" (i.e. 15/18 inches). Thickness of each rung is 1/8" less than an inch.'}
