{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B000FTD1PM', 'answerTime': 'Feb 15, 2014', 'unixTime': 1392451200, 'question': 'How long can I put my baby in this Cradle? Can I use this until the baby is an year old ?', 'answer': 'I would say it depends on the weight of your baby, but not for a year. I feel they are made for you to use for the first couple months in your room until you transition them into their own room in their baby bed. Hope this helps'}
{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B000FTD1RA', 'answerTime': 'May 14, 2013', 'unixTime': 1368514800, 'question': 'Does the bed includes one or two side rails? All customer images show two rails.', 'answer': 'yes they come with 2 side rails'}
{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B000FTD1RA', 'answerTime': 'Nov 17, 2013', 'unixTime': 1384675200, 'question': 'Does it come with the mattress?', 'answerType': '?', 'answer': 'No, but a standard crib mattress fits.'}
{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B000FTD1RA', 'answerTime': 'Dec 15, 2013', 'unixTime': 1387094400, 'question': 'too high', 'answer': "The bed is pretty low to the floor so there shouldn't be worry of your toddler falling out. It comes with two guards so that it reflects that of a crib but easy to get in and out of. To be on the safe side, I purchased a cheap area carpet and placed it beside the bed to assure that my daughter wouldn't injure herself. She is a wild sleeper and so far she hasn't had any spills out of the bed. No worries!"}
{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B000FTD1RA', 'answerTime': 'Dec 31, 2014', 'unixTime': 1420012800, 'question': 'Could someone tell me how high is the side rail, the shorter side. The dimentions of it.', 'answer': 'The "short" sides are 23.5 inches in height and 29.5 inches in "width" (the back of the bed to the front). I know you didn\'t ask for the front rail but just so that you know it comes with 2 rails. So, essentially you can have a guard rail on the right or left side of the bed. But it is 19.25 inches high. Hope this helps!'}
{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B000FTD1RA', 'answerTime': 'Jan 7, 2015', 'unixTime': 1420617600, 'question': 'Can you use crib bumpers with this bed?', 'answerType': 'Y', 'answer': 'Yes, but its awkward and loose. I ended up threading a rolled comforter through the slats which worked fine.'}
