{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B000FTD1RA', 'answerTime': 'Jan 27, 2013', 'unixTime': 1359273600, 'question': 'How high is the top of thew mattress (or mattress support) off the ground? And how high is the lower side rail above that?', 'answer': "Honestly, I wouldn't buy this bed if I were you the craftsmanship is horrible. The wood split when I was assembling it it was damaged when it came to my house and I'm constantly having to tighten the screws because they always seem to work themselves out. This bed served its purpose and the price wasn't bad but I will be replacing it with a regular bed soon. To answer your question the mattress is about 6-8 inches off the ground and the lower bedrail is like 1ft to 1.5 ft off the ground."}
