{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B000FXW24O', 'answerTime': 'Jul 16, 2014', 'unixTime': 1405494000, 'question': 'is this spring loaded ?', 'answerType': 'Y', 'answer': 'Yes this is spring loaded. You can turn the lock a quarter turn to keep in in the unlocked position if desired. If not set at a quarter turn the spring will automatically lock when the door us put back in the closed position.'}
