{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B000G1YW98', 'answerTime': 'Oct 21, 2013', 'unixTime': 1382338800, 'question': 'Is the 6 or 8 panel sturdier? Or are they about the same?', 'answer': "I have the 6 panel and it it pretty sturdy. They all will move a little because they aren't tied down to anything. My 11-3/4 month old granddaughter tries to climb up the side and it holds pretty steady. The other grandmother has the 8 panel and seems to be as steady. They will move just slightly. I feel it is safe. As always you have to check regularly. I am very pleased."}
