{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B000G7NKXQ', 'answerTime': 'Aug 3, 2014', 'unixTime': 1407049200, 'question': 'The bottom of my Graco Pack n play broke. Can this fit in a Graco Pack n Play and will it work as a replacement pad for the bottom?', 'answer': "If you mean that the firm, fold up piece that typically lays in the bottom of the packnplay broke and is unusable, then yes, you can then use this. I would use the bottom piece and then put this mattress atop that, but you don't necessarily need that flat bottom. As long as the nylon on the actual bottom of your packnplay is still in contact and can support/keep this mattress in place."}
{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B000G7TIZA', 'answerTime': 'Sep 29, 2013', 'unixTime': 1380438000, 'question': 'Does the changing pad need to be secured if used on top of a dresser?', 'answerType': '?', 'answer': "I'm sure for the best protection of the baby it is designed to do that. I have mine on top of the dresser and it's not attached to the dresser I always keep a hand on my child while changing him and it hasn't been a problem whatsoever"}
{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B000G7TIZA', 'answerTime': 'Mar 24, 2014', 'unixTime': 1395644400, 'question': 'Will any changing pad cover work on this product?', 'answerType': '?', 'answer': "I have 2 different covers and both fit. One is a Carter's dot and the other is from amazon."}
{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B000G7TIZA', 'answerTime': 'Mar 4, 2014', 'unixTime': 1393920000, 'question': 'Is this product safely made?', 'answerType': 'N', 'answer': "Not sure what you mean by safely, but it has worked well for us for the past 8 months. There are straps that you are supposed to attach to the back of the dresser/changing table. I found that many people don't do this and the changing pad could slide off. We attached ours and it works very well and is safe."}
{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B000G7TIZA', 'answerTime': 'Mar 17, 2014', 'unixTime': 1395039600, 'question': 'Does this pad have hard surface or is it pretty soft? Thanks!', 'answer': 'It is firm and holds it shape. Its soft enough for my baby to be comfortable but not plush.'}
