{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B000G80O4I', 'answerTime': '19 days ago', 'question': 'Does the crotch post come off on the newer model also? And does this come with the tray as of 2015', 'answerType': '?', 'answer': 'Hello, and thank you for your question. The crotch post is not removable. The Flair Chair includes a tray with a removable tray liner. Thank you!'}
{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B000G80O4I', 'answerTime': '26 days ago', 'question': "Does the white have a cool greenish tinge to it? I've seen pics of the white with the white seat cover and they look like two dif. shades of white.", 'answerType': '?', 'answer': 'Hello and thank you for your question! Currently, the Flair seat base comes is available in two color options as seen on the detail page: white or gray. Depending upon the color combination you choose, you will receive either a white base or a gray base. The white base does not have a greenish tinge. Thank you!'}
{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B000G80O4I', 'answerTime': 'Apr 16, 2015', 'unixTime': 1429167600, 'question': 'What is the diameter of the base? I want to know if it has a smaller than other highchairs as we live in a small space.', 'answer': "No idea about the actual diameter width (as we don't have this anymore), but I do remember it is pretty large, prob larger than the space a regular high chair takes up. But, it's an awesome high chair! I had 2, used with my twins and LOVED it."}
