{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B000G82GO4', 'answerTime': 'Jan 29, 2014', 'unixTime': 1390982400, 'question': "it hangs too low for our 5 month old. and the adjustment is at it's highest setting. what are we missing?", 'answer': 'Hi Dave, We initially had the same problem... those poor little feet. However, if you look at page 10 of the Owner\'s Manual the instructions (and diagrams) state "Pull on small loop until the sewn end of the loop passes through the adjustment buckle. Continue to pull out the small loop until the strap is the proper length". We fiddled around with this for a while until we figured out how it worked. I was a bit confusing to say the least! Our 5 month old absolutely loves this toy now. Hope this helps. Lynn'}
