{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B000GEC1K2', 'answerTime': 'Aug 21, 2014', 'unixTime': 1408604400, 'question': 'Most of the customer reviews for this product mention the kit only contains the rails and NO slats. Can you please confirm if the kit includes 3 metal', 'answer': "Does not include slats. They're not needed either. The rails have a small lip on them which a box spring will fit on."}
{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B000GEC1K2', 'answerTime': 'Jun 13, 2014', 'unixTime': 1402642800, 'question': "Can you use slats instead of a box spring with this kit? I'd like to keep the bed lower to the ground.", 'answerType': '?', 'answer': 'The kit comes with three metal slats (horizantal bars) and it makes it sturdy. It will be possible to put more wooden slats if required. There is no beam in the center that would come in your way. The two "X" bars in the center connects to the horizontal bars at the bottom of the horizontal bars and so they also wont cause issues.'}
