{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B000H4C6NI', 'answerTime': 'Oct 4, 2013', 'unixTime': 1380870000, 'question': "Are these the ones with 5 bars? There are three different models for this size window and it doesn't say if this is the 5 bar model.", 'answerType': '?', 'answer': "Best advise: email/call the seller. All the sellers use the same stock photo, so it's not the actual product you are looking to buy. Secondly, I found some of the sellers fudged on the item measurements, so that wasn't a reliable method of determining bar number or size. Get it straight from the donkey's mouth or you might not get what you want and be saddled with a restocking fee. This is coming from experience. FYI: we did this with the second seller we worked with, and got the right size, and we love this product. It's worth the extra money over the other brands."}
