{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B000HK6BCE', 'answerTime': 'Jul 24, 2013', 'unixTime': 1374649200, 'question': '2 questions: Does this come with 2 rails or do you need buy buy 2 of these? Also does it really need a box spring bed? I have a queen size bed support frame (flat wood planks 3-5 inches apart going across left to right that suports the matress only)...', 'answer': "yes, it comes with 2 rails, so no need to buy anything else. Regarding the box spring question, you do not have to have a box spring, BUT you do need a flat hard surface. I don't think the wood planks are enough. Maybe you could put a piece of wood in place of the planks in the area of the rails. I have not tried this, because I have a box spring, but from looking at how they work, it would be my opinion and I would try that. If it doesn't work, then you would have to return them and look for something more compatible with your bed."}
