{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B000HK6BCE', 'answerTime': 'Dec 30, 2013', 'unixTime': 1388390400, 'question': "Do these lift up the mattress enough to make the middle sag, as one reviewer said? I'm about to drop some serious $ on an organic mattress...", 'answerType': 'Y', 'answer': 'It doesn\'t "sag" but there are probably indents where the bars go under the mattress. I\'ve laid on my daughter\'s bed and you can\'t feel anything different.'}
