{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B000HKY1GM', 'answerTime': 'Jul 1, 2013', 'unixTime': 1372662000, 'question': "Has anyone found a different mattress that fits this mini cosleeper? I don't like the lumps and creases from the mattress being folded around it.", 'answerType': '?', 'answer': 'I used my contoured changing table mattress and used the changing pad covers as the sheets. He loved his changing table, so thats where I got my idea! :) You can buy them seperately almost anywhere, we got ours at Target. (p.s. they sell them on Amazon too).'}
