{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B000HZEQSU', 'answerTime': 'Nov 1, 2013', 'unixTime': 1383289200, 'question': 'Can the foam part of the pillow be washed?', 'answerType': 'Y', 'answer': "As far as I'm aware...no. However, I had my mom make a simple waterproof slip cover over the part if the pillow where my little feeds. It prevents the foam from getting any milk on it. Before I had the slip cover, I just put a receiving blanket or a cloth diaper down before I put my little one on. Hope this helps!"}
