{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B000I5UZ1Q', 'answerTime': 'Mar 19, 2008', 'unixTime': 1205910000, 'question': 'Has anyone had problems with the motor failing? Has anyone else experienced this same problem?', 'answer': "Yes, we've been using our swing for 7 months and our motor just went today. I called fisher price service center at 1800-432-5437 and they 're sending us a new motor housing for free. All swings are covered for 1 year. When you call have the product# and the date code ready. They can be found on the motor housing opposite side of the battery compartment. They're going to send our part out tomorrow and I should get it in 7-10 business days. If your swing is older than a year, you can order the motor housing at www.service.fisher-price.com for $25.00 NOT including shipping. I hope this helps you!"}
