{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B000KL0G9Y', 'answerTime': 'Dec 11, 2013', 'unixTime': 1386748800, 'question': 'wood', 'answer': "It's a very well made solid piece of furniture. The sides and shelves have a lovely finish, the only obvious press wood is the back panel which still has the nice finish and serves as a fine background when you are filling your shelves with books, etc. also, the shelves are sturdy enough to hold the load of a full row of hardcove books. I've been happy with this shelf for several years and wish I could find a spot to put another one. Great price for a great looking piece. Go for it!"}
