{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B000KL2HCI', 'answerTime': 'Feb 16, 2015', 'unixTime': 1424073600, 'question': "Will this fit the DaVinci Autumn crib? It is not listed, but I can't find a conversion kit that specifies it works with Autumn. Am so confused!", 'answerType': '?', 'answer': "If your specific crib is not listed, do not buy this product. I purchased it, sent it to my kids for use with a crib not listed. It didn't have the brackets needed. I contacted the vendor and asked for extra brackets. They referred me to the manufacturer, giving me a phone number that didn't work. When I told them that, they said they had no other suggestions. Therefore, if YOUR crib is NOT listed for these rails, don't buy them and expect them to work or to obtain ANY support from the vendor if they don't work. Ultimately, I wasted my money and had to buy something else."}
{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B000KU5A9G', 'answerTime': 'Jun 16, 2014', 'unixTime': 1402902000, 'question': "Will this pad fit on the Ikea Gulliver changing table? I'm looking for a 4-sided changing pad to fit the table.", 'answerType': 'Y', 'answer': 'Let me Google that for you! The Gulliver measures 32.25" wide and 21.25" deep. This pad measures 30x16". It seems like that would leave just a little wiggle room on the small side but be snug on the long side. The pad has two canvas straps to bolt into the surface on which it rests, so if the wiggle bothered you, it would be easy to secure it to the changing table.'}
