{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B000LEI82W', 'answerTime': 'Aug 20, 2012', 'unixTime': 1345446000, 'question': 'Can I use this stroller frame for a Graco Safeseat and a Chicco Ketfit seat? I have two different infant seats and was wondering if anyone has experience using seats from different manufacterers in this stroller frame?', 'answer': "The Chicco seat really doesn't work with anything other than a Chicco stroller due to the locking mechanism on the seat itself. The stroller frame does have straps you can use but again, your Chicco carseat won't be locked down so you will be relying only on the straps. My Graco seats worked very well with this stroller, though."}
