{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B000LMS482', 'answerTime': 'Jul 5, 2014', 'unixTime': 1404543600, 'question': 'Does this work with the Diono Radian RXT?', 'answerType': '?', 'answer': "Probably not. The tray needs to rest on the sides of the car seat and it looks like this car seat's sides don't come up far enough. Otherwise it will be resting on the child's legs."}
{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B000LMS482', 'answerTime': 'Sep 30, 2014', 'unixTime': 1412060400, 'question': 'will it work on Graco Nautilus 3 in 1?', 'answerType': '?', 'answer': "It should. The tray sits on either the arms of the car seat or on the child's lap. The strap runs under the child's seat, following the seatbelt/LATCH path. I used it on a Graco ComfortSport and a Cosco booster seat."}
{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B000LMS482', 'answerTime': 'Jun 18, 2014', 'unixTime': 1403074800, 'question': 'Can you use this on a rear facing car seat?', 'answerType': '?', 'answer': "Not really. The tray extends beyond the leading edge of the baby seat, so it would not fit comfortably onto a rear facing seat due to the proximity of the back of the car's seats."}
