{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B000LNHTZK', 'answerTime': 'Dec 4, 2007', 'unixTime': 1196755200, 'question': 'Suitable as a bassinet? Is it comfortable or safe enough?', 'answer': 'We have a similar pack n play from Graco with the bassinet and yes I think it would work fine. I put my little one down for naps in it. I use a sleep positioner wedge to keep her in place in it and to make it cozier. Ours came with a diaper changing area too which is so handy!'}
