{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B000ME3146', 'answerTime': 'Oct 16, 2013', 'unixTime': 1381906800, 'question': "I'm a first time mom so very new to breast pumps - what parts of this pump do you need to wash/clean after pumping? Thanks!", 'answer': 'I wash the bottles, flanges, white rubber pieces that fit at the base of the flange and the cylindrical pieces that fit at the top of the flange. Otherwise, nothing else needs to be washed. Do not clean the thin tubes or white plastic pieces. The pump should include an instruction booklet as well.'}
