{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B000NSBBIY', 'answerTime': 'May 30, 2014', 'unixTime': 1401433200, 'question': "How much does your coffee slosh out with this, if it's not self-leveling? It's a major problem with our Baby Jogger handlebar caddy.", 'answer': "I think it depends on the coffee cup/copntainer. This has internal 'prongs' so to speak that squeeze around the cup. If the coffee cup/travel mug isn't too tall, you should be fine. When we use a tall, skinny travel mug it can sometimes be top heavy and and bounce back and forth. It's a good product overall, though."}
