{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B000O1SHI2', 'answerTime': 'Apr 14, 2014', 'unixTime': 1397458800, 'question': 'does this come with the bassinet ?', 'answerType': '?', 'answer': 'It does not come with a bassinet- but it lays completely flat And the foot rest comes up- enclosing the baby on all sides. This was one reason that we chose it- less clutter more function....'}
