{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B000O7SR18', 'answerTime': 'Feb 14, 2014', 'unixTime': 1392364800, 'question': 'Will this fit the Babyhome Dream Cot? The fitted sheets that come with the mattress are horrible. Thanks!', 'answerType': 'Y', 'answer': 'Probably too late to help the orginal poster, but, yes, the sheet does fit the Dream Cot. It is a little big, but the elastic bottom allows you to fit it tighty across the top of the mattress and any extra fabric gathers below. Plus it shrinks a bit in the wash. Much easier than dealing with the disasterous BabyHome sheets and the jersey material is much softer.'}
