{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B000P24D92', 'answerTime': '2 days ago', 'question': 'I am looking for a stool to put in my shower stall to shave my legs. Not sure if this is high enough. Is 7" an accurate height?', 'answerType': 'Y', 'answer': "I'd say it's about 7 1/4 inches tall. I have several of these...use them for my 2 & 4 year old grandkids. We have highboy toilets, so it makes it easier for them to get on/off the toilets. I also have additional ones that we use for side tables beside their kid sized chairs to put a snack and drink on while watching T.V. They are sturdy and have rubber grippers on the bottom. Worth the money!"}
