{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B000P9TK0W', 'answerTime': 'Sep 26, 2014', 'unixTime': 1411714800, 'question': 'I just tried to use this and the flange was too small. Can you get bigger flanges for this?', 'answerType': 'Y', 'answer': 'I read this online. Looks like you can use different sizes but it has to be the Lansinoh brand to ensure a proper fit. "Convenient and portable, the Lansinoh Manual Breast Pump is ideal for occasional use at home or away. The two pumping modes, Stimulation and Expression, help you gather more milk in less time while the ergonomic easy-express handle reduces hand fatigue. It\'s the ONLY pump to include two sizes of flanges, standard (25mm) and large (30.5mm), to ensure a perfect fit."'}
