{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B000PY9R4G', 'answerTime': 'May 31, 2014', 'unixTime': 1401519600, 'question': 'How does the sizing work for this? Does it depend on the size of the baby or the size of the wearer?', 'answer': "It's based on the size of the wearer. The wrap is very adjustable and it's in the nature of it being woven that it will soften up/break in as you use it and therefore adjust as your kiddo weighs more. We love ours and wore it from the time our little one was about a month and still do now that she is 7 months. We got a large because my husband and I are both just under 6' and average size; and I wanted a long tale to allow for for privacy when breast feeding."}
