{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B000RHJT6C', 'answerTime': 'Oct 22, 2012', 'unixTime': 1350889200, 'question': 'What is the length an diameter size of each roll??', 'answer': 'Hi, I have the travel version. Each full roll has a diameter of just over 1.25 inches, but under 1.5 inches, and a height of 2.25 inches. Each bag opens up to be 12 inches by about 15 inches. With 12 bags in each roll it would be about 180 inches in length if you unrolled the entire roll. Hope that answers your question.'}
