{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B000RJ9TCY', 'answerTime': 'Jun 13, 2014', 'unixTime': 1402642800, 'question': 'Do I still need regular crib sheets on top of the quick zip crib sheet?', 'answerType': 'N', 'answer': 'No, this serves as the only sheet you need. I would suggest a mattress pad laid underneath, of course. Just the flat sheet type of mattress pad, not the fitted type. Buy an extra zip sheet!'}
{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B000RJ9TCY', 'answerTime': 'Aug 11, 2013', 'unixTime': 1376204400, 'question': "Won't you still have to remove the underlying mattress pad when a leak occurs? which would be a hassle. how do these sheets save time?", 'answer': "As a first time mom I can tell you honestly that these sheets rock! My daughter is now 15 months. When she did have explosions as a baby, I just unzipped the top part, and then took off the cover underneath. Then I laid a new cover on top and rezipped a new sheet. I bought a 2 set of Carter's Keep Me Dry Flannel Bassinet Pads. And then I bought the full set of these sheets and then 2 extra sheets. How does it save time? My friends have to lift the full crib mattress up to change sheets when they get soaked. I do not know about you, but I cannot lift my daughters mattress by myself. These sheets have the zippers on top. It literally takes all of 10 seconds to unzip the top sheet and then you just put another one on. Super simple, especially at 2 am."}
{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B000RJ9TCY', 'answerTime': 'Dec 14, 2014', 'unixTime': 1418544000, 'question': 'What did you buy (brand and manufacturer) to put underneath the sheets to protect/waterproof the mattress?', 'answer': "I use a Babesafe Mattress wrap. Before that I used Carter's Keep Me Dry flannel mattress pads. They were perfect because they lay right on top and don't wrap around the edges. Now that the mattress is wrapped I don't use anything."}
{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B000RJ9TCY', 'answerTime': 'Feb 26, 2015', 'unixTime': 1424937600, 'question': 'Would it look strange to have a different color base sheet &amp; top sheet? I received sage sheets &amp; they clash with the wall color.', 'answerType': '?', 'answer': "Not at all! I got a pattern and solid sets but the colors are complimentary and it's kind of cute. All the patterns are really adorable it doesn't bother me at all."}
{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B000RJ9TCY', 'answerTime': 'Sep 27, 2014', 'unixTime': 1411801200, 'question': "Is this as safe as Zipsheets? I read the person's review how Zipsheets are better because they are waterproof, but is velcro safe?", 'answer': "You can use the zipper sheet with a flat waterproof mattress pad (without a skirt) to achieve the same result. Personally, I like the zipper sheet better than the Velcro as it goes on easier and there's no chance for the sheet to come loose. Plus I don't like washing anything with Velcro with my other things."}
