{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B000RJ9TCY', 'answerTime': 'Mar 24, 2014', 'unixTime': 1395644400, 'question': 'I have not received a sheet set yet, but was surprised by how little the top sheet seemed on the mattress. Is the zipper at the edge of the mattress?', 'answerType': '?', 'answer': 'The zipper is probably an inch or so in from the edge of the mattress. The bottom sheet goes around the mattress similar to putting on a mattress pad upside down. The zipper is there so you can remove the sheet easily without having to remove the bumper or take the mattress out of the crib. I have used these sheets for both my boys and LOVE them. Hope that helps!'}
{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B000RJ9TCY', 'answerTime': 'Jul 21, 2013', 'unixTime': 1374390000, 'question': "Has anyone used this with the Moonlight Slumber Little Dreamer mattress? I'm interested in the product but am not sure it will fit this mattress.", 'answerType': 'Y', 'answer': 'I have the Naturepedic crib mattress and I use those sheets. According to the dimensions listed online the naturepedic is 1 inch thicker than the one you have so you should be fine. LOVE LOVE LOVE these sheets! I use them for both my boys (both in cribs). It makes changing the crib bedding a breeze.'}
