{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B000U00VHM', 'answerTime': 'Jun 25, 2014', 'unixTime': 1403679600, 'question': "I'm looking for PREMIUM infant 4x6x4s and dont see the option listed. Are they the infant diapers with YELLOW or BLUE stitching?", 'answer': "Premium is the title for a size larger than infant (and with more layers than the regular)... Infant size is for 7-15lbs roughly, Regular and premium are for 15-30lb roughly but the premium has two layers more in the center than regular. The infant size has 4x6x4 and 4x8x4, so if you're looking for slightly more absorbency, then select the latter. The 4x6x4 has blue stitching, and the 4x8x4 has green stitching per osocozy site."}
