{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B000V3J7J6', 'answerTime': 'Aug 30, 2013', 'unixTime': 1377846000, 'question': 'Will this work with an elongated toilet seat ?', 'answerType': 'Y', 'answer': 'My toilet is elongated. It works fine but may be a little steadier with the round toilets. My son uses it fine, alone and never has a problem though. Hope that helps!'}
{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B000V3J7J6', 'answerTime': 'Jan 7, 2014', 'unixTime': 1389081600, 'question': 'what is the height of the step?', 'answer': '9 inches on its lowest setting. The step can be raised 1 more inch to 10 inches. The blue feet are adjustable about 2 inches for taller toilets.'}
{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B000V3J7J6', 'answerTime': 'Aug 1, 2013', 'unixTime': 1375340400, 'question': 'does this seat fit tall toilets and adjust to height of toilet?', 'answerType': 'Y', 'answer': 'Yes the legs adjust to height of toilet.'}
