{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B000VS4LBK', 'answerTime': 'Feb 6, 2013', 'unixTime': 1360137600, 'question': 'what kind of proudcts do this package include?', 'answer': 'It comes with three small bottles, one bigger bottle and one big sippy cup. It also has stage one and two flow nipples. All the parts are inter-changeable meaning when you start baby on sippy cups you can put the handle and sippy cup top on the smaller bottle or if you need another large bottle you can put a nipple on the sippy cup. When you baby is done with bottles you can buy the sippy cup tops seperatly and use them on the a containers as well wich will give you more mileage out of your original purchase.'}
{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B000VS4LBK', 'answerTime': 'Dec 18, 2012', 'unixTime': 1355817600, 'question': "does this set come with a bottle brush? There's no detail of what is included.", 'answerType': '?', 'answer': 'The set they sent me is completely different than what the box looks like. I kept them because I love the born free bottles, but my set had 3 of 5 oz bottles, 3 of 9 oz bottles, a large spongy brush and a small spongy brush and a little container for nipples. Not bad for the price so i kept it, but the gift set was supposed to be completely different. Hope this helps.'}
