{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B000WII9XA', 'answerTime': 'Jun 9, 2013', 'unixTime': 1370761200, 'question': 'Can the bassinet bumper be removed? Bumpers are a suffocation risk.', 'answerType': '?', 'answer': 'The bumper in the top bassinet portion cannot be removed as far as I know. But keep this in mind.. The baby cannot roll over until s/he is 3 months old.. And.. You if you look a bit closer you will see there is a mesh area where the babies head will be.. I used this product for our daughter (now 3yrs old) and I highly recommend it. Another perk is its on wheels and can be easily moved from room to room.. Good luck! Enjoy your precious bundle. :)'}
