{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B000WUD816', 'answerTime': 'Dec 9, 2007', 'unixTime': 1197187200, 'question': '25 pound weight limit accurate? Do you think the weight limit of 25 pounds is accurate?', 'answer': 'We brought our baby papasan swing down from the attic just before our second child was due, and our then 2 year old, (of course) wanted to get in the swing. After double checking the weight limit (ours says 24 lbs). We let her swing in it again as she was only 22 lbs. Shortly after, the motor broke..... could be a coincidence, but I doubt it. It worked fine before she got in it.'}
