{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B000XA6DC6', 'answerTime': 'Jun 30, 2014', 'unixTime': 1404111600, 'question': 'Does it wheel well?', 'answerType': 'Y', 'answer': 'The car seat carrier is great and wheels quite well. The only slight issue we had was for my husband with the strap that you use to pull it. My husband is tall and the strap is short so he has to bend down to pull it otherwise the carseat hits his leg. How we just clip it to our carry on and it works better. Just wanted to call out the short strap issue, I am 5\'2" and it is fine for me. Hope this helps!'}
