{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B000XP96VQ', 'answerTime': 'Feb 25, 2015', 'unixTime': 1424851200, 'question': 'Hoping to jog with this as my first jogging stroller. Is there a wrist strap? I see there is no hand brake. How important are these features?', 'answer': 'Love this stroller. No hand brake but there is a wrist strap. Very smooth and easy to maneuver.'}
