{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B000XPB6UU', 'answerTime': 'Mar 13, 2014', 'unixTime': 1394694000, 'question': 'My daughter has ALOT of toys, a pop up spongebob thing, a purple plastic tote and a small red pop up basket and im running over those LOL, will these 4 hold all of this?', 'answerType': 'Y', 'answer': "I imagine these could work quite well for kids toys as long as you don't put anything heavy in them. The range of sizes is good. The largest is surprisingly large, the smallest is rather small, so I bet between the four it would fit the items you described. They nest when collapsed and take up little space when not in use. I quite like these but have never used them for toys. I'm currently using a couple for my crochet yarn stash."}
