{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B000Y2GY40', 'answerTime': 'Nov 21, 2013', 'unixTime': 1385020800, 'question': 'Does the straw reach the bottom of the cup?', 'answerType': '?', 'answer': "It can. The straw is two parts, a softer clear part, and the hard white plastic part. You can control how far you insert the white part into the clear part, and thereby change how long or short the straw is somewhat. I would say you can't get every tiny last drop out of these cups, but it is better than most."}
