{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B000YDWCFE', 'answerTime': 'Jul 3, 2014', 'unixTime': 1404370800, 'question': "what' difference between duo and duo deluxe", 'answer': 'From the toys r us website: The Deluxe Edition diaper bag features the new Shuttle Clips; a unique strap and fastening system that allows the Skip Hop DUO to attach neatly and conveniently to the handlebars of any stroller and then convert into a cool, hip shoulder diaper bag. When attached to the stroller, you can leave the shoulder strap attached or remove it for a cleaner look. The Skip Hop Duo Deluxe Edition is 30% larger than the original Hope that helps.'}
