{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B000YDWCFE', 'answerTime': 'Feb 25, 2014', 'unixTime': 1393315200, 'question': 'Does the main compartment have any type of closure? What if it falls over? Also, does it stand up on its own? Thanks!', 'answer': "Yes, it has a magnetic closure. To be honest, the magnet is pretty strong -- as long as you don't stuff the bag. If you stack your things too high it will block the magnet; if you pack the center below it too full and wide, then the magnets won't meet and adhere to each other. The bag does not have a very wide base, plus it is tall, so those combined factors would make it more likely to tip over. However, I didnt have the bag long enough to see if it would tip over often. (I returned it due to it being too small for my needs.)"}
