{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B000YZ61UY', 'answerTime': 'Sep 15, 2008', 'unixTime': 1221462000, 'question': 'Evenflo X Sport Convenience Stroller and younger baby: Has anyone used this stroller for a child in this age range?', 'answer': "This stroller doesn't have five-point harness, only a three point across the lap. So if your son tends to still fold over in half I would be cautious. Of course, they develop so fast that first year, by the time you bought the thing, he might be sitting quite independantly and be strong enough to support his back for longer periods of time. This stoller does not recline at all."}
