{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B000Z3BT3Y', 'answerTime': 'Jan 25, 2014', 'unixTime': 1390636800, 'question': 'Just want to make sure re what size changing pad fits in there - is it inconvenient not having room for things on top like wipes?', 'answer': "It is a normal size changing pad that fits on there. I bought a holder that clips onto the side which held wipes and lotions, and after sometime I started putting it in the first drawer. It was fine that it didn't fit on there since there are so many other options. I love this dresser b/c once your child no longer needs to be changed anymore, you can remove the changing pad and it becomes a dresser. It also looks very clean and sleek."}
