{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B0010PW47Q', 'answerTime': 'Aug 30, 2013', 'unixTime': 1377846000, 'question': 'Has anyone bought a Ergo-baby that IS genuine? What about the ones that actually ship from Amazon and not other sellers?', 'answer': "I think I have bought a genuine. If you google how to tell the real ones. Mine has every thing it should, but it doesnt have stealth on the buckle. Now, I bought another Ergo from REI, and that is an authorized dealer. My REI ergo does not have stealth on it either. I've heard the newer ones don't have stealth on the buckle. In conclusion, I think mine is real that I bought directly from Amazon."}
