{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B0011UH78G', 'answerTime': 'Nov 16, 2011', 'unixTime': 1321430400, 'question': 'Medela Pump Compatible? Can you pump directly into these bags from the Medela system?', 'answer': "Yes, you use the liner ring, put a liner in, and put the pump adapter on and attach your pump. After pumping, remove the pump adapter and put a sealing ring on top. Great for pumping milk you're not going to freeze."}
{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B0011UH78G', 'answerTime': 'Jun 3, 2014', 'unixTime': 1401778800, 'question': 'whats in the box? what all comes in the box', 'answer': 'This box only comes with (6) maybe more storage rings which are the lids to the drop-in liners. It also comes with two breast pump adapter rings, which were perfect for my medela breastpump and I really want to say the box also included about (6) 4oz drop in liners.... Hope this helps Im past the bottle stage now but playtex was a great choice for both of my children.'}
