{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B0011UH78G', 'answerTime': 'Apr 15, 2014', 'unixTime': 1397545200, 'question': 'Is this compatible with the Hygeia Enjoye pump? The Hygeia pump base that connects to a bottle is wider than the Medela pump.', 'answerType': '?', 'answer': 'I know this probably will not help the person who asked this since it was so long ago, but I hope it can help someone reading these questions later. This system will work with the Hygeia Enjoye, but you do need to make some modifications. The adapter that comes with the Playtex system will not fit the flanges. The easiest fix is to order Modela flanges. Amazon has them at a very reasonable cost, and they are nice because they have customized fitting options.'}
