{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B0012BWUDQ', 'answerTime': 'Mar 6, 2014', 'unixTime': 1394092800, 'question': 'How well does this seat work for little boys sitting down? Do they end up spraying though and getting the floor and their clothes all wet?', 'answer': "Unfortunately yes, my son when sitting down sprays between the seats, and it spills over on toilet bowl unto floor. It's become habit to have wipes near toilet to clean up. Rarely has his clothes got wet from sitting down, it just spills over on bowl, just missing his pants. For my daughter is was perfect, we had no issues. They both felt comfortable and safe on the smaller seat and we were able to use the adult seat for us or our guests."}
