{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B0012DVLCA', 'answerTime': 'Oct 10, 2012', 'unixTime': 1349852400, 'question': 'what is the difference between Stokke Sleepi Crib prived $750 and Sleepi System priced $930?', 'answer': 'The Sleepi system comes with parts to create a mini crib and the larger crib. The other one is just the crib. I liked the mini crib because my babies were in my room for 4 months and the little crib fit nicely beside my bed. When they were old enough to move out of my room I just had to add some pieces. It was very easy to adjust it. (I did it with an allen wrench.) Hope that helps.'}
{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B0012E4FV8', 'answerTime': 'Jun 9, 2014', 'unixTime': 1402297200, 'question': 'Does it have a sticker proving is FAA approved?', 'answerType': '?', 'answer': 'Yes. Nice and big so you can show a flight attendant if asked. Although no one ever did.'}
