{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B0012S85ZQ', 'answerTime': 'Jun 10, 2014', 'unixTime': 1402383600, 'question': 'Will this connect on a Single BOB?', 'answerType': '?', 'answer': "I don't have a Bob, so I can't say for sure, but looking at a picture of one I think this should fit. The part that clips on to your stroller is generously sized with some adjusters to make it smaller. So as long as you have a horizontal bar to clip on, which it looks like bob does, it should work."}
{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B0012S85ZQ', 'answerTime': 'May 8, 2014', 'unixTime': 1399532400, 'question': 'Can you use this on a jogger stroller and be able to job or would it be in the way??', 'answer': "I would be very surprised if you could jog with this thing attached. Better to get a board that is easy stored in the up position. Or one that's easy to detach. It's rather weighty. Frankly, it's a pain, but I think that's just the nature of these things."}
