{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B0012W02OE', 'answerTime': 'Apr 19, 2010', 'unixTime': 1271660400, 'question': 'Question about the brentwood version of the snugride: Does the brentwood version have the front adjustment strap?', 'answer': 'No it does not; you must adjust it from the back, which is a pain.'}
{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B0012W02OE', 'answerTime': 'Feb 22, 2015', 'unixTime': 1424592000, 'question': 'Where are the straps for adjusting the harness; do they come out at the front for easy adjustments or are they difficult to reach?', 'answer': 'The straps are in the back behind the car seat. You have to adjust each side individually. It is extremely hard to adjust when the baby is in the seat. The newer models have a pull strap in the middle front which makes it so much easier than this car seat.'}
{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B0012W02OE', 'answerTime': 'Jan 12, 2015', 'unixTime': 1421049600, 'question': 'Does this carseat come with the base or is it purchased separately?', 'answer': "It (and nearly all infant car seats) comes with a base. You only need to consider additional bases if you're going to be using multiple cars (as it's much easier to install multiple bases and have the car seat snap in and out than it is to reinstall the whole thing if you want to switch cars)."}
{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B0012W02OE', 'answerTime': 'Oct 23, 2014', 'unixTime': 1414047600, 'question': 'does this car seat come with the car seat base or I av to purchase it separately', 'answer': 'It comes with a base.'}
{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B0012W02OE', 'answerTime': 'Mar 7, 2014', 'unixTime': 1394179200, 'question': 'Can this seat be installed in a car WITHOUT the base?', 'answerType': '?', 'answer': 'Yes, there are loops around the seat to safely attach without the base. Fairly easy. Acceptable solution when travelling but not for everyday.'}
