{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B00133WBX2', 'answerTime': 'Feb 9, 2014', 'unixTime': 1391932800, 'question': 'Can this be used as a closet to hang clothes? or shelves only?', 'answer': 'The cabinet is not intended to be used to hang clothes. There aren\'t any dowels for hangers. The interior dimensions are about 14"x 14". An adult hanger is much wider. I could imagine a handy person putting in a dowel for baby hangers. The shelves are adjustable and could be set quite low, allowing ample room for hanging baby clothes. I\'d verify that baby hangars are less than 14 inches, though.'}
