{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B0013FL0ZA', 'answerTime': 'Nov 11, 2013', 'unixTime': 1384156800, 'question': "What's the difference between the infant vs. toddler versions?", 'answer': 'The Infant Dishwasher Basket has a compartment on the bottom for holding bottle nipples while the Toddler Dishwasher Basket has a small bin on top for holding very small attachments. The Infant Basket is focused towards baby care. If you have a toddler, or are looking for a larger basket in-general, then I would recommend the Toddler Basket.'}
