{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B0016KV73W', 'answerTime': 'Feb 6, 2015', 'unixTime': 1423209600, 'question': 'what is the height of the potty?', 'answer': 'When it\'s set up for a stand alone potty it\'s only about 5-6" tall. It\'s the same height as the other kinds of potty chairs you see that are not convertible like this one. We have one and love how it has disposable liners for travel, but it\'s terribly uncomfortable to sit on top of a normal potty for longer periods of time when you are first starting to potty train.'}
