{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B0016KV8DG', 'answerTime': 'Aug 13, 2014', 'unixTime': 1407913200, 'question': 'I asked a question before but think I worded it weird. I am asking if you can leave standing on legs all the time/use as the go to potty for toddler', 'answer': "You can leave the legs open, as they snap into position, but I'd be worried about the potty accidently getting knocked over. The other concern are the disposable bags. They don't hold much liquid. So if the same bag is sitting out and being used multiple times, you are likely to have a puddle of liquid in the bottom of the bag. I hope this helps!"}
