{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B0016KYMMU', 'answerTime': 'Jun 30, 2014', 'unixTime': 1404111600, 'question': "If you use this as a seat adapter at public toilets, wouldn't it be super nasty? Does this even fit in a bag?", 'answer': 'Agreed, super nasty. I prefer to use it on a dirty floor (with a plastic bag) vs dirty toilet in a public restroom, and wipe the feet with a Clorox wipe before putting it away. I had to find myself a bigger plastic bag to hold the potette, travel diaper wipes, travel Clorox wipes, and extra plastic bags.'}
