{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B0016KYMMU', 'answerTime': 'Jul 25, 2014', 'unixTime': 1406271600, 'question': 'Could I use a bowl underneath it rather than the plastic bags?', 'answerType': '?', 'answer': 'It would probably be tough to find a bowl to fit well. It does not sit up very high at all. I was a little worried about using the bags, but after seeing them I think they will work just fine.'}
