{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B001AL7GOQ', 'answerTime': 'Nov 21, 2013', 'unixTime': 1385020800, 'question': 'How many pages is this book? Is there any envelopes to put baby first haircut, first tooth etc? place for birth cerf, footprint? thank you', 'answer': '33 pages, no envelopes for anything. It just has a area to put it in so you would have to purchase an envelope. There is a place for birth certificate, feet prints, shot records. And in the back it gives you extra pages for extra things. Hope that helps'}
