{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B001AL7GOQ', 'answerTime': 'Feb 5, 2014', 'unixTime': 1391587200, 'question': "How do you switch out the photo on the front cover? I can't figure it out!", 'answer': "Push and slide up on the plastic if you want to remove the picture... Or slide yours over the top ~ You have to push down firmly. It's like trying to get your driving license out of your wallet =&gt;"}
