{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B001AL7GOQ', 'answerTime': 'Sep 8, 2013', 'unixTime': 1378623600, 'question': 'how many pages does the journal have?', 'answer': 'Hello, There are 2 pages of introduction, 28 pgs for infant to 5 yrs of age and 4-5 pgs for additional notes, keepsakes ad photos. Hope this helps.'}
{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B001AL7GOQ', 'answerTime': 'Jul 20, 2013', 'unixTime': 1374303600, 'question': 'is there calendars inside the book? I am looking for a book that has one year of calendars and then pages for the next five years.', 'answerType': '?', 'answer': "Hello Sheonna, As I understand from my niece as it was a gift to her from me. she has stated there is a monthly calendar for the first 12 months that records babies first milestones.it even has a place for pictures. then for the successive 4 yrs there is place to write about events from that point on. She truly loves it and stated it was one of the best books she has seen for recording babies first years. It even has a place for the history of the parents ie: how they met , when he proposed if that is applicable. i dont think you'll have any regrets from what she has told me. We live on opposite sides of this country so I have not physically seen the book myself but made a point to call her today. Hope this was helpful"}
{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B001AQLGO2', 'answerTime': 'Jan 11, 2014', 'unixTime': 1389427200, 'question': 'Does this fit in a Britax b-agile?', 'answerType': 'Y', 'answer': 'I have the Britax B-Agile Double stroller and it fits perfectly! So it should work for you. We have been using this for almost a year now and it is holding up great! I am amazed at how well it rides because I go over some bumpy ground sometimes and I get nervous that my little one is going to fall out or fall over and she never has. It always stays up right and stays put very well! Good Luck!!:)'}
