{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B001BMWABI', 'answerTime': 'Jun 26, 2014', 'unixTime': 1403766000, 'question': 'Any opinion about whether this would work with Adult Pull-up Underwear?', 'answer': 'We tried to use one of these with small/medium sized adult diapers and had a heck of a time getting the used diaps to fit in. Once used (a bed-ridden, incontinent cancer patient), the diapers were too large to fit the opening, and trying to "tightly roll up" a used diaper filled with waste is not a pleasant or easy task. Your mileage may vary, but my personal experience was that this is not the answer. We went to using a stepp on garbage can, changing the regular trash bag often, and using a "stick on" odor controlling air freshener in the lid. Worked quite well.'}
