{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B001CSO1FO', 'answerTime': 'Jan 12, 2014', 'unixTime': 1389513600, 'question': 'Does it recline?', 'answerType': '?', 'answer': 'It reclines a tiny bit. Where the back of the seats are attached to the metal there are plastic hooks and you can pull it off the bars and replace it on the bars about an inch or two further back. It\'s not what I would consider a "sleeping" recline, but it\'s just enough of a recline to make it so that two toddlers who might otherwise annoy each other are not precisely next to each other anymore. Hope that makes sense!'}
