{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B001CV13RA', 'answerTime': 'Sep 6, 2014', 'unixTime': 1409986800, 'question': 'Will this fit the Duo Glider double stroller', 'answerType': '?', 'answer': "The Duo Glider double stroller looks very much like our Baby Trend Sit and Stand Double Stroller. It should work just fine. The way it works is it sits over the top of the strollers built in covers and around the sides of the handles. It uses snaps to help it fit around the sides of the handles leaving the actual handlebar exposed for easy pushing. The rain guard has netting on various places along the sides of the guard for air ventilation. The netting has the plastic guard that covers over it, but snaps to the rest of the guard so air flow can get into where the child or children are at so they can get plenty of oxygen. We really like ours. If you use the stroller throughout the fall and winter (rain and snow seasons) like we've done here in the Pacific Northwest, you will want to make sure the children are covered with coats and blankets because the guard only keeps off the wind and rain, it does not protect the children from the cold. Good luck with your choice. Like I said, we really like ours. We bought one for our double stroller and our single stroller."}
