{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B001CV13RA', 'answerTime': 'May 19, 2014', 'unixTime': 1400482800, 'question': 'Hello, I have graco duo glider. Baby in the back can be laid dawn flat. If she is in flat position will the cover still fit. Thanks.', 'answer': "It should still fit. You would definitely want to get the Jeep Tandem Stroller Weather Shield so it will fit your double stroller. We never used ours with the seat laying back, so I'm not sure if it would work. Sitting up, the weather shield fits pretty snug. If your stroller seat in the down position extends out very much, it might not work. My husband and I love ours, we just keep the grandchildren sitting up when we need to walk somewhere with the shield on. Good luck."}
