{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B001CWSVWO', 'answerTime': 'Jan 28, 2014', 'unixTime': 1390896000, 'question': 'Is it too much of a pain to replace the elastic yourself? Just sew a better quality one on?', 'answer': 'Well considering I struggle to sew on a button, I personally would rather just buy these! These do wash up well, and considering how challenging some sheets are to fit a mattress, these fit quite well and go on/off easily.'}
{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B001CWSVWO', 'answerTime': 'Aug 25, 2013', 'unixTime': 1377414000, 'question': 'Can someone give the measurements for this sheet? The description should have given them!!!', 'answerType': '?', 'answer': 'These sheets fit all standard crib mattresses. We have a 6 inch deep mattress and these velour sheets fit perfect. Our friends also have these sheets and one has a 5 in deep and the other a 6 1/2 inch deep mattress. No problem with either. Babies LOVE these sheets. They like to rub their face and hands on the sheet. It seems to be very comforting and helps them go to sleep. I highly recommend these velour sheets.'}
