{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B001D1505A', 'answerTime': 'Sep 17, 2014', 'unixTime': 1410937200, 'question': 'Has anyone speak to how this works as a homework chair for an older child? I would like to buy one for my first grader.', 'answerType': '?', 'answer': 'I think this chair would work wonderfully as a homework chair! We love the Tripp Trapp chairs and have purchased one for each of our four children. That was not our original intention, but since you can adjust the chairs, as the kids have grown (our oldest is 8/3rd grade and still uses it), the chairs have been able to grow with them. Definitely recommend!'}
