{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B001D1505A', 'answerTime': 'Mar 17, 2015', 'unixTime': 1426575600, 'question': 'Can you remove the seat belt and wash it in the washing machine?', 'answerType': 'N', 'answer': "We can't remove ours, we have two ten year old Stokke's and one three year old Stoke. It is a bad design flaw and should be addressed as I see no reason that they should not make them removable for washing. You can scrub them on the chair which is what I do but it is a pain to do!"}
