{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B001D1505A', 'answerTime': 'Nov 29, 2014', 'unixTime': 1417248000, 'question': 'Does a young toddler (my child is 18 months and on the small side) need the baby set, or is the regular highchair and harness just fine?', 'answer': "Personally I dislike the included harness. It is not the easiest to use. I bought the set and don't use the harness. My son is secure in it and can move forward and back. Maybe wait for the chair to arrive and see if you like the harness. If so then you won't need the set."}
