{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B001D1A4IS', 'answerTime': 'May 12, 2013', 'unixTime': 1368342000, 'question': 'Has any one else had problems with the footrest? My niece kicks it out all the time, is there supposed to be a stop?', 'answer': 'sometimes you need to loosen all the screws in order to "square up" the chair, then retighten in order to make the footrest tighten properly.'}
{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B001D1A4IS', 'answerTime': 'Sep 30, 2013', 'unixTime': 1380524400, 'question': 'Does it come in one piece and can it be broken down for shipping?', 'answer': "Comes flat packed, but if you keep the included assembly tool it can be broken down for shipping in about 5 mintues. Reassembly takes a little longer - 15 mintues. But it's designed to be taken apart like that since you have to loosen the sides in order to change the seat platform height."}
