{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B001D1A4IS', 'answerTime': 'Aug 27, 2013', 'unixTime': 1377586800, 'question': 'How resistant to tipping over backwards is this?', 'answer': "Dear K.S.: I find the chair to be pretty sturdy and not that easy to tip back, especially if you place the chair on an even surface, as suggested by the manufacturer, and use the provided plastic sliders. I'm not sure if it would be easier for an active two year old to tip this chair back, as I'm using it with a five year old who hasn't tried to push back. I sat on the chair and tried to push myself backwards and it was nearly impossible to do. Good luck with your purchasing decision."}
