{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B001D7LA58', 'answerTime': 'Jun 4, 2014', 'unixTime': 1401865200, 'question': "My baby is 7 mo old &amp; 16 lbs. Do you think the XL size will be to big? I'd rather not have to buy large now and XL a couple months later.", 'answerType': '?', 'answer': "XL will be too big. Large may even be big. My daughter is 12 mo and 18 lbs (small peanut) and still wears a medium with plenty of room. I understand you not wanting to purchase another in a couple months, but you don't want TOO much wiggle room either. Maybe you could purchase a large just to see, but keep in mind he/she may not be able to wear it yet and you may have to get a medium?"}
