{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B001DLJVPA', 'answerTime': 'Dec 2, 2014', 'unixTime': 1417507200, 'question': 'Does the chair not rotate at all? After installation, my boon chair can rotate a little bit say 10 degrees. It is normal?', 'answer': "The top chair/seat part does not swivel. However the whole chair swivels easily because of the rollers underneath the chair. It's never been an issue for us, and I think it's safer that the top seat does not swivel. You wouldn't want child to push on the table or under counter and spin itself. :) We have had our boon for 5 years now and has been thru 2 kids and guests and we still LOVE it. Still looks cool and CLEAN and moves easily around on tile and hardwood. :-)"}
