{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B001E5NDCW', 'answerTime': 'Jul 6, 2014', 'unixTime': 1404630000, 'question': 'Could I fit 2 seats plus a harness seat in the back of a Ford f-150 supercrew', 'answerType': 'Y', 'answer': 'I think so. If I remember correctly part of the reason we picked this seat was because it was more narrow than some of the other leading boosters. I had 2 car seats and one of these in the backseat of my SUV at one point. It was very snug with 2 harness seats, but they fit!'}
