{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B001ECHXVC', 'answerTime': 'Feb 15, 2015', 'unixTime': 1423987200, 'question': 'How does the child get into this, do they have to be put in by an adult?', 'answerType': '?', 'answer': 'No, our daughter climbs in from either side. The first few times we guided her till she got the hang of it. When she wants to get down, she climbs out on her belly and slowly backs down.'}
