{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B001FB5BFW', 'answerTime': 'Feb 11, 2010', 'unixTime': 1265875200, 'question': 'Anyone used the Safety 1st Alpha Omega Elite Convertible Car Seat on an airplane? We were wondering if anyone has any expeirence with this car seat on an airplane?', 'answer': 'I know this is late to the discussion, but it will help someone in the future. We traveled with that car seat and had no problems. It was difficult to get through security because they had to hand search it, and carrying a car seat onto the plane was bothersome, but the added safety is well worth it. Had no problems getting the car seat to fit once on the plane. Strapped my son in and he slept the either flight.'}
