{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B001FSL3NO', 'answerTime': 'Jun 10, 2010', 'unixTime': 1276153200, 'question': 'Do the flanges on the Avent Isis iQ Duo Twin Breast Pump work for large breasts? I was curious to see if this pump would work good for a women with large breasts?', 'answer': 'Honestly, the 24 mm shields don\'t work with MOST breasts. However, there is a great aftermarket product that does work with the Avent Isis pump and every pumping mom should own anyhow. www.pumpinpal.com (no, I do not own the company -- just a satisfied customer!) The shields fit into the Avent shields and they actually "engulf" more breast tissue than a standard shield so you\'ll find you get more milk anyhow. Highly, highly recommended. I get so much more milk with the Avent Isis/Pumpin Pal combination than even with a rented Medela Symphony and the Pumpin Pal Super Shields. The Avent Isis is SO worth it -- you just need to buy the aftermarket shields (also, get a Simple Wishes bra!)'}
