{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B001GQ2P6O', 'answerTime': 'Nov 12, 2013', 'unixTime': 1384243200, 'question': 'what is the manf. date printed on seat before I purchase?', 'answer': 'If you mean what will be the actual date printed on your car seat, only Graco could tell you that. But in general, car seats are only supposed to be good for 6 years before you discard it. I\'m sure car seat makers love that rule. But they put when the car seat "expires" on it so you know when it\'s time to get a new one.'}
