{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B001GQ2P8C', 'answerTime': 'Oct 1, 2013', 'unixTime': 1380610800, 'question': 'is this okay for a 10 month old baby', 'answerType': '?', 'answer': "No. It is too small and a bit shaky. I highly recommend a Phil & Teds travel crib. A bit more expensive but I was able to use the Phil & teds until my baby was 3. Years old. Got my money's worth out of it."}
