{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B001GQ2P8C', 'answerTime': 'Jun 9, 2013', 'unixTime': 1370761200, 'question': 'Can the bassinet bumper be removed? Bumpers are a suffocation risk.', 'answerType': '?', 'answer': 'The bumper in the top bassinet portion cannot be removed as far as I know. But keep this in mind.. The baby cannot roll over until s/he is 3 months old.. And.. You if you look a bit closer you will see there is a mesh area where the babies head will be.. I used this product for our daughter (now 3yrs old) and I highly recommend it. Another perk is its on wheels and can be easily moved from room to room.. Good luck! Enjoy your precious bundle. :)'}
{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B001GQ2P8C', 'answerTime': 'Jun 1, 2013', 'unixTime': 1370070000, 'question': "How big of a baby would be comfortable sleeping in this? We're looking for a bed for the RV but don't want our baby to grow out of it too fast.", 'answer': 'Girl = up to 5 months. Boy = 3 or 4 months.'}
