{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B001GQ2RYY', 'answerTime': 'Dec 13, 2012', 'unixTime': 1355385600, 'question': 'Music stopped working: Anyone know what could be going on here or how to fix it?', 'answer': "Hi! Same thing happened to me. We got the swing in 2008 as well. We had the same AC adapter and the music still won't work. I called Fisher Price for troubleshooting; nothing worked for me, but you could try pressing the reset button. I did that and unfortunately it did not work for me."}
