{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B001GQ2RWG', 'answerTime': 'Jun 22, 2014', 'unixTime': 1403420400, 'question': 'how do you change the batteries?', 'answer': 'on the bottom of the base you will find the battery compartment. You unscrew the compartment door with a Philips head screw drive and insert 3 AA alkaline batteries, replace the compartment door and screw the compartment door back securely. The potty comes with instructions or you can google "instructions for cheer for me potty. The fisher price website link should come up with the link to the instructions.'}
