{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B001GQ2RYE', 'answerTime': 'Jan 23, 2010', 'unixTime': 1264233600, 'question': 'How long can I use it: Can this booster do the job?', 'answer': 'I have been using mine for my 2.5 year old since he was 4 months! Love it, I wash the cover in the washing machine, so it started tearing after a year (to be expected), and it fits under our table just fine.'}
