{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B001GQ2P78', 'answerTime': 'Oct 31, 2014', 'unixTime': 1414738800, 'question': "It says it has more than one sound but I can't figure out what they are bc everyone only seems to use white noise", 'answer': 'Yes, there are several white noise type sounds--rain forest, whales, heart beat, riding in the car sound, summer sounds, plus it has lullaby music and you can plug in your iPod or MP3 player to play your own music. I honestly love this white noise/nightlight. Have one for each of my kids. Hope this helps.'}
