{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B001GQ2SA2', 'answerTime': 'Jul 20, 2014', 'unixTime': 1405839600, 'question': 'Does this have to be mounted on a crib? Can it be used on a pack and play?', 'answer': "Depending on your Pack and Play, yes. I've mounted it on a few (Graco, Chicco, and some other brand I can't remember). If you strap it through the corners where there are gaps in the mesh, you can get it in there. The image won't project straight overhead because you can't pull the straps short enough to lay it flush against the mesh, but it gets the job done."}
