{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B001GT4OEM', 'answerTime': 'Dec 3, 2014', 'unixTime': 1417593600, 'question': 'I am wondering the materials of the pillow? I see someone said the inside is polyester, but what is the cover?', 'answer': 'The material of the actual pillow is 100% polyester. I was very disappointed as I had read it was 100% organic cotton but that is only the pillow case, allegedly. Pillow overheats because of the polyester and can be very uncomfortable though this kinda helps on cold nights. Even though the cover is said to be organic cotton, it doesn\'t feel very soft and might as well be some other material. But maybe my skin is just too sensitive. I now have to wrap pillow w other sheets because the "organic" cover irritates me or maybe it is the polyester. Either way, although pillow is comfortable and helps w sleep, it is not worth it because material makes it uncomfortable.'}
