{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B001GZQYRQ', 'answerTime': 'Dec 6, 2013', 'unixTime': 1386316800, 'question': 'Can I use this for newborn? Can I let the baby nap in this or just for playing/leisure?', 'answer': "Our newborn has fallen asleep in this before, and he was ok--but it's not made for napping. It's a great chair for playing, bouncing, and what we use it most for is just a chair (that bounces) when baby watches us prepare dinner or do other things at home. The reason it's so great is because it supports a newborn / baby's head and let's him see or watch what's going on. This is by far the best purchase we made--even though it's not really for napping."}
