{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B001GZQYRQ', 'answerTime': 'Jan 24, 2014', 'unixTime': 1390550400, 'question': 'What material is the brown/beige one made from? is it 100% cotton (like the rust/orange)?', 'answer': 'I looked at the tag on my Baby bjorn seat and it says 60% cotton, 40% polyester. I have the black/pinstripe version. It is a fabulous baby seat, my very active 8 month old still likes it! The seat is washable which I love and the chair has three reclining settings. It is more expensive than some of the other baby gear out there, but the quality is exceptional. It also folds flat for storage which is a huge bonus. Everytime I see my son in it, I wish there was an adult version!'}
