{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B001J8JOAY', 'answerTime': 'Jul 27, 2013', 'unixTime': 1374908400, 'question': 'is this a good car seat for a one year old', 'answerType': 'N', 'answer': 'No. I had to purchase another seat. The reason is both safety & comfort. This particular model of Saftey 1st booster has little to no side protection. When your child falls to sleep his/her head will drop off to the side or forward dramatically. There is nothing supporting the head. Worse still - in case of an accident your little one will experience serious whiplash for the same reason. I ended up buying a Britax Roundabout. Look for a booster with more side protection is my advise.'}
