{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B001L64LHU', 'answerTime': 'Jan 14, 2015', 'unixTime': 1421222400, 'question': 'Would this gate fit a space that is a bit less than 38in wide? My opening is more than 38 inches, but w the floor boards - the width is a little less', 'answerType': 'Y', 'answer': "Yes, the dialing pressure pads give you many degrees of tension in terms of the width of the opening it's placed. I have 4 of these gates in my home, in 3 different width's. You will be able to obtain a correct fit even if your opening is slightly varied."}
{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B001L64LHU', 'answerTime': 'Jan 1, 2015', 'unixTime': 1420099200, 'question': 'The opening that I want to secure is not straight across. Can I put this gate at a slight angle?', 'answerType': '?', 'answer': 'No. Gate works with tension. If not a straight tight fit it may not close properly.'}
