{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B001LF3X66', 'answerTime': 'Jul 30, 2014', 'unixTime': 1406703600, 'question': "Does anyone have a problem getting this one their shoulder with ONE hand? I saw the strap drop is only 9.5in..It's not in any stores near me to try:(", 'answerType': '?', 'answer': 'I do not have any trouble getting the bag on my shoulder with one hand. It could depend on your height and weight. For instance, I\'m 5\'4", 115lbs and I can put this bag on my shoulder with one hand. When it is on my shoulder, the very top of the bag sits about 5" below my armpit when my arm is down. I have plenty of room between the bag and my armpit. The 9.5" drop is more than it sounds like. :)'}
{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B001LF3X66', 'answerTime': 'Apr 21, 2014', 'unixTime': 1398063600, 'question': 'Does this bag come with straps that can hook on to a stroller/pram?', 'answerType': 'Y', 'answer': 'Yes they are short straps that "live" inside the purse until you want to clip it onto the stroller, and then you just clip the two little straps (that are on each side of the purse) together. It\'s quick and easy, and the hardware is very sturdy but also sleek. (I babysit my granddaughter and use this bag on her stroller, but to tell you the truth, I use it even more on the back of my dad\'s wheelchair! I used to have my purse slipping off my shoulder especially when trying to get the wheelchair over the curb, but this works great!'}
{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B001LF3X66', 'answerTime': 'Jul 25, 2014', 'unixTime': 1406271600, 'question': "Do avent bottles fit into the outside side pockets? If so, is it the 'classic' avent bottles (their wider) or the 'natural'?", 'answer': 'I would say yes, absolutely. I can fit wide sippy cups in the pockets, no problem. The pocket size is very generous.'}
{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B001LF3X66', 'answerTime': 'Mar 11, 2014', 'unixTime': 1394521200, 'question': 'Does this bag zip on the top?', 'answerType': 'Y', 'answer': "Yes it does, and that's why I bought it! (I previously had a skip hop tote that didn't zip on the top, but I don't like that since my wallet is in there, so I only used that one for a couple of weeks til I found this one!) I love this bag, it feels stylish, plus it has LOTS of compartments. Also it is not as heavy as most of the other bags this size."}
{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B001LF3X66', 'answerTime': 'Oct 15, 2013', 'unixTime': 1381820400, 'question': "Is this bag comfortable to carry? I got one but it seems so uncomfortable, I don't know if I should return. Everyone seems to love it though.", 'answerType': '?', 'answer': "I find this bag to be extremely comfortable, it's very light weight and the straps are perfect!"}
{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B001LF3X66', 'answerTime': 'Oct 6, 2014', 'unixTime': 1412578800, 'question': 'Does it have pockets inside ?', 'answerType': 'Y', 'answer': 'It has 4 open pockets for diapers, wipes, etc., 2 bottle pockets on the sides, and then one zippered pocket (all inside). Outside it has another 2 bottle pockets on the sides, one antibacterial zippered pocket on the back, one magnetic closure pocket, one smaller pocket for like a phone keys and gum, and then one longer pocket that fits a wallet in the front. Really organized!'}
