{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B001N2LSKA', 'answerTime': 'Mar 30, 2014', 'unixTime': 1396162800, 'question': 'What size pictures does this fit?', 'answer': 'I printed out face photos that were ~1.25" in diameter to fit the holes and they were a little too big (but I used them anyway). I\'d recommend using photos where the face is about 1" across and leave a little bit of room around the face, so the total size of the photo is ~1.5" in diameter. This may seem very small, but the size of the photo slots in this frame are bigger than most of the others like it and it is a really adorable frame. I filled mine right after my son\'s 1st birthday and I plan to buy another one for my 2nd child.'}
