{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B001NAAQRI', 'answerTime': 'Apr 11, 2014', 'unixTime': 1397199600, 'question': 'do these go inside of prefolds?? new to clothdiapering. we have bamboo/cotton prefolds n thirstiy duo wraps', 'answerType': 'Y', 'answer': "Yeah, it'll work great for night time. I'm also using cotton prefolds and my baby sleeps like an angel :)"}
{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B001NAAQRI', 'answerTime': 'Aug 11, 2014', 'unixTime': 1407740400, 'question': 'What size is the most versatile? Small fits BG perfectly on the smallest rise setting, but I wonder about getting a large and folding it in half.', 'answer': 'We bought the Large size and they fit perfectly in our BG Freetimes on the smallest rise setting. We just fold the ends in towards the middle until we get the desired length. It makes her overnight diaper bulky, but no more leaks and it will grow with her as we size the diapers up!'}
