{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B001NCEL72', 'answerTime': 'Apr 23, 2014', 'unixTime': 1398236400, 'question': "What are the colors(or shades of colors) in the set? I want to start painting/decorating and i won't get the bed set until my shower.", 'answer': "The most matchable colors would be pink, red, or orange. I know this might sound weird. But we painted before we got the set too. We ended up going through three color choices before we ended up just painting pink and white. It's a beautiful set and I couldn't be happier with it... the problem we encountered was it isn't quite a turquoise, the yellow is more of a mustard, and the green is a olive green. I hope this helps."}
