{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B001NIJS1A', 'answerTime': 'Jan 12, 2014', 'unixTime': 1389513600, 'question': "Does the k'tan wrap work well with babies over three months, or is it best for younger infants?", 'answer': "Yes! I bought the k'tan when my daughter was 2 months old (wished I had it from the get go) and it has been the best purchase I have made for her. She is almost 7 months, close to 20 pounds, and I still use it daily. She loves being in it and it's her favorite place to sleep. It does stretch out a bit after a while, but I just throw it in with my wash and its back to fitting perfect."}
