{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B001NIZSGE', 'answerTime': 'Feb 15, 2015', 'unixTime': 1423987200, 'question': 'Can I use it in the airport? If yes, are they take it in the aircraft door? If yes, how we can have it back? Thanks for your help.', 'answer': 'Yes you can use it at the airport. When you get to the door of the airplane the airline employees put a numbered tag on the stroller and give you a ticket stub with the same number. When you xit the plane, the airline gives you back the stroller right at the door of the airplane.'}
