{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B001O4CE3W', 'answerTime': 'Jun 13, 2014', 'unixTime': 1402642800, 'question': 'Having trouble ordering baskets for this piece. I was hoping to mimic the picture. Anyone know what baskets I should purchase for this??', 'answer': "This product had much deeper shelves than I anticipated. Most baskets and bins I found were not large enough and I wanted to use up the whole shelf so no space was wasted. I searched for a long time prepared to spend whatever amount for baskets or bins that fit. Finally I found these from ikea (kusiner bins) http://www.ikea.com/us/en/catalog/products/80172827/. The height and width are perfect and only leave a couple inches in depth behind open. And for the price you can't beat them! They have one partially see through side and the other is not for 2 different looks. It isn't the basket look like in the picture but turned out wonderful in my nursery and fit loads of things inside :-)"}
{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B001O4CE3W', 'answerTime': 'May 29, 2014', 'unixTime': 1401346800, 'question': 'Does anyone know the dimensions of the shelves?', 'answer': 'Yes, 18.5" deep, 32.5" wide, openings are 11.5" high, with another 1.5" of space inside the shelf Both are the same size. The top shelf has a slight lip on the front edge do it is only about 18" of shelf out to the lip, the lip is a quarter of an inch high, the bottom shelf is smooth out to the 18.5"'}
