{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B001OC5UNK', 'answerTime': '23 days ago', 'question': 'I\'m confused by all the dimensions... Will this fit in a 36" area?', 'answerType': 'Y', 'answer': 'Yes. I\'m using it in an opening that\'s 36". The dimensions say you can use it in an opening that\'s minimum 29" to 34" the gate itself...and a max of 50" if you add the attachments in case u need it in a bigger opening. I had to add the small attachment to the gate in order to make it into my 36" opening.'}
