{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B001P7WI9S', 'answerTime': 'Dec 12, 2013', 'unixTime': 1386835200, 'question': 'What is the difference between the small and small/medium?', 'answer': 'There is not a big difference between them. But you can never be sure that small size will fit your newborn baby, so to be on safe side, it is better to take a size slightly larger and keep on mind that medium you will use longer that small size, since baby grows faster that we think.'}
