{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B001PAHHEQ', 'answerTime': 'Oct 11, 2014', 'unixTime': 1413010800, 'question': 'Does it fit the Chicco Keyfit 30 carseat?', 'answerType': '?', 'answer': "Hmm I'm not sure although I have that same carseat. But, side note , after receiving the product I regretted getting it. It's thin and not appropriate for cold weather. There is another version that is perfect but this particular one is not. My opinion only."}
{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B001PAHHEQ', 'answerTime': 'Feb 1, 2014', 'unixTime': 1391241600, 'question': 'does it fit for Eddie Bauer 3-wheel travel system car seat? Can it work together with JJ cole headsupport in a car seat?', 'answer': "I am unsure if it fits this car seat style. However as a soon to be certified car seat tech I will say that car seat manufacturers do not allow for you to use anything extra with the car seat. Including this and a jj cole headpiece. I'd look at shower style covers instead, ones that do not go between baby and the car seat."}
