{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B001PAHHEQ', 'answerTime': 'Jan 1, 2014', 'unixTime': 1388563200, 'question': 'Is it compatible with Chicco car seats?', 'answerType': '?', 'answer': "I can't promise you that it is 100% compatible with Chicco car seats. HOWEVER= it would be relatively easy to lengthen the seat belt slots to your liking. The openings could be gently lengthened with a sharp Exacto blade or sharp pair of scissors. I love these JJ Cole Bundleme covers! They're almost little sleeping bags. I also recommend that you get the toddler size, as your tiny baby can grow into it and you won't have to buy another one in six months. I am glad that I bought the light one, because I can always put a little blanket on top of it if the day is chillier than I expected."}
{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B001PAHHEQ', 'answerTime': 'Dec 19, 2013', 'unixTime': 1387440000, 'question': 'does it help with the sweatting?', 'answerType': '?', 'answer': "I am sorry, I don't understand what you mean by 'help with sweating'? But I will try to answer your question. It is a light cover for mild weather, so your baby should not be sweating. For example, in an over air conditioned mall during summer months; you have a nice quick cover for baby."}
