{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B001PAHHEQ', 'answerTime': 'Nov 15, 2013', 'unixTime': 1384502400, 'question': 'Is this compatible with the Bob Revolution Stroller? Also my LO is 6 mths and 16 lbs. What size is appropriate to get? Thanks!', 'answer': 'I have the Bob Revolution and it works fine. We have both, the infant and toddler sizes. The toddler one we used for my daughter from 9months to 16 months. My other daughter is 7 months and 18 pounds and the infant one fits her fine. Its more of the legnth you need to worry about, thats what my daughter out grew first. I might go with the toddler size since your probably only going to use the infant one for a few months more and then need the next bigger size.'}
