{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B001PBFWMO', 'answerTime': 'Apr 9, 2013', 'unixTime': 1365490800, 'question': 'can a adult use this??', 'answerType': '?', 'answer': "It depends on the size of your nostrils. Unless you have a very small nose you probably won't be able to get a very good seal so you won't be able to create strong suction. Also, an adult will need to empty the tiny drainage chamber many times. Even a sick baby might need it changed at least once and adults sinus cavities are much much larger. I recommend a neti pot for adults. These suction devices are better for babies because babies don't have the coordination needed to use a neti pot and are designed with their tiny noses in mind."}
