{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B001Q1E83M', 'answerTime': 'Dec 4, 2013', 'unixTime': 1386144000, 'question': 'Good morning, until age can use this car??', 'answer': "I am confused by the question. Do you mean the tray as in the item this question says it goes with, or do you mean the stroller? Or do you mean the infant car seat? Infant car seat goes to 30lbs or 30 inches whichever comes first. I added the tray to our stroller when my son began to sit up really well so that was just after five months but I am sure age can vary. I don't see why you couldn't use the tray or stroller until the child is older and is below or at the recommended weight limit."}
