{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B001Q3L8RO', 'answerTime': 'Dec 2, 2014', 'unixTime': 1417507200, 'question': 'Does the chair not rotate at all? After installation, my boon chair can rotate a little bit say 10 degrees. It is normal?', 'answer': "The top chair/seat part does not swivel. However the whole chair swivels easily because of the rollers underneath the chair. It's never been an issue for us, and I think it's safer that the top seat does not swivel. You wouldn't want child to push on the table or under counter and spin itself. :) We have had our boon for 5 years now and has been thru 2 kids and guests and we still LOVE it. Still looks cool and CLEAN and moves easily around on tile and hardwood. :-)"}
{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B001Q3L8RO', 'answerTime': 'Mar 16, 2014', 'unixTime': 1394953200, 'question': 'I like the look of the white color but worry that it will easily stain. Does the white stain or will it retain its color with regular cleaning?', 'answer': "I have had white for years now. It's seen me through 3 boys, spaghetti sauce, poo accidents and strawberry stains. All you have to do is spray down w/ a Clorox water mixture & any stain will come out within minutes! So fear not. My chair looks like the day I bought it! (The status come off super easy for deep cleaning as well). This chair is a must have!"}
