{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B001QIH7QA', 'answerTime': 'Aug 25, 2013', 'unixTime': 1377414000, 'question': 'The tire blew out on mine, and I need to replace it. Will standard 12.5 inch tires an tubes fit? The tires on the bike say they are "12" inch', 'answerType': '?', 'answer': 'We\'ve had the front tire (tire and tube) blow out twice -both times were immediately following my husband inflating it, so I suspect he was over-inflating. Anyway, the first time it was within the warranty so it was sent to us at no charge. The second time we bought it directly from prince lionheart - it\'s on a short list of replacement parts and much cheaper ($12.00) through prince lionheart than anything we found elsewhere. Both times, the new tire arrived quickly (within 4 days). Go to princelionheart.com, select your country then select replacement parts, page through \'til you find "balance bike wheel complete".'}
