{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B001WAJVZM', 'answerTime': 'Jul 4, 2014', 'unixTime': 1404457200, 'question': 'would this fit on a spout where the diverter is the underside of the faucet that pull down?', 'answerType': '?', 'answer': 'It will undoubtedly fit on but whether it will stay on or not is another question...It relies on the pull up type with the button at exactly the right distance from the front.'}
