{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B0021435SC', 'answerTime': 'Feb 12, 2014', 'unixTime': 1392192000, 'question': 'I wear a 34DD pre-pregnancy. Should I order the M/L flanges or the XL/XXL ones?', 'answer': "Since your breastfeeding size will change over the course of your breastfeeding period, I suggest getting one set of each. Usually when you buy a beast pump, it comes with the m/l ones. If they don't fit properly, then you should buy the bigger size, but keep the m/l ones as well. Hope this helps."}
