{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B0021435SC', 'answerTime': 'Jun 9, 2014', 'unixTime': 1402297200, 'question': 'What bra/cup size do these compare to? Would they fit a 38D or would you recommend a bigger size?', 'answer': "The size of your nipples, not your breasts, is what to consider when choosing a flange size. It was more trial and error to figure this out, since one's nipples get bigger when pumping. I started with the standard size the pump came with and found they chafed my nipples, so I got a bigger size. I put lanolin on the inside of the flanges, too."}
