{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B0024FAWSE', 'answerTime': 'May 24, 2014', 'unixTime': 1400914800, 'question': 'Can this be used as a stand alone (not attached to the wall) gate? Does it have pressure connectors?', 'answer': 'It does not have pressure connectors. We use it without attaching it to the wall as a barrier to separate feuding cats. It does require that it not be in a straight line, that one of the panels is at an angle. it would not be safe to use it in this fashion around children.'}
