{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B0025MYX2M', 'answerTime': 'Dec 8, 2014', 'unixTime': 1418025600, 'question': 'What is the age recomended? Does it work on a 1 year old baby with 7 teeths', 'answerType': 'Y', 'answer': "I've used this tip brush on my 14 month old granddaughter's 8 front teeth. She actually opens her mouth when she sees the brush coming to her mouth and then beginnings sucking it, but this is prepping her for the big girls tooth brush. LOL!!! Try it!!!"}
{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B0025MYX2M', 'answerTime': 'Jun 9, 2014', 'unixTime': 1402297200, 'question': 'How well will it work if an adult slipped it on his/her index finger and used it to brush his/her own teeth? Thanx', 'answer': "I don't think it would be effective for someone who actually needed clean teeth. I think it's more designed to develop comfort with oral hygiene routines on the flat teeth babies start out with, rather than thorough cleaning on adult teeth. Also the hole that your finger is supposed to fit in is pretty slim; my finger doesn't fit in it all the way. That's better for a baby because their mouths are so small, if it was bigger it wouldn't be able to brush. But I think it would be difficult on adult teeth."}
