{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B00278WA4W', 'answerTime': '11 days ago', 'question': 'Will liquid come out of the sprout if child reverses the bottle, shakes it or drops it? My LO enjoys carrying her cups around...', 'answerType': '?', 'answer': 'There is a little piece of white plastic that connects to the underside of the top that keeps liquid from coming out unless there is suction. You can remove the white piece and then the milk free flows. I have forgotten to put the white piece back on several times after cleaning, then the milk flows everywhere.'}
