{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B0029DOJNK', 'answerTime': 'Mar 12, 2014', 'unixTime': 1394607600, 'question': 'How long is this crib, really? The dimensions listed on Amazon seem misleading. 59" length is much longer than the standard 53"-54" inches.', 'answer': 'Inside the bed...distance of the length from slat at foot of bed to slat at head of bed is 53.5". Basically, this is a fraction more than the length of the mattress. The style of the bed is curved on the legs and the rims at top on the foot and head of the bed. My bed length there is 57". However, the 59" is referring to the pieces underneath the legs of the bed. The legs sit on small rectangular pieces of wood. The measurement from end to end of bed there is 59". Inside of bed= 53.5" standard length; decorative components = 59"'}
