{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B002ACEGDS', 'answerTime': 'Feb 10, 2014', 'unixTime': 1392019200, 'question': 'Does the espresso cherry have quite a bit of red in it, or is it mostly black? Trying to match to a very dark cherry Storkcraft crib...', 'answer': 'The "espresso cherry" is very red in my opinion (its dark too though). It\'s a very pretty color but in our opinion it was a little too cherry and more girly (we wanted gender neutral). We returned it for the "black cherry" and love it, that color has very very little cherry....its more of just a dark brown color. Also, I find the stock photos for these colors are completely wrong...if you search google images you can find some pictures of delta cribs/dressers in real nurseries which is much more helpful!'}
