{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B002ACCC52', 'answerTime': 'Mar 31, 2014', 'unixTime': 1396249200, 'question': 'Will fabric storage bins fit on the shelves? Does anyone have the dimensions of the lower shelves?', 'answer': 'I have baskets on my shelves. I\'m not sure what storage bins you mean, but I took the dimensions for you. The shelves measure 33" by 16". The distance between them is 10", but that includes the lip on both the upper and lower shelves. There is actually 11.5" of space between the shelves, but the bins would have to be 10" or less in height to be able to fit onto the shelves. I hope that makes sense! Good luck!'}
