{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B002FB7FLE', 'answerTime': 'Nov 10, 2014', 'unixTime': 1415606400, 'question': 'Mine just came in the mail. Are there any special instructions to prep them before I use them? Or can I just wash them once and then put them to use?', 'answer': 'Wash once or twice then use. The more you wash them over time the more absorbant they become.'}
