{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B002G9UTWC', 'answerTime': 'Sep 28, 2014', 'unixTime': 1411887600, 'question': 'Would this fit with a Baby Jogger GT? Does one have to take it off to fold the stroller?', 'answer': "It should fit the GT but the only issue is the top of the bundle has a strap that you need to secure around the top of the seat, so in any of the strollers where the canopy cannot be disconnected from the headrest that will make it hard, but it will still work...but in a smaller child I would be concerned about the head part falling over the child's head and possibly suffocating it, in a larger/older child I would not have this worry. You should be able to fold the stroller with it on"}
