{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B002GDF8GU', 'answerTime': 'Jan 5, 2015', 'unixTime': 1420444800, 'question': 'What is the difference between the wide mouth and the regular bottles (aside from the obvious- wide mouth). Does the wide mouth serve a purpose?', 'answerType': 'Y', 'answer': 'I chose the wide neck because it s easier to wash, and also seems easier for the baby hold it I think its a question of preference, because both (regular and wide) have the valve and it works great to avoid colics. My Gustavo never had problems with that and other parents notice the improvement using these bottles. I recommend it.'}
