{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B002GDF8GU', 'answerTime': 'May 21, 2014', 'unixTime': 1400655600, 'question': 'Are the nipples that are included on the bottles themselves a level 1 flow nipple?', 'answerType': 'Y', 'answer': 'Yes. All the bottles come with level one nipples, even the 8oz bottles. You need to buy other levels separate.'}
