{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B002IVTPIW', 'answerTime': 'Jan 7, 2014', 'unixTime': 1389081600, 'question': 'How long is the warranty?', 'answer': 'What The Shrunks Standard Warranty Covers Two-year warranty on any defective product purchased through Authorized Shrunks Retailers, online and in-store. Receipt or proof of purchase is required. Must be original owner. The Shrunks Extended Warranty If you discover a defect on your Shrunks product after the two-year period, you may replace it with the same product, or equivalent, at 50% off our retail price as shown on our website. This offer is valid FOR AS LONG AS YOU OWN THE PRODUCT. Receipt or proof of purchase is required. Must be original owner.'}
