{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B002IVTPIW', 'answerTime': 'Feb 15, 2014', 'unixTime': 1392451200, 'question': 'What are the outside dimensions of the bed when inflated. I need to make sure that it fits in the space left in the bedroom', 'answer': 'Sorry it took so long to respond but we are having our grand-daughter over tonight and I just set it up. We have the larger model which measures 48" wide by 76" long. We bought a very nice twin set of animal sheets to use and it works great. Pleanty of room to get around and when she is older we can use the sofabed but for now she really enjoys sleeping on it. Take care......Michael'}
{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B002IVTPIW', 'answerTime': 'Jan 18, 2014', 'unixTime': 1390032000, 'question': 'What is the size of the bed in the travel bag?', 'answer': '24" long and approx 10" diameter without the pump. If your going to store the pump with the bag add another 5" at least. It\'s hard to store the pump with the bag, as you have to fold the mattress perfectly to get it all in the bag.'}
