{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B002JOX6FG', 'answerTime': 'Jan 23, 2014', 'unixTime': 1390464000, 'question': 'How tall does it get?', 'answer': "These are indeterminate, so technically they have no set limit of just how tall they can get. If you live in a temperate zone, I'd say expect around 3-4 feet at least, possibly 5 if they're vigorous and take well to your area."}
