{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B002LTR39E', 'answerTime': 'Dec 4, 2013', 'unixTime': 1386144000, 'question': 'What is fabric content/thread count difference between Quickzip organic crib sheets and Quickzip crib sheets? Any difference in washing/wear results?', 'answer': 'I do not own the normal crib sheets but have the quickzip sheets -- we are going on year two and they have held up perfectly. the 15 seconds it takes to change the sheets make an enormous difference. Soft like normal sheets and apparently indestructable.'}
