{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B002MBVH98', 'answerTime': 'Jan 11, 2015', 'unixTime': 1420963200, 'question': 'is it waterproof?', 'answerType': 'Y', 'answer': 'Yes! Its a strong plastic and if placed correctly, you don\'t have to worry about any "accidents" from baby. My 9 mobth old has had several accidents already since she moves around quite a bit and can actually sit there and remove her diaper lol. Its been a lifesaver. The only downfall is that it does make some noise if you push hard on it since it is plastic but when LO is in there, we don\'t hear anything. Also, there was no smell when I removed it from the wrapper and I am VERY sensitive to chemical smells so that was truly a plus. Just my honest opinion &#9786; Hope that helps!'}
