{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B002MXP3SM', 'answerTime': 'Mar 30, 2015', 'unixTime': 1427698800, 'question': 'your swirly hook description lists minimum &amp; max weight. What are these capacities?', 'answer': "I use mine a couple of ways. I have them on each walker. My in house walker has one which always has a set if tongs for picking up things when I can't bend. My outside walker has two. If I need to carry parcels, eg small bags of groceries, or the occasional take out food. Additionally, they work to hang the folded walker on the mobile carts while shopping. Hope this is helpful."}
