{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B002SG7JSU', 'answerTime': 'Dec 14, 2013', 'unixTime': 1387008000, 'question': 'How do I really fix it. I must be dumb. I have been given the corners and some pieces of 3M adhesive strips. Those strips do not seem to be 2 way.', 'answer': 'The adhesive stripes that come with the corner guards are double sided tape. You can purchase removable double sided foam tape on Amazon if you need extra. Something like this: http://www.amazon.com/Scotch-108-Double-Sided-Removable-Pack-MMM108/dp/B0057XUVKO/ref=sr_1_8?ie=UTF8&qid=1387014316&sr=8-8&keywords=double+sided+removable+foam+tape'}
{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B002SG7JSU', 'answerTime': 'Oct 28, 2014', 'unixTime': 1414479600, 'question': "Does this fit on the corner of a couch so that it doesn't put a small hole in the wall? My couch is angled in a corner.", 'answerType': '?', 'answer': 'It fits perfectly on corners of a coffee table. Never tried it on a couch.'}
