{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B002SG7JSU', 'answerTime': 'Apr 24, 2014', 'unixTime': 1398322800, 'question': 'Will these work on a stone fireplace?', 'answerType': 'N', 'answer': "If there are corners that jut out I would think so but if not I would try to find the foam table edging. And I'd also recommend getting your own command strips if you are going to attAch to stone because it may be more difficult to stick to than a glass or wood surface."}
{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B002SG7JSU', 'answerTime': 'Feb 21, 2014', 'unixTime': 1392969600, 'question': 'We misplaced the 3M adhesive strips that came with the package. Is there something else we can use to put the edge guards on?', 'answerType': '?', 'answer': "Both Lowe's and Home Depot carry an assortment of double side tape in varying widths and lengths. The price varies by size and amount purchased. There is, of course, Super Glue, but unless you plan to leave these in place forever, the double sided tape is the best course of action."}
{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B002SNAK6G', 'answerTime': 'Apr 7, 2013', 'unixTime': 1365318000, 'question': 'does it fit on a glass table?', 'answerType': 'Y', 'answer': "Yes but unless it was very thick I wouldn't put it on a glass table."}
