{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B002SW3F0A', 'answerTime': 'Nov 14, 2013', 'unixTime': 1384416000, 'question': 'will these fit my 2 month old?', 'answerType': 'Y', 'answer': "I put them on my 4 month old. I was concerned about how tight they were, but I just took them off every hour or so to give his head a break. The biggest issue was with his neck control. They are pretty heavy for a baby's head to hold up, so just make sure you provide plenty of support. I did notice on the package that they are made for older children, however, so keep that in mind."}
