{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B002SZT35S', 'answerTime': 'Mar 17, 2015', 'unixTime': 1426575600, 'question': 'For a Sharp Aquos 70 in,99.2 lbs, on top of an appropriate sized TV stand, will these straps work? Wall or furniture mount suggested for kid safety?', 'answer': "At almost 100 pds I'm not sure these straps are adaquite. Where to attache the straps should be determined by where the danger to the set comes from. My set is at a corner where to room and an entrance hall dissect so that passersby might inadvertently hit it, but the achors hold the set (30 pds) rock steady so the the risk is minimal. Every set up should require a different response to the danger. Good luck."}
