{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B002T1HH0E', 'answerTime': 'Feb 16, 2014', 'unixTime': 1392537600, 'question': 'Where are the screw holes that are a distraction. Some customers comment on how these are unsightly.', 'answer': 'You can see them at the joints of the sides to each other and to the mattress holder platform piece. Very unsightly. I got the "lagoon" finish which is probably most noticeable since the piece is aqua and not a dark wood finish. Not happy. :/'}
