{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B002T1HH0E', 'answerTime': 'Feb 19, 2013', 'unixTime': 1361260800, 'question': 'What is the height at the top of the mattress at the highest setting? Then, how many inches to the top of the crib railing?', 'answer': 'I actually didn\'t use the casters (they\'re ugly!), so that takes a few inches off of the total height (floor to mattress top). But it\'s 18" from the BASE of the setting, where the mattress would rest, to the lowest railing. With a 7" mattress, the top of the mattress to the lowest railing is 11 inches.'}
