{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B002T5Q01C', 'answerTime': 'Feb 11, 2014', 'unixTime': 1392105600, 'question': "I have Flip diaper covers (not pocket diapers) and prefolds. Do I really need this product to help contain/absorb the poop? I'm not afraid of poop.", 'answerType': '?', 'answer': "I love them! I have flip diapers also, and I love that I can throw away most I the poop, and toss the diaper cover and pad directly into the laundry! I'm not afraid of poop either haha but it gets everywhere and it can be a real pain to clean! My suggestion would be to try a box, see if you find it's worth it! Good luck!"}
