{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B002TNBIEI', 'answerTime': 'Sep 17, 2013', 'unixTime': 1379401200, 'question': 'I need something for grandmas house, my 2.5 year old has a ring seat at home and loves it, he feels secure. he is BIG and 33 lbs will this work??', 'answer': "I'd say probably not. My 15 month old is 33 inches and 24lbs now and I think we may only have a another month or so before we have to transition to just using the actual bath tub. She is fine sitting in it but I can't lay her back properly to wash her hair. She's all scrunched up. We've been using this since about 7 months so it's given us a good run. Really an excellent tub that I will definitely be using for baby #2 until it's outgrown again."}
