{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B002U1G3NK', 'answerTime': 'Nov 5, 2013', 'unixTime': 1383638400, 'question': 'Is this bag easy to clean?', 'answerType': 'Y', 'answer': "I've had my bag for a little over a year and I haven had any major messes inside. The bottom has the little button feet to help it stand up and at keeps the bottom from getting dirty. Also, because of the color, it doesn't show dirt easily. I wipe it down with oxi clean spray if Clorox 2 to get small marks out. I really looked at a lot of bags before choosing this one and am really happy with it, espicially with such a great price compared to the Timmy & Lesley bags. Hope his helps."}
