{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B002UD661C', 'answerTime': 'Nov 16, 2014', 'unixTime': 1416124800, 'question': 'What is the thickness of the pad?', 'answer': "It is thin as a flannel blanket, but more stiff than a blanket. I use it on a changing table, and my twin boys leaked on it plenty of times. Every time, I am amazed with how absorbent it is, yet the liquid doesn't go through the other side."}
