{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B002UN4G0U', 'answerTime': 'Nov 20, 2013', 'unixTime': 1384934400, 'question': "There seems to be two versions in grey, the lighter one has a chest strap and the other doesn't. anyone bought the lighter one to confirm?", 'answer': "Sorry, I gave the one I bought to my 3-year old granddaughter, so I can't remember about the strap. But I do know that she absolutely loved this item, especially since her mother wore one to hold her baby sister. Both always wore it with the baby on the front, so the strap would be in back. I would think that a strap would be advisable if you have a choice."}
