{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B002V92XAS', 'answerTime': 'Feb 13, 2015', 'unixTime': 1423814400, 'question': 'I recently refilled the cartridge with the right amount of A&amp;H baking soda. Now the diaper smell is HORRIBLE. What do I do??', 'answer': "The diaper smell is horrible in itself. It's why you have to make sure you close the bin all the way. Regardless, every time you take the bag out, some smell is still going to seep out when you throw it out. It's not a panacea to diaper smell. it's only better than a lot of diaper bins out there."}
