{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B002VHBU2W', 'answerTime': 'Apr 25, 2014', 'unixTime': 1398409200, 'question': 'How many diapers does this hold? And what receptacle and size receptacle is good/recommended?', 'answer': "Well I have 26 diapers and when almost all of them are dirty it's a little more than half full. so it holds a lot! I got a plain white 13 gallon trash can with a step lever for the lid and it works great. I think I got it from target. Hope this helps!"}
