{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B002VHBU2W', 'answerTime': 'Sep 27, 2013', 'unixTime': 1380265200, 'question': 'Which side goes out? Should the waxy side go inside (next to the diapers) or toward the outside?', 'answer': "The waxy side goes on the inside and the seam is on the outside. That way it doesn't leak."}
