{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B002VHBU2W', 'answerTime': 'Oct 25, 2013', 'unixTime': 1382684400, 'question': "How does this close? I don't see a string. Thanks", 'answer': "It doesn't close. I use mine in a tall kitchen trash can. Once full I grab the whole thing and toss in the wash with the diapers. With smelly diapers you don't want it closed any way."}
{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B002VHBU2W', 'answerTime': 'Nov 11, 2013', 'unixTime': 1384156800, 'question': "Do you know if this pail bag would work with the Busch Systems Odorless Cloth Diaper Pail? I'm considering getting the 7-gallon pail", 'answer': "Not exactly sure, but what I like about the liner is that it is elastic at the top so it should fit over just about any diaper pail or hamper. I have 4; 2 to interchange for the baby's room and 2 for our master bath because my hubby is a sweater when he works out! The liner conceals the wetness and oder which is great and you can wash and dry them each time. Mine still look new! I would just check the dementions of the pail (primarily the length) with that of the liner. Hope it works! Very satisfied with our purchase!"}
