{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B002VPCPRS', 'answerTime': 'Jan 29, 2011', 'unixTime': 1296288000, 'question': 'Does the handle feel a little loose to you too? Is this a problem with just my stroller or is that just the way it is?', 'answer': 'I had a similar problem with this stroller and it ended up they put the wrong size screws in my packaging and they were not long enough. Since I have replaced the screws the handle seems to a bit more secure. The screws that came with my stroller were approximately an inch long and the screws the company replaced with were approximately 2 to 2.5 inches in length. Contact the company if you feel the screws are the wrong length. I hope this helps.'}
