{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B002VPCPRS', 'answerTime': 'Oct 17, 2010', 'unixTime': 1287298800, 'question': 'Twins: Any suggestions?', 'answer': 'We purchased the red one for our grandbabies when they were born. The stroller is great the only exception is that it is very heavy to lift out of the car. We liked the fact that the carrier and seats are front to back instead of side by side as it makes it easier to fit down an isle when shopping. The girls can face forward to face each other as it is interchangeable. Also we purchased the top bars to hold the baby carriers which made it very convient. We currently use an umbroller when on short trips to the store etc. but the stroller is definately used when we are out for the day and they want to lay down to rest. They are 18 months now and are a little small for their age being twins but it was well worth the money spent.'}
