{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B002VPCPRS', 'answerTime': 'Jun 5, 2010', 'unixTime': 1275721200, 'question': "will my toddler fit? Just wondering if my son (35lbs) will fit and be able to be buckled in...he's always been kinda chubby from birth and im having a new baby soon...he's 18 months old and like i said about 35lbs now...So would he fit in the front...", 'answerType': 'Y', 'answer': 'The reason I chose this stroller is for my 2 1/2 year old. I can put her in either the front OR the back seat. I normally put my toddler in the back and have the baby in front facing me. That makes the heavier child being directly over the rear wheels, making it easier to turn. No other stroller offers this. The buckles are big enough to buckle my toddler and her big stuffy in with her. It is almost as big as she is. Before he out grew the length of the belts, he would be to tall for it. Oh, and both seats are the same. So you can put him in either seat. Hope this helps.'}
{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B002VPCPRS', 'answerTime': 'Apr 30, 2010', 'unixTime': 1272610800, 'question': 'contour tandem stroller: Anyone know if the Contour Tandem Stroller with attachments fits Chicco car seats?', 'answer': "According to their website, you can only use one carseat attachment for Chicco seats. Read their list carefully because not all carseats can be used with the attachment. Which annoys me because the carseat I plan to get, can't be used with the attachment at all."}
