{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B002WB2G9I', 'answerTime': 'Jan 16, 2015', 'unixTime': 1421395200, 'question': 'Does this stroller recline back at all?', 'answerType': '?', 'answer': "Not much- it has a toggle on the back that will let you move it a little (kinda like a zip tie) but your child won't be able to lie down. That hasn't stopped our kids from falling asleep in in though. It's an ok little umbrella stroller but does not have any bells or whistles- good because it's light and compact- don't expext much more from it though."}
