{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B002WB2GBQ', 'answerTime': 'Apr 15, 2014', 'unixTime': 1397545200, 'question': 'Is this light enough for me to carry on and off a bus or subway? For NYC travel. Thanks!', 'answer': 'Absolutely. This stroller does not weigh much. It can easily be picked up with one hand, preferably folded. I will say, though, that it is not exactly a one-hand-close type of stroller.'}
