{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B002WGI5SE', 'answerTime': 'Oct 3, 2014', 'unixTime': 1412319600, 'question': 'Does this come with a lid? Can it be used in a bottle warmer (this is the only way that our daycare will heat a bottle)?', 'answer': "It comes w a lid but it's not the kind of lid that allows it not to leak, it just covers the nipple/spout. I'm not sure if it can go in a bottle warmer. It's stainless steel & I would suggest to get the silicone sleeve bc without it, the stainless steel becomes cold to the touch w cold milk in it. Not sure if the silicone sleeve could go in a bottle warmer either. However, it does state that you can put hot food in the bottles (ie soup). So maybe a bottle warmer could work?? Wish I could've helped more :/ Maybe email the company directly to check. Good luck!"}
