{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B002X7DDMK', 'answerTime': 'Nov 22, 2013', 'unixTime': 1385107200, 'question': 'Is the front wheel fixed. If we need to turn, do we lift the stroller always?', 'answerType': 'Y', 'answer': 'The front wheel is fixed, and yet to turn while running, I never felt like I had to jerk the stroller sideways or lift it in order to turn. e.g. turning around a corner while running, I would just point it in the that direction and run. Our previous lemon jogger did have that jerking/lifting sensation to turn and it was awful. This is an awesome jogger.'}
