{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B002X7DDMK', 'answerTime': 'May 5, 2014', 'unixTime': 1399273200, 'question': "What pros does this have over the summit x3? if the summit has suspension wouldn't that be better for jogging? I intend to train for a half marathon.", 'answer': "The X3 is a hybrid, which can be used for everyday use as well as jogging. I already own the city elite, so I purchased the FIT to run with. I'm not sure but I believe the fit is lighter. Most races are on road ways so the fit sould be just fine at any race. Fit has worked well for me and have recommended it to many runners."}
