{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B002X7VDHW', 'answerTime': 'Apr 25, 2011', 'unixTime': 1303714800, 'question': "Bob Revolution vs Baby Jogger Summit XC: So, let's be concise, pros and cons of each, who has had a chance to use both and have a good comparison point of view?", 'answer': "since you asked this a few months ago - did you decide yet? :-) the reviews of the summit 360 single and double seem to have a lot of people who have had both. the 360 and xc are pretty similar. i'm waiting till a local store has the xc in person to try one. i have a bob dualie and now need a single - the summit seems to have a much less annoying harness adjustment system and takes a taller kid. if it really feels as solid as the bob i will probably go with the summit. otherwise i will get an old single bob as i don't care for the new bob at all."}
