{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B002X9JQBA', 'answerTime': 'Nov 1, 2013', 'unixTime': 1383289200, 'question': 'Are the mattress brackets as shown (mid-way &amp; low), or are they as some describe, as very high and low?', 'answer': 'only very high and very low, no middle brackes. apparently they did at one point make it with middle brackets but no longer. my daughter has been in this crib since birth and will be turning 1 on sunday. she could very easly make it another year at least. We did have to upgrade to the 2inch mattress though. the one that comes with the crib is more of a mat. when it is time to drop the crib it is deep enough to keep the child safe but wont break ur back.'}
