{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B002XMRGMS', 'answerTime': 'Aug 9, 2013', 'unixTime': 1376031600, 'question': 'Can a 2-1/2-3 year old preschooler sit in this seat? I desperately need some sort of strappable booster a seat for my counter height island chairs', 'answerType': 'Y', 'answer': "My daughter is 2 but is 35 lb and 3 feet tall. She fits in it fine. It's great because u can pack a cup and a few other necessities and not have to lug around a diaper bag or wonder if the restraunt staff is cleaning the high chairs and booster seats. This has been a great purhance for us. Would Recommend it for sure."}
