{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B002YQPDFK', 'answerTime': 'Apr 10, 2015', 'unixTime': 1428649200, 'question': 'What are the dimensions of the inside of this bathtub, where the baby sits?', 'answer': 'It comes to a point on one end, so at the largest point, it is 15" x 26", and at the smallest point, it is 13" across at the non-point end and is approx. 22" before it starts going to a point. It fit my 2 1/2 y.o. just fine. These in no way include the "cup" holders on the pointed end. We\'ve had two of these now and would go buy another if we needed another! Hope this helps.'}
