{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B002ZG7JPQ', 'answerTime': 'Jun 21, 2013', 'unixTime': 1371798000, 'question': 'Crib dimensions are listed as 38" x 27.9." Portacrib mattresses (Dream on Me 3", Davinci Crescent) seem to be 38" by 24". Will there a be a big gap?', 'answerType': '?', 'answer': 'I put a bumper on mine. It was good. I loved it. My son was 23 months when we moved him to a full sized crib. It worked exactly as planned.'}
{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B002ZG7JPQ', 'answerTime': 'Dec 26, 2013', 'unixTime': 1388044800, 'question': 'What is the height from the platform the mattress rests on (lowest level) to the top of the front rail? Wondering if this is deeper than 24.', 'answer': '27 5/8 inches. Our crib is currently set at the lowest level, so it was easy to measure! :)'}
{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B002ZG7JPQ', 'answerTime': 'Jan 10, 2015', 'unixTime': 1420876800, 'question': "when will baby outgrow it? we want to use it instead of a regular crib but don't want 10 transition 2 a toddler bed until child is about 15-18 months.", 'answer': "Our son was about 14-16 months when he started climbing out of it. He's been in the 90th percentile for height."}
{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B002ZG7JPQ', 'answerTime': 'Mar 17, 2015', 'unixTime': 1426575600, 'question': 'can you use any crib mattress for the crib', 'answerType': 'N', 'answer': 'No. You should check for the dimensions before you order them. I checked the dimensions of the crib and mattress before ordering at amazon.com'}
{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B002ZG7JPQ', 'answerTime': 'Nov 15, 2013', 'unixTime': 1384502400, 'question': 'does the mattress sti on metal springs or a sheet of plywood', 'answer': "The mini crib does not have the same support system of metal springs like its full sized sibling. The mattress will sit on a plywood board. My daughter is big for her age and very rambunctious and often will jump herself to sleep for naps. The mini crib works well even though I was hesitant on the wood base. We use it over at my mom's house so its not her primary bed. Works well without complaints or issues 2 years now."}
{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B002ZG7JPQ', 'answerTime': 'Jan 9, 2014', 'unixTime': 1389254400, 'question': "When the mattress is in the highest setting (for a newborn) how many inches is it from the top? I don't want to bend down far to get the baby", 'answer': 'With the mattress in it at the highest setting there is 4-5 inches depending the mattress thickness that you buy'}
{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B002ZG7JPQ', 'answerTime': 'Dec 21, 2013', 'unixTime': 1387612800, 'question': 'Is there a conversion kit to allow this mini crib to be used as a toddler bed?', 'answerType': 'Y', 'answer': "Toddler bed with the 3/4 rail conversion attachment? No. Toddler bed i.e. twin bed with head and foot board? Yes. This mini crib goes from a crib with four adjustable heights, to a twin sized big girl or boy bed. There are no conversion sets for the 3/4 rail length that would go on one of the two longer sides. Only the full sized crib goes from crib to toddler bed to full size big girl or boy bed with head and foot board. It is still a great bed. My large almost 2 year old daughter still fits, barley, but won't be able to use this until she has graduated to a bed."}
{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B002ZG7JPQ', 'answerTime': 'Mar 28, 2015', 'unixTime': 1427526000, 'question': 'Does the mattress come with the crib', 'answerType': '?', 'answer': 'The mattress that comes with the crib is maybe 1". I purchased the Dream On Me 3 Portable Crib Mattress separately.'}
{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B002ZG7JPQ', 'answerTime': 'Jan 10, 2015', 'unixTime': 1420876800, 'question': 'does it turn into a headboard and footboard?', 'answerType': '?', 'answer': 'Yes it will. The conversion kit is separate to turn it into a twin bed. I also purchased another mattress (3" one - dream on me) since the mattress provided is only 1" thick. I purchased this crib for over night stays with my grand daughter. When she is ready for the crib to convert I will need to do research on the kit. Most have stated there are no slots to support a box spring & mattress. I know a simple fix would be 4-5 slats or a pc. of plywood in order to obtain the safety of the bed. This crib IS lightweight yet very sturdy and is perfect for a small room.'}
{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B002ZG7JPQ', 'answerTime': 'Feb 26, 2015', 'unixTime': 1424937600, 'question': 'Will the Dream on me 3 inch portable crib matress fit nice in this crib?', 'answerType': 'Y', 'answer': 'Yes, This is the one I purchased to go on top of the thin mattress that came with the crib.'}
