{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B002ZG7JPG', 'answerTime': 'Jan 10, 2015', 'unixTime': 1420876800, 'question': 'does it turn into a headboard and footboard?', 'answerType': '?', 'answer': 'Yes it will. The conversion kit is separate to turn it into a twin bed. I also purchased another mattress (3" one - dream on me) since the mattress provided is only 1" thick. I purchased this crib for over night stays with my grand daughter. When she is ready for the crib to convert I will need to do research on the kit. Most have stated there are no slots to support a box spring & mattress. I know a simple fix would be 4-5 slats or a pc. of plywood in order to obtain the safety of the bed. This crib IS lightweight yet very sturdy and is perfect for a small room.'}
