{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B00318CLUK', 'answerTime': 'Mar 24, 2014', 'unixTime': 1395644400, 'question': 'How leak-proof is this cup? Can it be stowed on its side or upside-down without leaking? Thanks!', 'answer': 'it can leak a little bit but it doesnt pour out like other cups. I loved these cups for my little one. one thing i noticed is that after your child sips on it there can be a lil bit of liquid in top of the spot and that was what would leak out. but usually only a few drops. no sippy cup is 100 percent leak proof. at least i have never found any and ive had several brands. i suggest checking toysrus or babiesrus online cus they have them on sale sometimes for buy one get one half off and they have very cute designs as well. i hope this helps! i loved these cups! i used these and the bigger ones with the hard spout and also the ones with the straws. i love the thermos to it so it keeps milk and drinks colder for longer.'}
