{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B00318CLUK', 'answerTime': 'Sep 17, 2013', 'unixTime': 1379401200, 'question': "i'd like to know if this cup is good for cold seasons? will it keep the fluid warm long enough?", 'answer': "I've never put hot liquid in it, but the thermos works wonders for keeping it cold, so I would image it would translate the other way around to some degree. I have left my daughter's cup in the car on a really hot day (over 100) for hours and the water inside was still cool even though the outside was almost too hot to handle just to give you an idea on how it holds the temperature of what's inside."}
