{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B00318CLTG', 'answerTime': 'Jan 9, 2015', 'unixTime': 1420790400, 'question': 'Is it possible to order the upper straw separately? It has began to discolor but the rest of the cup is in great condition.', 'answerType': 'Y', 'answer': "Yes. Just call Thermos at 1-800-831-9242. It costs $1 for the straw and mouthpiece combo and $3 for shipping. You can order up to 5 sets for the same $3 shipping fee. You may be on hold a while when you call but once they answer they're helpful and quick. Just make sure you have the model number of the bottle handy."}
