{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B0031E1GEG', 'answerTime': 'Dec 1, 2013', 'unixTime': 1385884800, 'question': 'Can you use the thin munchkin brand straw cleaners to clean this one or does the zoli use a different size?', 'answer': 'The munchkin brand is too big for the Zoli. It wont fit. The Zoli straw is pretty thin, which is why I recommend using the Zoli Bot straw cleaner.'}
{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B0031E1GEG', 'answerTime': 'Nov 7, 2013', 'unixTime': 1383811200, 'question': 'This cup leaks like crazy and we only put milk and water in it, why does the liquid seep up through the straw?', 'answer': "The tighter you screw the lid, the more likely the liquid will come back up through the straw. It's possible to screw the lid on just tight enough that it doesn't leak but not so tight that it comes back up through the straw."}
