{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B0031M9EHE', 'answerTime': 'Apr 3, 2014', 'unixTime': 1396508400, 'question': 'I am concerned that the tension of the bars is extreme. If the ties give can it hurt the baby? Any reason for concern?', 'answer': "No, no reason for concern. The rods are very sturdy and secured by plastic hooks under the floor mat, not ties. In the end if you are worried about a bungee type effect if one of the plastic pieces came undone, don't be. It would just slump over like a tent would if you took out he rods. Great product, mine is still in perfect condition after almost 6 months."}
