{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B0033LUUMQ', 'answerTime': 'Jan 13, 2014', 'unixTime': 1389600000, 'question': 'does it fit maclaren triumph and baby jogger summit xc', 'answerType': '?', 'answer': "Sorry, I don't know first hand for those strollers. I used it on the Peg P Velo and the Baby Trend Expedition jogging strollers. I can't imagine why you couldn't use the Nomie in the Triumph or Summit. the openings for install seem very friendly and give adjustment options. Width won't be a concern. Foot / leg length will probably not be a concern either (too long, might catch in the front tires). I didn't have any problems with my 2 strollers catching in the wheels. In my experience the Nomie was very universal."}
