{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B0034XQXB0', 'answerTime': 'Feb 17, 2014', 'unixTime': 1392624000, 'question': 'how much does this stroller weigh and how difficult is it to get into car', 'answer': 'Under the product information it states it is 28 pounds but honestly it feels lighter than that to me. It is easy to get into an SUV, for example I drive a Jeep and it fits in the back without removing the wheels. However, the wheels come off and back on very simply so you can remove them for tighter spaces.'}
{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B0034XQXB0', 'answerTime': 'Dec 27, 2012', 'unixTime': 1356595200, 'question': "What's the maximum height and maximum weight for a child to be able to fit into this comfortably?", 'answer': "I honestly don't know - but my daughter is almost 3 & is 28 lbs. We're both quite comfortable with this stroller even after a year. Hope this helps..."}
{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B0034XQXB0', 'answerTime': 'Mar 24, 2014', 'unixTime': 1395644400, 'question': "Has anyone used this on the beach? I'm looking for a stroller that will push through sand.", 'answerType': '?', 'answer': 'You need a stroller that has bigger wheels in the front than the back to go in sand easily. The bugaboo cameleon will allow you to flip tires, rather easily, to do that.'}
{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B0034XQXB0', 'answerTime': 'Mar 1, 2014', 'unixTime': 1393660800, 'question': 'too big for a newborn?', 'answer': 'Yes but you can put a carrier in the stroller and do it that way.'}
