{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B0035ER8JE', 'answerTime': 'Jan 12, 2015', 'unixTime': 1421049600, 'question': 'Is this easier to fold and put away then a pack and play?', 'answerType': 'Y', 'answer': "While it doesn't fold as small it is easier to fold. Nice and flat with mattress unless you get thicker mattress for it. Fits in back of mini van standing up or laying flat while folded."}
