{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B0035ER8G2', 'answerTime': 'Sep 23, 2013', 'unixTime': 1379919600, 'question': "What are the 2 mattress position heights? I'm trying to match the height close to the height of my bed to use the crib as an attached side sleeper.", 'answer': 'My crib has 3 possible heights for the mattress. The mattress support sits at approximately 14", 19" or 24" from the ground with wheels on 13", 18" or 23" without the wheels. These measurements do not include the thickness of the mattress. It is difficult to measure because the bracket that supports the mattress brings the mattress about 3" lower than the holes that it screws in to. I hope this helps. From the bottom of the leg (no wheel) to the bottom border is 12"'}
