{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B0035JL93U', 'answerTime': 'Feb 26, 2014', 'unixTime': 1393401600, 'question': 'Are these good for nighttime? My son is fully potty trained during the day, I will just be using them at night and I have not really seen any reviews in regards to nighttime usage.', 'answerType': '?', 'answer': "Hi Megan- I also bought these to use over my child's underwear at bedtime, as he is fully potty trained in his conscious hours. Unfortunately, they did NOT keep the wetness in. They leaked pretty much every night. If the elastic around the thighs and stomach are tight enough to hold back wetness, then they hurt him. If they were remotely comfortable, they leaked. These are basically useful for those kids who are almost making it to the potty, but needs those few extra seconds. Hope this helps. Good luck."}
