{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B0036SG5LG', 'answerTime': 'Aug 15, 2012', 'unixTime': 1345014000, 'question': 'Anyone know if these work with the delta Eclipse 4 in 1?? I have the black cherry delta ecplise and was wondering if these work with that crib as wel??', 'answer': 'http://www.deltaenterprise.com/ I wondered the same thing. Above is the company website with a contact us link at the bottom of the page if you want to contact them. I first replied thinking they would work, but found the following reply posted at another store\'s site when someone asked the question. It is marked as answered by Delta. "No, this rail is for the Canton collection 7785 or 7888, for the Eclipse crib you will need the 000560 metal bed rails." That is a bummer since the wood rails would have looked much nicer and the Eclipse is not a cheap crib.'}
{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B0036SG5LG', 'answerTime': 'Nov 2, 2013', 'unixTime': 1383375600, 'question': 'Does anyone know what the weight limit is for the bed when these are used to convert a crib into a full size bed?', 'answer': 'Our daughter is a jumper and jumps all the time on the bed so I actually installed four 2X4s in between the rails and plywood on top of it. I had Home Depot cut the 2X4s and plywood to size. Now me and my daughter both can sleep on it if needed.'}
{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B0036SG5LG', 'answerTime': 'Apr 5, 2015', 'unixTime': 1428217200, 'question': 'Will these fit the Delta Bentley #7820?', 'answerType': '?', 'answer': "To be honest, probably not. These didn't even fit the Canton bed I had. After much finagling with them (drilling different holes, trying to put a bracket on it, etc) we gave up and threw the bed rails away and are now using a metal bed frame and only the headboard. It was a huge waste of money for us and very disappointing. I would try to find someone with a Bentley to see if it worked for them"}
