{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B0038JDAJ8', 'answerTime': 'Aug 20, 2014', 'unixTime': 1408518000, 'question': 'Can you clean it using bottle sterilizers?', 'answerType': 'Y', 'answer': "Idk about a bottle sterilizer (it's just super hot water, yes?) But I wash ours in the sink with her other washables (supply cups, pacifiers, medicine syringes, spoons and forks) before I do the other (adult) dishes. I use the dish cloth to scrub it clean and then use super hot water to rinse it off. Comes out looking like new. I haven't used a bottle sterilizer so I don't know. If it's just really hot water, I don't see why not? I mean, don't back and try to get at me if yours breaks or something. It's just what we do."}
