{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B0038JDAJ8', 'answerTime': 'Jul 1, 2014', 'unixTime': 1404198000, 'question': 'Is this the same or different material as the original Sophie the Giraffe?', 'answer': 'I believe it is the same, but it feels different because its solid and has no air in it. Big sophie has air and is much more "squishy" and bendable. This is a true teether and harder.'}
