{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B0038OM4PO', 'answerTime': 'Jan 9, 2015', 'unixTime': 1420790400, 'question': 'QUESTION! I realize this takes some tweaking to get it just right, but should it open when pulled on without pushing the little button?', 'answer': 'No, tighten one of the top adjusters a few more turns. The little black triangle of the latch should be at least 1/8" inside the two little grooves on top of the gate.'}
