{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B003AJHDQW', 'answerTime': 'Dec 13, 2014', 'unixTime': 1418457600, 'question': 'Is this all I need to go with the Thirsties Duo Wrap Cover or is there something else? I am a little overwhelmed learning about cloth diapering!', 'answer': "You need these and a cover. And then you'll need pins or snappis to hold the prefold together. I trifold mine so I don't need pins or snappis, but not all covers allow for that. I don't have any thirsties covers so I don't know if you can just fold them in those."}
{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B003AJHDQW', 'answerTime': 'Sep 15, 2014', 'unixTime': 1410764400, 'question': 'I prepped those prefolders using warm washes, four times and dry between them. But I find them balling up. Is it normal? How to deal with it? Thanks!', 'answer': 'Im not sure what you mean by "balling up"? It should almost look like a quilt with pockets of puffiness. If that is what you mean then yes it is normal.'}
