{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B003ANXD9Y', 'answerTime': 'Apr 27, 2011', 'unixTime': 1303887600, 'question': 'Carseat connection: Can this stroller be used w/ a Graco carseat?', 'answer': "I believe only the Chicco Keyfit/Keyfit 30 (Chicco's infant carrier carseat) will work. Their carseats are a different size than most (most are made to also fit in the top portion of a grocery store shopping cart, Chicco's do not) so other brand's carseats won't fit in (at least not correctly and securely). I have the Chicco carseat already and I have the opposite problem - when I look at info for double strollers made by other brands the Chicco has limited options of what it will fit into. Graco makes double strollers and you might check to see if the Graco carseats fit into Baby Trend double strollers as well."}
{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B003ANXD9Y', 'answerTime': 'Jun 28, 2013', 'unixTime': 1372402800, 'question': 'What are the folded dimensions of this stroller?', 'answer': 'Roughly 44 1/2 inches long and 23 wide whwn you remove front canopy and cup holders. It fits in the back of my subaru impreza hatchback. It is about the size of the folded single chicco keyfit stroller.'}
{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B003ANXD9Y', 'answerTime': 'Jun 4, 2011', 'unixTime': 1307170800, 'question': 'Does it Require a Carseat?', 'answerType': 'N', 'answer': 'You do not need a carseat.'}
{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B003ANXD9Y', 'answerTime': 'Jul 7, 2011', 'unixTime': 1310022000, 'question': 'Folded up size? Can anyone tell me the dimensions of this stroller when folded up?', 'answer': 'I\'m wondering about the dimensions while folded, too, since I have pretty limited trunk space. For you, though, one of the reviewers mentioned this: "It doesn\'t fit well in al vehicles. I have a Mazda 3 and wont get in the trunk, my wife has a VW Jetta (Bora) and it doesn\'t get in in a symetrical way, meanning it goes like in diagonal, so it leaves you like a triangle space to place grosaries or bags." So it looks like it will fit, but won\'t give you much space for anything else. Good luck!'}
