{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B003GAMOBY', 'answerTime': 'Jan 14, 2014', 'unixTime': 1389686400, 'question': 'Good afternoon! Friend can tell me if the battery charger is dual voltage? Can be charged in only 220 w or 110?', 'answer': 'There is no battery charger. It plugs can plug into the wall but it does not have a rechargeable battery. It only works will 110v and has a US standard two prong plug. (220 is only used for appliances in the US and has a different kind of plug.) It can use a 9-volt battery.'}
