{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B003GC4SX4', 'answerTime': 'Jan 29, 2014', 'unixTime': 1390982400, 'question': 'will be buying it for the pouch, (extra storage) hence adults (not infant seats) will sit on it...how stable? how comfortable?', 'answer': 'You should probably look for something else. Pockets are not that big and the top part of the mat will tend to flop over since nothing is holding it up. This is really for infant seats to hold it up in place. The only thing that holds it in place is a piece of plastic that gets wedged into the space between the backrest and the seat.'}
