{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B003II79P0', 'answerTime': 'Aug 7, 2014', 'unixTime': 1407394800, 'question': 'How would you rate the security of this harness? I have a fuzzy backpack type harness and my daughter is able to escape easily.', 'answer': 'I thought it was quite strong. The velcro that holds it together is quite large. My daughter was actually leaning forward in the "look mommy I\'m flying " position, and it held. The Velcro strip is probably 2 inches wide by several inches long. Matter of fact, it\'s kind of a pain to get it undone. And if the shoulder straps are adjusted correctly, there\'s no way they can get out in my opinion. I think you will be happy. We were. And I\'m really picky.'}
