{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B003II79P0', 'answerTime': 'May 14, 2014', 'unixTime': 1400050800, 'question': 'my baby is 1 year old,can i use this for her ?also how long is the string?', 'answer': 'The strap is solid but soft enough. So, I do not see why you should not use it. I do not know the exact measurement of the strap but it is neither too long nor too short , allowing our three year old walk independently but within our sight (especially at the airport and crowded park entrances). Of course, as with similar items, I would not leave a young child unattended with this item.'}
