{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B003IIQ884', 'answerTime': 'Apr 8, 2014', 'unixTime': 1396940400, 'question': "Based on reviews, I'm concerned about the durability of this back pack. How long would you say it lasted for you?", 'answer': "I had this backpack for a few weeks before the seam on the front pocket started coming out. I basically had a hole about 3 inches long in my backpack until it got stolen a few months later. I ended up spending $80 on an Okkatots backpack which I love way more than this Eddie Bauer and I've been using it for over a year and now carry my toddler and newborns things in it and it's still in near perfect condition! I definitely think it is worth it to spend the money to get something that is going to last."}
