{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B003JJX2IG', 'answerTime': 'Jun 3, 2013', 'unixTime': 1370242800, 'question': 'Does it flush well? Would it flush well in Europe?', 'answer': "I don't think I would flush these, unless you were at one of those super powerful commercial toilets that would suck down a Mack truck. When we use them I just throw it in the trash when we are done instead of flushing it. I don't know how it would flush in Europe, but I suspect it wouldn't be much better there than in the US."}
