{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B003JQLFWE', 'answerTime': 'Sep 1, 2014', 'unixTime': 1409554800, 'question': 'How long does it take to dry when you wash the fabric? Does it he fabric get soaking wet when rain?', 'answer': "Hi JenniferL, I'm pretty sure it doesn't take that long. It's been a while but I did wash it once in the machine in cold water, and hung it dry (the spin cycle made the drying easier). Can't remember how long it took :/ but it was definitely quick enough for me to use later that evening as the fabric is breathable/mesh/polyester. When the stroller's covered, the exposed fabric only gets soaking wet when it pours but still my son was ALWAYS kept dry. Never had a major issue with this stroller. Hope this helps somewhat."}
{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B003JQLFWE', 'answerTime': 'Feb 21, 2014', 'unixTime': 1392969600, 'question': 'is this 2012 or 2013??', 'answer': "I'm not sure what year it is. I bought it in 2011 and this color was being sold at a discount, so it must have been an earlier model. The stroller is great! It does tip if you have a diaper bag hanging on it and your child gets out of the stroller, but the basket is a good size for an umbrella and easy to access."}
{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B003JQLFWE', 'answerTime': 'Nov 9, 2013', 'unixTime': 1383984000, 'question': 'is head cushion and shoulder strap inculed for this stroller (Is it 2012 or 2013 edition?)', 'answerType': '?', 'answer': "I now have two children, so my single Mac is in the attic. It did come with the shoulder strap. I do not remember about a head cushion. My daughter was not a stroller sleeper (or napper in general), so a hard cushion wasn't a big feature for me and I don't remember."}
