{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B003LNU8PK', 'answerTime': 'Oct 6, 2013', 'unixTime': 1381042800, 'question': 'WILL THIS WORK WITH A BABY TREND HIGHCHAIR?', 'answerType': 'Y', 'answer': "Yes. I put the Boon Flair Harness (5 pt.) in an older Baby Trend and works just fine. You'll need a couple of clips for anchoring the strap ends (non-buckle) behind chair, but these are easy to find or manufacture. We have been using for over a year now with no problem. Sure beats trying to clean old straps!"}
