{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B003LNU8PK', 'answerTime': '29 days ago', 'question': 'Will this work with ikea blames higchair', 'answerType': '?', 'answer': "I don't know if it will work with that particular brand. I bought it to update an old wooden high chair. My high chair had no attachment points so I had to make them. It was no big problem to do that. This is a versatile and easy-to-use harness that I can recommend to anyone. I know that this didn't really answer your question but in researching this purchase I found that most high chairs have the same built in attachment points"}
