{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B003LP94BW', 'answerTime': 'Jun 19, 2014', 'unixTime': 1403161200, 'question': 'Is there a maximum height recommended for this seat?', 'answerType': '?', 'answer': 'There is nothing in the official documentation that I can see about height. Only weight. Having ridden with this seat for months now, I can tell you that "max height" will definitely depend on the bike, seat position, and riding position. For a more standard road bike with a straight-ish top tube, (from a riding position seated on the bike) you would want to measure from your chin to the top tube, then subtract 2 inches (seat height). Compare that measurement to the distance between your child\'s outer hip bone and the top of their helmet. That should give you a rough idea of fit.'}
{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B003LP94BW', 'answerTime': 'May 9, 2014', 'unixTime': 1399618800, 'question': "Are mounting instructions available online? I am trying to understand whether this would mount on a woman's bike frame.", 'answerType': 'Y', 'answer': 'Yes. The mount to the frame articulates separately from the seat mount, so you can choose the appropriate angle and then lock it in place.'}
