{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B003LP94BW', 'answerTime': 'Oct 19, 2014', 'unixTime': 1413702000, 'question': 'Would this be too small for a 5 year old', 'answerType': 'Y', 'answer': "depends how much they weigh and how tall! Our son is 3.5 and he's already 40'' and 40 lbs, so he won't be able to use it til he's 5--probably just another 4-6months--But it's really roomy and nice, so if your child is on the smaller size, it would probably work just great."}
{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B003LP94BW', 'answerTime': 'Oct 19, 2014', 'unixTime': 1413702000, 'question': 'What is the age range and weight limit to this item ?', 'answer': "I would use this with children 2-4. Any younger and I wouldn't trust the child to hold on and stay seated. My son is a slightly larger than over 3-year old, and he could get much bigger and still fit, but by the end of this year he'll probably want his own bike. Stability-wise, I wouldn't want a child over 40 lbs in this, although it is much more stable than the handle bar-mounted child seats. I don't know what age and weight ranges the manufacturer recommends."}
