{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B003OBYTSG', 'answerTime': 'Oct 4, 2014', 'unixTime': 1412406000, 'question': 'Does this work with the BOB Revolution SE Single Stroller with BOB Infant Car Seat Adapter for Britax ?', 'answerType': 'Y', 'answer': "If you have the Britax adapters it will work however, I'm not exactly sure it was designed to fit any other stroller than the B-Ready. To be honest I have the B-Agile, which was not designed for the bassinet, but i just take off the toddler seat and the bassinet fits perfect, again because of the adapters."}
