{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B003OBYTSG', 'answerTime': 'Aug 9, 2014', 'unixTime': 1407567600, 'question': 'Can the it be used to carry the child(i.e. is there a handle) or is it strictly meant for use when attached to the stroller or sitting on a stand?', 'answer': "That black thing at the top is grippy, so it works as a handle. I'm not sure what Britax officially says, but I carried my kids from room to room in it."}
