{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B003OBYTSG', 'answerTime': 'Dec 11, 2013', 'unixTime': 1386748800, 'question': "I've got one of these bassinets. Does anyone know where I could buy replacement pads or pad covers for it?", 'answer': "BritaxAccessories.shopzilla.com OR Store - Britax USA Buy Parts & Accessories; What's New; Travel Systems. View All Travel Systems; Travel System Builder; Buy Parts & Accessories; www.britaxusa.com/store"}
