{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B003OH0W90', 'answerTime': 'Jun 12, 2013', 'unixTime': 1371020400, 'question': 'Does this work with the britax double stroller and child tray and chicco carseat? The reviews make me think it might not.', 'answerType': '?', 'answer': 'No, this does not fit on the double stroller. I made the mistake of buying this with my britax double stroller and had to return it later. This adaptor is made for the single britax stroller, but not the side by side double stroller.'}
{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B003OH0W90', 'answerTime': 'Apr 7, 2014', 'unixTime': 1396854000, 'question': 'Does this adapter come with a strap to snap across the top of the car seat? Do the car seats actually snap into this adapter, or just rest on top?', 'answer': "Yes this adapter comes with straps to snap across the car seat. It actually doesn't snap on to the adapter it just rest on the top. But since the car seat is heavy you won't have any problems with it moving."}
