{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B003OH0W90', 'answerTime': 'Aug 20, 2013', 'unixTime': 1376982000, 'question': "Hi I just purchased this adapter to use with my chicco keyfit seat and my b-agile stroller. It doesn't seem to fit the stroller though. Any ideas?", 'answer': 'Did you put the wedge shaped adapters that attach to the sides first? They are two ~ 3-inch wedge pieces that come in the box with the B-Agile stroller. I almost missed them myself and they were hidden in the box.'}
