{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B003OH0W90', 'answerTime': 'Apr 7, 2014', 'unixTime': 1396854000, 'question': "Does the part of the adapter that hangs down go towards the infant's head or their feet? It fits my stroller both ways.", 'answerType': 'Y', 'answer': "The part that hangs down faces the front of the car seat. So if you have the car seat rear facing (toward you as you're pushing the stroller) it fits toward the back of the stroller. The car seat should snap in place if you have it in the right direction."}
{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B003OH0W90', 'answerTime': 'Mar 30, 2015', 'unixTime': 1427698800, 'question': 'I have seen reviews that the adapter works with the b-agile stroller but I bought it and it only seems to work with the baby facing forward. Am I miss', 'answerType': '?', 'answer': "I have the Britax B-Ready stroller. I can turn the adapter in any direction that I want my baby to face. On the adapter it is labeled which side is the front. It is for the front of your carseat not the front of the stroller itself. If you want baby facing you then have the 'front' of the adapter facing you. If you want the baby facing away from you then have the 'front' facing away."}
{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B003OH0W90', 'answerTime': 'Jan 7, 2014', 'unixTime': 1389081600, 'question': 'i just bought the Britax b-agile double stroller as well as this apater. Will my Britax b-agile car seat fit?', 'answerType': '?', 'answer': "You shouldn't need the adapter if the stroller and car seat are both Britax. We thought we needed that piece too and ended up returning it. The car seat fut perfectly into the stroller. We have the single b-agile stroller, and infant car seat, both purchased seperately."}
