{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B003OUWIMQ', 'answerTime': 'Jun 11, 2011', 'unixTime': 1307775600, 'question': 'Do new Britax carseats (August 2010 models) fit on airplanes? Has anyone tried installing any of the new Britax carseats (Marathon 70, Boulevard 70, or Boulevard 70 CS) on an airplane, rear-facing or front-facing?', 'answer': "Actually, only some airlines have that policy. Though I have found if you ask nicely and explain that you need a little time to put the carseat in and don't want to block the other passengers, some staff will let you even if it isn't their policy. However, some folks take it as a personal affront, which I don't really understand."}
