{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B003Q85CRY', 'answerTime': 'Feb 17, 2014', 'unixTime': 1392624000, 'question': 'Is this the 2012 or 2013 model? Also are the brackets included for the second seat or do I need to purchase them separately?', 'answer': 'After many calls to Amazon, Baby Jogger and the primary seller, this is a 2012/2013 model. There was no change in the product from 2012 to 2013. The seller gave me a model number of 81260 (2012) and said that there could be a "BJ" in front of it (BJ81260 is the 2013 model). Overall according to the Baby Jogger, there was no change between the 2012 and 2013 model; thus it shouldn\'t matter which year it is. The model number that Amazon gives is wrong (it says it is a 2009 model). And for those who are curious as I was, the 2014 (BJ20410) model has only minor changes- a new seat harness that is apparently easier to use, new colors to chose from and a new logo.'}
