{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B003Q85CRY', 'answerTime': 'May 27, 2014', 'unixTime': 1401174000, 'question': 'Ok so what I think I have from the previous questions is this. It comes with 2 seats, but the adapter for the car seat is separate, do you remove the 2nd seat and add the car seat adapter till the baby is bigger? That may be a stupid question lol Also,...', 'answer': "It comes apart and together so easy! Each piece comes off! I have a jeep grand Cherokee and it all fits in my back just fine! It comes with the two seats and you have to buy the car seat adapter separate. I love in Utah but don't seem to have a problem with the black in the heat."}
