{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B003Q85CRY', 'answerTime': 'Oct 13, 2013', 'unixTime': 1381647600, 'question': 'does it fit the Chicco keyfit 30 carseat? What is the maximum height? My 2 year-old is 37" tall.', 'answer': 'You have to buy a separate carseat adapter - there is a special for Chicco car seats. My son is over 37" and fits fine! I have the canopy in the lowest position, too, so my daughter can see over his seat better from the back seat (I use it as a double with two seats facing forward usually). No complaints about room, but there is still more room for him to grow since we can put the canopy higher!'}
