{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B003R70TAE', 'answerTime': 'Jan 15, 2014', 'unixTime': 1389772800, 'question': 'Any comments on the wheels... Are they soft enough for uneven sidewalks?', 'answerType': 'Y', 'answer': 'The wheels are pretty hard, but we have taken this stroller on every surface from uneven sidewalks, gravel, mud, grass, and it seems to do fairly well. Since the wheel itself is fairly large compared to some strollers it traverses small obsticals nicely. The biggest annoyance I have is that since the wheels are hard they are loud when on uneven sidewalks and gravel. Ive owned this stroller for about 2 years and getting ready to have my second kid and it is in great condition dispite lots of use, I look forward to using it for another few years.'}
