{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B003TRVFJG', 'answerTime': 'Dec 14, 2013', 'unixTime': 1387008000, 'question': 'Are the wheels substantial and do the roll straight?', 'answer': "Yes, the wheels roll straight and I can steer left and right one handed with only a little difficulty (which is from weights of kids, not the wheels) and after 8+ months of daily use on all sorts of terrain I'd say the wheels are very substantial. Not the greatest for trails and hiking, but I live in pot-hole city and we make it work."}
