{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B003U9V18S', 'answerTime': 'Oct 14, 2014', 'unixTime': 1413270000, 'question': 'What is the dimension once folded?', 'answer': "It folds pretty flat and roughly to half the chair's full height (to the ball joints that you see in the picture). Its also extremely easy to fold, which we juts discovered recently and were baffled why we didn't stow the chair more frequently, especially when guests came over."}
{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B003U9V18S', 'answerTime': 'Oct 8, 2014', 'unixTime': 1412751600, 'question': 'does it come assembled?', 'answerType': '?', 'answer': "Not completely but its super easy. I wouldn't recommend it for small babies or messy eaters... All food ends up on baby or on the floor due to the tray not being adjustable."}
{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B003U9V18S', 'answerTime': 'Sep 13, 2014', 'unixTime': 1410591600, 'question': 'what is the tallest height of tray (measured from floor to top of tray - wondering if it could be tall enough to be level with my kitchen island)?', 'answer': 'It really depends on the height of your kitchen island. Mine is unusually high, however the tray sits approx 34". It\'s total height is 43". This THE BEST high chair that I have ever seen!! Easy to fold and unfold. Getting the child in and out is a breeze. Easy to clean and can travel with you anywhere!'}
{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B003U9V1BA', 'answerTime': 'Nov 27, 2013', 'unixTime': 1385539200, 'question': 'Is the tray removable?', 'answerType': 'N', 'answer': 'No. There is a piece that snaps on to it that you can remove to wash. The tray itself does not move. Which leave space for your child to stand up if not strapped in my son hates straps.'}
