{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B003UKTW0Q', 'answerTime': 'Dec 3, 2012', 'unixTime': 1354521600, 'question': 'what is the precise length of the rail?', 'answer': "Hi....I don't know the precise length of the rail but it got perfectly on our tuscany crib by sorielle cribs! It was the right piece and the funny part of it all was babies r us and buy buy baby all told me 16 weeks to get the part! I had the rail in two days on Amazon!"}
{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B003ULP592', 'answerTime': 'Jul 29, 2014', 'unixTime': 1406617200, 'question': 'Are these listed dimensions correct? 3 x 18.6 x 10 inches. They are unclear and make it appear to be 18 inch long. The others you see are 33 inc long.', 'answerType': 'N', 'answer': 'No. That must be the shipping dimensions. The assembled rail is approx. 34" long, 15 1/2" tall, and 28" deep.'}
{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B003ULP592', 'answerTime': 'Jan 10, 2014', 'unixTime': 1389340800, 'question': 'Will this work for a 3-way convertible crib that has only a DRAWER underneath (not another mattress)?', 'answerType': '?', 'answer': "Valerie, I use this on a 4-way convertible crib. It is only meant for toddler size mattresses. It isn't meant to use on twin mattress set ups anyway. It comes with two ways to install. 1. No drilling required, snaps onto the spring platform that holds the mattress, or 2. drilling required to install a bracket onto the wooden platform your mattress sits on. I did option 2 as we don't have a spring platform. Does this help? Hope so!"}
{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B003ULP592', 'answerTime': 'Jul 10, 2013', 'unixTime': 1373439600, 'question': "Can someone tell me how exactly it is assembled. We don't have a spring base, it is wooden. Will it work?", 'answerType': '?', 'answer': 'I purchased this and we do not have a spring base either. To be honest, it was difficult to install. A lot of bending, pushing, pulling and a few choice curse words. I do have it installed now, and it does work wonderfully. If you plan to purchase, I would just be prepared for the installation to not be as easy as it says in the instructions. Good luck!'}
