{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B003V9PXE0', 'answerTime': 'Apr 27, 2014', 'unixTime': 1398582000, 'question': "do the bottles come with nipples as well? doesn't quite make sense that you are getting 8 bottles and only 1 nipple", 'answerType': 'Y', 'answer': 'When you buy the 8 pack of pre mixed formula you have to be careful. Sometimes it comes with one nipple, sometimes none. This item is really good to have though. I always keep 2 nipples in the diaper bag along with one or two pre mixed "emergency bottles." It did happen once that I was on what was supposed to be a quick trip but ended up having to buy formula on the road. Luckily I had nipples with me because the 8 pack I purchased didn\'t come with any.'}
