{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B003XDB91U', 'answerTime': 'Jan 28, 2014', 'unixTime': 1390896000, 'question': "Is there a snap in the back or Velcro? I can't tell from the picture.", 'answer': 'Velcro in the back. These are wonderful bibs! Though my son is 2 1/2 and just now starting to outgrow them...the arms are getting tight on him. When they get really old liquids will start to leak through the material onto the child, but that only happened to me on a used one I got from a friend. The ones I bought still are in amazing shape.'}
