{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B003XDB91U', 'answerTime': 'Oct 7, 2014', 'unixTime': 1412665200, 'question': 'The picture says set of 6 but the description says two bibs..which is it?', 'answer': '2'}
{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B003XDB91U', 'answerTime': 'Jun 20, 2014', 'unixTime': 1403247600, 'question': 'whats the measurments of the bib?', 'answer': 'From the edge of the neck to the end of the sleeve is approximately 13". The front, from the edge of the neck in the center front to the bottom edge, is 14". Laid flat, as seen in the illustration, the edge of one sleeve to the edge of the other is approximately 31". The Velcro closure at the back of the neck gives you the ability to adjust the neck size. I love these bibs and they surely make for an easy cleanup and no stained clothing. I wash them in cold water and dry on a low setting.'}
{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B003XDB91U', 'answerTime': 'Sep 26, 2013', 'unixTime': 1380178800, 'question': 'waterproof', 'answer': 'Not really. It\'s good for wearing while baby eat strawberry, blueberry or spaghetti, etc "coloring food". The bib made of polyester which fabric has a little resist of damp.'}
