{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B003XT43MG', 'answerTime': 'Jan 4, 2014', 'unixTime': 1388822400, 'question': 'does anyone know how to clean this mattress? Anyone ever cleaned it before? just use water or require some other steps?', 'answer': "Wet wipes. I only clean it after my son wets his pants. I have used both Pampers wipes and Clorox wipes on it. Either one of them works well. Then I just use a sheet of dry paper towel to wipe the mattress dry. Let it air our for a few hours, then it's good to go. Hope this helps! This mattress is water proof, so it actually doesn't require much cleaning."}
