{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B003YDQBYO', 'answerTime': 'Apr 2, 2014', 'unixTime': 1396422000, 'question': 'How should I wash and dry this?', 'answer': "I've used the washer and dryer. It's not as soft as it was but I think that was probably inevitable. Nowadays I can't pull it away from my daughter long enough for a full wash cycle so I just give it a quick hand wash with a tiny bit of all free and clear, rinse well, ring it out- and give it back a little damp. It air dries fast."}
