{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B003YVHXAW', 'answerTime': 'May 7, 2014', 'unixTime': 1399446000, 'question': 'Unable to get these to open at all to even install them, tried using screwdrivers to pry the tabs, top and bottom still will not separate, help!?', 'answer': 'I had this exact same problem. They were wedged together and my husband and I pulling together could not get the two pieces to separate. What I ended up doing that finally worked is this: Take two butter knives and stick them under the two tabs pushing them all the way up till you can see the tip of it coming through on the other side. Work them back and form and then start tugging. These seems to dislodge and unstuck it enough so you can get the two pieces apart. They work fine after this! It seems like they got pressed too tightly together during manufactoring or maybe the plastic dimensions are fiting just a bit too snug. I noticed from other reviews that when some people opened their product it was not "stuck" in all the way - whereas mine were completely pressed together where I could not see any of the ribbed bottom part. I think that may be why they became stuck. Hope this helps! We got ours apart!'}
