{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B0041F2CFQ', 'answerTime': 'Mar 2, 2015', 'unixTime': 1425283200, 'question': 'Anyone tried jogging with this stroller? How did it handle? Thanks!!', 'answer': "Get this stroller even if you don't jog, is a life saver no joke. Handles really really smoothly and I am a small lady. Like ANY jogger stroller straight is easiest but turns are handled well. All train for sure, works great on bumps, always have a tire pump just in case though."}
