{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B0041F2CFQ', 'answerTime': 'Oct 14, 2013', 'unixTime': 1381734000, 'question': 'Does the stroller fold with the Joey seat attached?', 'answerType': '?', 'answer': "I have not tried it, but I imagine it won't work. It only takes a minute to take the seat off, fold that up and then fold up the stroller. Throw it in the back of the van/SUV and you're good to go."}
{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B0041F2CFQ', 'answerTime': 'May 2, 2012', 'unixTime': 1335942000, 'question': 'valco jump seat: Can this seat fit any double jogging stroller brand or does it only fit Valco.', 'answer': 'I just bought the valco stroller and the jumpseat. My guess is that it will not fit in a Bob, because the way you attach this is in the holes where the bumper bars go.'}
{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B0041F2CFQ', 'answerTime': 'Sep 18, 2014', 'unixTime': 1411023600, 'question': 'Can you use this toddler seat on the valco twin run about model year 2006?', 'answerType': 'Y', 'answer': "Yes right now I'm using for my 2 years old son, it's very good, but when we are out side maybe he slept, seats back cannot go down, he has to seat and sleep, but it's helping, for three kids :)"}
{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B0041FI7BY', 'answerTime': 'Sep 28, 2013', 'unixTime': 1380351600, 'question': 'Has anyone used this with the Euro Bath tub by Primo?', 'answerType': '?', 'answer': "Yes. I am using it now but there is a caveat. primo tub has plastic joints near the side underneath the tub which do not allow to sit smoothly on the rails of the stand. So what i did was cut out those joints partially with a knife to allow for indentations that would allows for a nice and snug fit over the rails. This didn't compromise the tub and was a 30 second fix"}
