{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B0041FI7BY', 'answerTime': 'Jan 22, 2015', 'unixTime': 1421913600, 'question': 'Can I use this stand with my Fisher-Price tub that is 3"H x 3"W x 3" D?', 'answerType': '?', 'answer': "I don't know. But you better check those measurements. They seem totally off. You could never fit a baby in that."}
