{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B00423A60U', 'answerTime': 'Jul 10, 2013', 'unixTime': 1373439600, 'question': "what are the songs ? and , is just the melody or it's somebody singing.because my 2 y/o only likes when someone is singing the lyrics. tks", 'answer': 'It plays just a soft melody. Our granddaughters love to dance to the music before bedtime. They are almost 2 years old and have had one since they were born (it was a shower gift). Now they are big enough, they turn it on themselves when they are in their room so they can dance.'}
{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B00423A60U', 'answerTime': 'Nov 5, 2014', 'unixTime': 1415174400, 'question': 'After it times out and you click the music button, does it always play song #1 or does it go to song #2. The butterfly goes to the next song.', 'answer': 'we have the old style frog and the new styled butterfly. the frog goes back to the beginning (song #1) when you turn it off or it turns itself off, unlike the butterfly that cycles through all the songs and sounds every time. much preferred the frog set up also since the butterfly allows baby to determine volume by pushing the button right next to the music button whereas the frog volume control is on the bottom by the battery.'}
{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B00423A60U', 'answerTime': 'Sep 28, 2014', 'unixTime': 1411887600, 'question': 'Does this frog have music also? Does it have red, green, and blue light options? I am looking for the same one my older daughter has.', 'answer': 'Yes it has some lullabys (no words) and some nature sounds with red blue and green light options. Sounds like the same one.'}
