{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B0042D69WO', 'answerTime': 'Feb 1, 2014', 'unixTime': 1391241600, 'question': 'Is this swing sturdy &amp; safe enough to put a infant in it that moves around a lot? Or will the swing end up flipping over?', 'answer': "For us it's very sturdy. We put our kid in it since he was about 10 lbs. Now he's about 20 lbs and the swing is still fine. The base is relatively wide and the shoulder/waist straps are good to keep him in. We always have the swing on the lowest setting and it's very calm swing."}
