{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B0043D28CI', 'answerTime': 'Mar 26, 2014', 'unixTime': 1395817200, 'question': 'How is Sir Prance a lot?', 'answer': 'This is a good book. We have enjoyed all the Lamaze cloth books. Each has a good short tale, and also fun noises to the books which gets the attention of our youngest grandson(10m) quickly and yet lets our older one (2Y) still enjoy the story. Also Sir Prance is really cute.'}
{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B0043D28B4', 'answerTime': 'Dec 2, 2013', 'unixTime': 1385971200, 'question': 'There is a choking hazard listed on this Peek a Boo Forest but I think it might be a mistake? Please advise.', 'answer': "I don't think anything about this book could present a choking hazard. The beak of the owl sticks out but is sewed on well and I can't imagine any infant or even toddler could pull it off. I have never been worried about my (now) 10 month old with this book."}
{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B0043D28B4', 'answerTime': 'Jul 24, 2014', 'unixTime': 1406185200, 'question': 'I have this book but have not tried washing it yet. Has anyone tried, either by hand or machine? If you did, how did the book handle being washed?', 'answer': "It does say hand wash, but I've thrown them in the washer and dryer on occasion. I don't wash them too much, but an occasional toss in the wash has not been a problem to the book structure. I do have a basic lamaze book that has no words, only different inner textures like the crinkles a rattle and a squeeker. The squeeker has stopped squeeking. I don't know if that's due to washing or overuse. :) Still very usable book."}
{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B0043D28B4', 'answerTime': 'Oct 22, 2013', 'unixTime': 1382425200, 'question': 'How many "pages" are there?', 'answerType': 'Y', 'answer': "6 including front and back ... but (and this is a big but) when I received the books (I ordered two) both smelled like mildew! I did receive a full refund and was told to keep them anyway but a month of airing out and using baking soda sealed in a bag w/book it still smells :/ Guess I'll hang them outside? Maybe wash on gentle cycle ... just thought you should know. Maybe yours will smell better."}
{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B0043D28B4', 'answerTime': 'Nov 30, 2013', 'unixTime': 1385798400, 'question': 'Is the book for 18month olds?', 'answerType': '?', 'answer': 'Absolutly! My soon to be two year old loves it!'}
{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B0043D28B4', 'answerTime': 'Jan 28, 2015', 'unixTime': 1422432000, 'question': 'BPA free?', 'answer': 'yes'}
{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B0043D28B4', 'answerTime': 'Nov 13, 2014', 'unixTime': 1415865600, 'question': 'What does Lamaze mean? Is that the brand name?', 'answer': 'Yes, Lamaze is the brand name. There are several books in the series. All are made of cloth and for very young children.'}
{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B0043D28B4', 'answerTime': 'Aug 28, 2014', 'unixTime': 1409209200, 'question': 'The book I received was sent directly from China, and is of poor quality. Is there a way to ensure the product is authentic if purchase on Amazon?', 'answerType': 'N', 'answer': 'Write in to customer service. I received a poor quality one, which I thought was fake and they sent a replacement. I compared the second one to those sold in stores, quality about the same. Even those in stores, colors are not bright, prints are not very clear.'}
{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B0043D28B4', 'answerTime': 'Jul 28, 2014', 'unixTime': 1406530800, 'question': 'is the book "Lamaze Peek-A-Boo forest Cloth Book " original lamaze factory ? dose it com in an original packing ? thanks for our information.', 'answer': "I think it is. It was packaged and looked like the original packaging. I assumed it was from an original Lamaze factory, but I don't really know how to check that."}
{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B0043D28B4', 'answerTime': 'Jul 24, 2014', 'unixTime': 1406185200, 'question': 'Does anybody know what material this and the other lamaze cloth books are made out of?', 'answer': 'I only checked the Forest one. Says Polyester Fibers, Plastic Film. It is very soft with the crinkles.. Ok went back and checked my other two. All three are polyester fibers with varying cellophane and batting for the inner crinkle/textures. The books are very child safe.'}
{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B0043D28B4', 'answerTime': 'May 25, 2014', 'unixTime': 1401001200, 'question': 'does the peek a boo forest book have pigs in it?', 'answerType': 'N', 'answer': "NO, I'm not 100% sure, but I don't think there are any pigs. I bought it for my grandson quite a few months ago. From what I remember it was not farm animals it was animals of the forest. My grandson loves it from 6 months old and on. Because of the cloth like pages he can't hurt the book. My daughter has read to him, every day since he was four weeks old."}
{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B0043D2A9O', 'answerTime': 'May 29, 2011', 'unixTime': 1306652400, 'question': "So, why do the different colors cost different? It's just a different color, right?", 'answer': "I have actually spoke with an Amazon rep and for items sold by Amazon it's based on supply and demand. Prices change regularly (multiple times per day) based on sales vs. on-hand inventory. As an item sells, it's price goes up. The longer it goes without a sale, the price will come down. It's all managed automatically within their system."}
{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B0043D2A9O', 'answerTime': 'Oct 1, 2013', 'unixTime': 1380610800, 'question': 'our vehicle does not have a Latch system to attach a car seat to. Will this work with a regular seat belt?', 'answerType': 'Y', 'answer': "Yes! In fact, we didn't use the latch system(car didn't have one) just the seat belt and the car seat did excellent in our rollover accident! Our son is now big enough to use this seat just as a booster and the seat belt works well that way as well. This seat has been a great investment for our family."}
{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B0043D2A9O', 'answerTime': 'Feb 10, 2015', 'unixTime': 1423555200, 'question': 'What are safety ratings on this car seat.', 'answer': 'I love it. My baby is 2 years old and i feel very confident to take any trip outside the state with him. Also is very confortable'}
{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B0043D2A9O', 'answerTime': 'Feb 11, 2010', 'unixTime': 1265875200, 'question': 'Anyone used the Safety 1st Alpha Omega Elite Convertible Car Seat on an airplane? We were wondering if anyone has any expeirence with this car seat on an airplane?', 'answer': 'I know this is late to the discussion, but it will help someone in the future. We traveled with that car seat and had no problems. It was difficult to get through security because they had to hand search it, and carrying a car seat onto the plane was bothersome, but the added safety is well worth it. Had no problems getting the car seat to fit once on the plane. Strapped my son in and he slept the either flight.'}
{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B0043D2A9O', 'answerTime': 'May 1, 2014', 'unixTime': 1398927600, 'question': 'I installed this car seat rear facing and it tilts forward towards the back does not seem safe am I installing wrong?', 'answer': 'Unfortunately no. it was fine in our other car, but the mini van has a steeper seat. Be sure to have the child seat fully reclined.'}
{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B0043D2A9O', 'answerTime': '6 days ago', 'question': 'Is the cup holder removable?', 'answerType': 'Y', 'answer': 'Yes'}
{'answer': '6-8 years after the manufacturing date', 'asin': 'B0043D2A9O', 'answerTime': '7 days ago', 'question': 'When in the expiration date for the safety 1st nitron car seat?', 'questionType': 'open-ended'}
{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B0043D2A9O', 'answerTime': 'Apr 8, 2015', 'unixTime': 1428476400, 'question': 'Does this car seat help when baby falls asleep and head falls forward? Or does anyone have sggestions for that?', 'answer': "If your baby's head falls forward when they sleep they should not be forward facing. Their head should not fall forward in a rear facing postition. My 9 month old does great in his."}
{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B0043D2A9O', 'answerTime': 'Mar 2, 2015', 'unixTime': 1425283200, 'question': 'Is it safe to buy the discontinued one? Is only the color discontinued or the model itself?', 'answer': 'What product are you asking about? I do not see an item.'}
{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B0043D2A9O', 'answerTime': 'Feb 16, 2015', 'unixTime': 1424073600, 'question': "Will this car seat fit in my 2014 honda civic? i want to put it in the middle because it's safest but i'm not sure if it will fit. please help!", 'answerType': 'Y', 'answer': 'Yes'}
{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B0043FIJ8I', 'answerTime': 'Nov 17, 2014', 'unixTime': 1416211200, 'question': "How do you charge this? My daughter is looking for a night light that can't be unplugged for our 2 year old granddaughter.", 'answer': "It works like a cordless phone. There is a base which you place the nightlight on all day, and you simply remove it when you'd like to use it. It is cord free, battery free (in the traditional AA, AAA sense). My daughter has it on a shelf right next to the bed. It really does illuminate the room in a glow. She has also slept with it in the bed, it is completely cool to the touch. You can choose to set it to a short timer or have it light all night long, as well as choose one color or have it color change through its rainbow of choices. They really are adorable."}
{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B0043FIJ8I', 'answerTime': 'Oct 20, 2014', 'unixTime': 1413788400, 'question': 'Can you leave this charging and on all night, or do you have to remove it from the charging station to turn it on as a night light?', 'answer': "I leave it on and on the charger all night, every night. It's lasted 2.5 years so far."}
{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B0043FIJ8I', 'answerTime': 'Dec 27, 2014', 'unixTime': 1419667200, 'question': 'My son wants something he can read with at night without waking his sibling on the lower bunk with the big light. Is this bright enough to read by?', 'answerType': 'Y', 'answer': "I would say it's absolutely bright enough, but there is no way to direct the light to the page. Being an all-over glow it may cause a problem trying to read with it as I imagine if it was close to him it would shine into his eyes at the same time as on the page, but if it was farther away it may cause eye strain."}
{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B0043FIJ8I', 'answerTime': 'Mar 28, 2015', 'unixTime': 1427526000, 'question': 'Is there an easy way to turn it on, in the middle of the night, for diapering and feeding?', 'answerType': '?', 'answer': 'We have the bear and it turns on from the bottom or base of the bear. Not really a simple thing in the middle of the night until you get used to working with it by touch'}
{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B0043FIJ8I', 'answerTime': 'Apr 11, 2015', 'unixTime': 1428735600, 'question': 'How long is the battery time if leaving it on?', 'answer': 'Hello Chloe. The KinderGlo will typically last between 8 and 12 hours depending upon several factors. Color mode and battery condition (how well charged the lamp is and the age of the lamp) both affect the use time. Color cycling mode uses slightly more power than a constant color mode, so the light will last for slightly less time on this setting. We hope this is helpful!'}
{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B0043FIJ8I', 'answerTime': 'Apr 3, 2015', 'unixTime': 1428044400, 'question': "Is there a way to reset the night light? The Dino stopped working last night. No red light when charging doesn't turn on.", 'answerType': '?', 'answer': "If you see no light at all it could be a problem with the base, not the Dino part. We had a problem with the base prong once. I emailed the Kinderglo company and they trouble- shooted with me to try to determine if it was something easily fixable. When it wasn't they asked me for my information and sent me a new base. In my case the metal prong was bend a bit and it simply wouldn't line up correctly to form a connection."}
{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B0043FIJ8I', 'answerTime': 'Feb 19, 2015', 'unixTime': 1424332800, 'question': "I'm looking for a red night light. Do you have to cycle through the different color settings every time you turn it on?", 'answerType': 'Y', 'answer': 'Yes'}
{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B0043FIJ8I', 'answerTime': 'Feb 7, 2015', 'unixTime': 1423296000, 'question': "Blue light is bad to use because it stunts melatonin. Is there an option of yellow light? Can't imagine red wd be soothing.", 'answerType': '?', 'answer': "Hello Ninjabetic, and thanks for your question. At this time, a solid yellow setting is not available for the KinderGlo. The four light settings are solid green, solid blue, solid red, and continuous color changing. While some of the colors in the cycle are brighter than others, in general all of the light settings are soft enough to sleep by. As far as concerns about impeding melatonin levels, the science behind this shows that lights with a brightness of under 5 lux have no effect on the body's production of melatonin. Because we use soft LED lights which are then filtered through a translucent plastic body, the brightness of the KinderGlo never reaches 1 lux. The lights are bright enough to see by, but soft enough to sleep by."}
{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B0043FIJ8I', 'answerTime': 'Nov 8, 2014', 'unixTime': 1415433600, 'question': "Does the red charging light turn green when charging is complete? We've had ours charging for 12hrs and it's still red.", 'answerType': '?', 'answer': "Not sure. I just charge it and is lasts forever. Don't pay attention to light. Will try and see"}
