{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B0044FS46E', 'answerTime': 'Oct 12, 2013', 'unixTime': 1381561200, 'question': 'hoe does this mount? my deck has a steel rail. thx!', 'answer': "It comes with hardware that screws into the upright posts of the frame. You can always figure out a way to lash wood posts to your metal frame and connect the gate that way. It's perfect for coralling kids and dogs. Love the fact that it is rust-proof cast aluminum and attractive. Goes with my black outdoor aluminum furniture. Believe it also comes in a tan. Good luck."}
