{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B0045VA3SO', 'answerTime': 'Oct 14, 2013', 'unixTime': 1381734000, 'question': 'Do you really need this with a Chicco Keyfit carseat or is the support that comes with the seat enough?', 'answer': "The KeyFit is very well padded and keeps your baby snug. On top of that, your KeyFit manual tells you not to use any aftermarket products (which this is). It could interfere with the safety design of the seat in a crash in a way we can't anticipate and your child could be hurt, plus it could void your warranty."}
