{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B0045W2TNK', 'answerTime': 'Sep 28, 2014', 'unixTime': 1411887600, 'question': 'Will this kickboard fit the Orbit stroller 2009 model? I think it is the G1 model.', 'answerType': 'Y', 'answer': "I'm pretty sure it doesn't fit the G1. The rear wheels on your frame should have these metal, open cylinders through the center of those rear wheels. This is what the sidekick attaches to. The G2 definitely does, and my friend who had the G1 said it didn't fit on theirs."}
