{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B0047CPTXK', 'answerTime': 'Jan 4, 2014', 'unixTime': 1388822400, 'question': 'What strollers can this be used for Cybex Aton car seat? Can I use it to secure a Cybex Aton car seat on a Chicco Liteway Plus?', 'answer': "I have a Chico stroller from a few years ago. I am not sure if it's the same as yours, but that adapter did not work. The design snaps around the bars of the stroller, and the size/shape did not fit. There is an adapter that is more of a strap that hooks into the car seat and then straps around the stroller that seems to worked. I honestly did not end up using the Chicco because I ended up getting a bugaboo stroller as a gift. I know it's not the most helpful answer, however I would not use the adapter you are looking at. Go for the strap one."}
