{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B0047RI5YU', 'answerTime': 'Feb 7, 2015', 'unixTime': 1423296000, 'question': 'If you leave it on setting 3 for more than 4 minutes does the milk continue to heat and get scalding or does it get to temp and keep it there?', 'answer': "If the 5 oz bottle was in the fridge it can warm for 5 minutes. If you have a 9 oz bottle it's going to take longer to warm, about 9 mins. However if you're trying to warm a 5 oz bottle for more than the recommended 4- 5 mins then yes it's going to be too hot if you leave it in the warmer too long."}
