{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B0047RI5YU', 'answerTime': 'Oct 19, 2014', 'unixTime': 1413702000, 'question': 'Oh..Hm.. First, Do i put water in warmer machine? or water only put in the baby bottle?? if first put in warmer machine, not failure??? I worry it.', 'answer': 'You do not use the water that goes directly in the warmer machine itself for the bottle. First, you prepare the bottle (either with breast milk or formula and water) then you put the bottle that is sealed and mixed into the warmer (which will also have water in it warming up).'}
