{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B0049BM6GM', 'answerTime': 'Sep 24, 2014', 'unixTime': 1411542000, 'question': 'I lost the manual, where the setting to add the second camera?', 'answer': 'In the menu, scroll to the option that says Pair or Pairing. It will then give prompts to pair a second camera. The new camera had a code with it, enter those digits to pair the camera. Then use the A button to toggle between cameras or set it to automatically switch views.'}
