{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B0049BM6GM', 'answerTime': 'Feb 28, 2014', 'unixTime': 1393574400, 'question': 'Does this system have a "sleep mode"? So that when there is no crying in the baby room, it turns off? Turns back on when there is crying or noise?', 'answer': 'Yes, the screen of the monitor is off when the child is peacefully sleeping. The screen turns on when noise is detected based on a sensitivity setting set from the camera. The "sleep" button on the monitor allows you to manually turn on the screen to check on the child. I hope this helps!'}
