{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B0049U5UGG', 'answerTime': 'Nov 24, 2013', 'unixTime': 1385280000, 'question': 'Is this piece sturdy enough to sit on? I was thinking of using it for a put on/put away shoe station', 'answerType': '?', 'answer': "I'm not sure what the weight limit is. They are made to be stackable, and each piece is pretty hefty so I think they are meant to hold a good bit of weight. However, You have to stack at least two high to be at a comfortable height for sitting, and I would probably not recommend sitting on stacked cubbies. I use them as shoe cubbies, but it is not really similar to the bench shoe cubbies. I just have them stacked and through shoes in them in a closet. The protruding front lip would also make them awkward for sitting on top."}
