{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B004B4IYJK', 'answerTime': 'Jan 14, 2015', 'unixTime': 1421222400, 'question': 'Will my four year old be able to handle these locks? I want him to be able to enter the bathrooms, but not my toddler! Thanks!', 'answerType': '?', 'answer': 'To "unlock" the lock, it requires the user to push the mechanism in while sliding it to the other side. I think, with a little practice, your 4 year old could do it.'}
