{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B004B6FJNC', 'answerTime': '27 days ago', 'question': 'can the tires be dismounted by myself so I can put it in my suitcase on airplane?', 'answerType': 'Y', 'answer': "The spring-locking mechanism used for pinning the wheel to the axis is curved with tension such that it takes considerable trouble to get the wheel off once it has been placed on the axis. This is certainly a safety mechanism (you wouldn't want a wheel accidentally coming off when taking the pram through rough terrain, of course). Putting the pram in a suitcase seems like overkill. I have taken the pram on over 12 flights (4 international) without any trouble The airlines have always gate checked it without any fuss or additional expense."}
