{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B004BBGMK6', 'answerTime': 'Jul 3, 2014', 'unixTime': 1404370800, 'question': 'Hi. Wondering if your EVA foam is formamide-free? Thank you!', 'answer': 'Great, question. Formamide is not an ingredient but can be a by-product in the eva foam productions. This was a concern for many of our customers, especially after France and Belgium issued a ban on EVA foam mats in 2010. However, these two countries reversed the ban 2011. Instead they have set-up restrictions on Formamide limits to &gt;200 mg/kg. I provided the article link below. http://newsletter.sgs.com/eNewsletterPro/uploadedimages/000006/sgs-safeguards-1291212-france-extends-temporary-ban-for-formamide-in-puzzle-mats-a4-en-12.pdf Recently, Australia conducted a test on Formamide in foam mats and had found no health risks to humans. I provide the article link below. http://www.productsafety.gov.au/content/index.phtml/itemId/989496 All our mats & blocks pass and exceed all US standards and regulations. Our Wonder mats have not been specifically tested for Formamide as the emission is below the standards in Europe and the United states.'}
{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B004BBGMK6', 'answerTime': 'Jul 3, 2014', 'unixTime': 1404370800, 'question': 'Are these blocks BPA-free?', 'answerType': 'Y', 'answer': 'Yes, our mats and blocks are made of the same high quality EVA foam. They are BPA free.'}
{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B004BBGMK6', 'answerTime': 'Feb 24, 2014', 'unixTime': 1393228800, 'question': 'Where are these blocks made?', 'answer': 'This is the description online for the blocks. "With over 25 years of experience, as creator; eWonderWorld set the standards for foam mats and foam blocks. Unlike many competitors mats and blocks that are made in China, ours are made in Taiwan undergoing & passing all tests for safety. Building blocks promote motor skills, color and shape coordination, and sensory learning. Our blocks can be used in classrooms, daycare centers, play room and even in bath tubes for hours of play tub fun!"'}
