{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B004BDNKCM', 'answerTime': 'Jul 9, 2013', 'unixTime': 1373353200, 'question': "Does this have ample padding on the sides (like prop r shopper) ? Baby isn't 100% stable at sitting yet being 6 months.", 'answerType': '?', 'answer': 'It has padding all over the bottom and sides too, just not the top. You could use the pillow for cushioned support. I love this cover and am using it with my second baby now. I think I started my first one at 6m too. You can strap him in for more stability.'}
{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B004BDNKCM', 'answerTime': 'May 26, 2014', 'unixTime': 1401087600, 'question': "What's the purpose of the pillow? It looks like it obstructs baby's view. Is it detachable? If so, is it soft enough to bend around baby to prop up?", 'answer': "It is detachable. It's great when they can't sit on their own. It's also good for high chairs in restaurants that are huge...provides padding for propping. We love ours and wouldn't trade it for anything. We buy one for every new mom we're getting a gift for!"}
{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B004BDNKCM', 'answerTime': 'Jul 9, 2013', 'unixTime': 1373353200, 'question': "For the price, I'm REALLY hoping this is going to fit high chairs. Is this cover really worth the money?", 'answerType': 'Y', 'answer': 'It\'s one of those things where you could definitely find something similar to this for less money as it\'s a "luxury" item, not a necessity item. I used to stuff blankets around my babies when they were little and it worked just fine for me. I actually bought this for our first grandchild who, like us, lives in Arizona where hot shopping carts are not uncommon. I decided on this one because upon reading other reviewers, this one is over sized, it will fit Costco carts as well as other oddly shaped shopping carts & restaurant high chairs. It\'s well built, could be put on with one hand while the other held the child, it was cushy for comfort and to help prevent thumps & bumps when they\'re little. Would I spend the money and buy it again if I had a chance to go back...prolly not unless it was offered at half price.'}
