{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B004C053C4', 'answerTime': 'Apr 12, 2015', 'unixTime': 1428822000, 'question': 'How long should I change the nipple?', 'answer': "Hi - as long as there aren't visible tears, our nipples are safe for use. We recommend frequently sterilizing to make sure that theyre always clean for the little ones."}
