{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B004CL9YZU', 'answerTime': 'Nov 14, 2013', 'unixTime': 1384416000, 'question': "My 2.5 year old has pushed over every other gate we've gotten. She will push it (with her legs) and it will either completely fall over, or she will be able to slide between the opening she just created and get out. Anybody had any problems with this...", 'answer': 'this is not a pressure mounted gate. It screws into the wall and is very secure, the gate latches and locks. The only issue that you may have is the bar across the bottom people might trip over it when the gate is open if they dont step over it.'}
