{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B004CLBX2M', 'answerTime': 'Mar 4, 2013', 'unixTime': 1362384000, 'question': 'I need a gate for a 48.5" wide doorway. Looks like with the extensions included, this gate might work. How does the install for the extensions?', 'answer': "My staircase was 48 inches wide, and it was a stretch getting it to fit. It has some flex at the extension point of the gate. Its been up at my house since Christmas, it has never failed, my 18 month old can shake it, and it wont open, I just make sure its not flexed too much if it gets banged into. Overall, I've been very happy with this product."}
