{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B004CQGD7W', 'answerTime': 'Feb 19, 2015', 'unixTime': 1424332800, 'question': "What plates do you use with Lil'Diner? I see from the answers Playtex and possibly Oxo Tot. Any other plates that will work with it?", 'answer': "It works well for plastic (any brand), glass and stoneware bowl/plates for me. The problem for us before was that it doesn't stick to some table surface. The problem now is that my son refuses to use it. Note: he is 2."}
