{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B004DC9TD0', 'answerTime': 'Mar 12, 2013', 'unixTime': 1363071600, 'question': 'How to repair the Bob stroller handle bar?', 'answer': "What's the damage? If it's to the squishy grip, there's probably not much they can do because it would require disassembly of all the parts that are riveted onto the bar through the grip material. However, if that's your issue, I did a pretty nice looking repair of my single BOB where the grip got torn using tennis racquet grip. (You can pick up raquet grip at just about any sporting goods store.) I just wrapped the whole thing. It looks nice, and is less prone to tears compared to the original material."}
