{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B004DC9TFI', 'answerTime': 'Apr 23, 2013', 'unixTime': 1366700400, 'question': '1. does this stroller come with a rain cover and 2. is the foot space big enough for a taller kid? it looks kind of small on the photos.', 'answerType': '?', 'answer': 'My son is 100% percentile for height and 99.6 for weight. He is 2. We still use it very comfortably. I imagine for at least another year and he is the size of a small 4 year old.'}
{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B004DC9TFI', 'answerTime': 'Sep 10, 2014', 'unixTime': 1410332400, 'question': 'How good is this stroller on different terrain? We are looking for a stroller we can use at the beach and go off road.', 'answer': "It depends... We live in Hawaii, so ours has seen its fair share of beaches. If the sand is somewhat packed, it pushes along like a dream. If it's loose and deep, you'll feel like you're pushing through quicksand. We've had pretty good luck 'off-roading', but I can see the ride being jerky for smaller babies. We've also encountered issues with burrs and thorns puncturing the tires. Now it needs a new tube."}
