{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B004DC9TFI', 'answerTime': 'Mar 29, 2014', 'unixTime': 1396076400, 'question': 'when running (running, not jogging), does the front wheel wobble/shake at all?', 'answerType': '?', 'answer': 'The wheel has a switch to lock it in place, so you would not encounter any wobbling if that is engaged. I jog (not run) with it unlocked with it having free range of motion. I have never encountered wobbling or shaking nor have lost control, but I limit my use to smooth paved surfaces.'}
