{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B004ET2U1A', 'answerTime': 'Feb 18, 2014', 'unixTime': 1392710400, 'question': 'are these nipples re-useable? can i sterlize them?', 'answer': "No, they are re-usable. They are like the NICU one's that you throw away after one use. But considering the cost, I used them about 5 times max before desposal, I'd just wash them with soapy warm water. They worked fine. Glad our little one graduated from them though. They cost a pretty penny."}
