{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B004FMAMNY', 'answerTime': 'Nov 3, 2014', 'unixTime': 1415001600, 'question': "I've tried to put my 6-week old baby on this carrier but it's so difficult and dangerous to do it by myself. Any tips?", 'answer': 'I have found that it is easier to use this carrier when you have someone to help you put the child in. Also, if you loosen the straps a little before putting the child in and then tighten once the child is in, it makes it a little easier. The carrier is comfortable so I recommend it.'}
