{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B004HKIIGC', 'answerTime': 'Feb 20, 2014', 'unixTime': 1392883200, 'question': 'What is the recommended beginning age for this sippy?', 'answer': 'It depends....my pediatrician recommended starting my son on sippy cups by his 1st birthday. I started with the sippy part and after 3 days he got it so I moved to the straw and thst only took him one day. However, this cup is horrible for the straw...yes it taught my son howto use it but the pressure bbuild-up made the milk always come up the straw and pour out all over the place. I recommend Munchkin click and lock cups, theyv have a straw cup to and no matter how many times it gets dropped it never leaks! Hope this helps.'}
