{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B004HWXCJS', 'answerTime': 'Feb 7, 2013', 'unixTime': 1360224000, 'question': 'Can i ask what is included with this Medela PIS Breast pump?', 'answerType': '?', 'answer': "What is shown in pic - but to be more descriptive: Mine came with two flanges, four bottles with lids, a black bag that holds four bottles, an ice pack for the bottle holding bag, tubing and plastic pieces that attach to the flanges (parts necessary to make pump work), and the tote that the pump comes in. There may have also been some coupons from medela. The box is from medela and should have tape on it to indicate it wasn't opened prior to your receipt."}
