{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B004I16DOY', 'answerTime': 'Jan 21, 2014', 'unixTime': 1390291200, 'question': "How narrow is the inside? Can you fit a Dr. Brown's bottle plus an ice pack?", 'answer': "It fits a TT bottle snugly. Depending on the ice pack, you could probably fit a DB bottle and an ice pack. For example, a thin flexible cold pack would work best. But I don't really see why you would need an ice pack in this bag, it is meant to keep your bottle cold without one!"}
