{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B004I16DOY', 'answerTime': 'Jan 6, 2015', 'unixTime': 1420531200, 'question': "Are there any sippy cups that fit in them? Have a seven month old now, and wondering if they'll hold juice/milk/water for the next couple years.", 'answerType': 'Y', 'answer': "It should fit a normal sippy cup just fine. I used mine for a few months and then donated it because it didn't really keep anything cool. I just put a lot of ice in the cup and continue to refill during stops. This bottle bag is a little gimmicky in that it is a handy bag but the insulation doesn't work well."}
