{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B004IDG6XK', 'answerTime': 'Dec 12, 2014', 'unixTime': 1418371200, 'question': 'If the balls are left off the lamp and they stop glowing, how long do they need to stay on the lamp again before they can be taken off again?', 'answer': "It honestly depends where you got the nightlight. I ordered one on Amazon that is crap quality. It came with the wrong adapter and plug in. And it really just doesn't work right. The glow is super dull and goes away almost immediately. Someone purchased me one of these lamps as a gift from bed bath and beyond also, and it works perfectly. The glow is bright and lasts for 10-20 minutes. The settings are different and I can choose to set it to one specific color, and it is a product I would recommend. Advice to all, do not order this product online. It might be cheaper, but it will definitely be MADE cheaper..."}
