{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B004IPBH50', 'answerTime': 'Nov 12, 2014', 'unixTime': 1415779200, 'question': "I looked at this product yesterday and spent the night researching. Now I'm ready to buy and the price is much different, why?", 'answer': "Hi. This is Gloria from Naturepedic. We didn't change our prices. But are you aware that there are different vendors on Amazon that sell the same products? It is possible that one vendor will charge more or less than another. One vendor might sell through the Baby department, another might sell through Health and Personal Care, another through Furniture - that sort of thing. Also, I don't want to insult you, but some of the product names are very similar. We have four different lightweight mattress models - all of which are different prices. Is it possible you were looking at a different model yesterday? I hope this helps!"}
