{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B004L2JJ6O', 'answerTime': 'Mar 8, 2013', 'unixTime': 1362729600, 'question': 'Is anyone using this regularly at home? I want to know how it stands up to daily use in the home.', 'answerType': '?', 'answer': "We purchased this one as a second for on the road...not worth it. It folds in on its self and there is no way to keep it from doing so. It also was not high enough for a booth let alone our dinner table. We tried using it in our house with all straps positioned correctly and with the shifting of our child it still collapsed. We did get the munchkin travel seat with the cooler feature, it is perfect. It has a hard plastic inner so it's stable, 4 legs that can be folded out for height perfect for our dinner table and its easy to set up and take when we hit the road. The munchkin is a much better choice. We have1.5 & 2.5 year old boys and they can both use it."}
