{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B004LD6VLO', 'answerTime': 'Jul 16, 2014', 'unixTime': 1405494000, 'question': "can any one tell me how to turn this thing on pls.. I put in the battery and look for power on/off button but cant find one.. it doesn't lit either.", 'answerType': '?', 'answer': 'I get the lights and music to come on by pushing the top button on the right hand side. The left buttons are used to set the time, date, alarm etc. I believe the 2nd button on the right is for the "sleep" mode. You can set it to stay on anywhere from 10 to 60 minutes and then it will automatically turn off. During that time it loops through the music and flashes the stars and lights as well. I\'m not sure why it may not light up, but when I press the top right button I get the stars, the face shows the blue light & then the music starts. hope that helps.'}
