{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B004LE8T9U', 'answerTime': 'Feb 18, 2014', 'unixTime': 1392710400, 'question': 'I am a grandma and I want to know if this book asks questions like when was the first time we read a book together, does it have cover page for birth', 'answerType': 'Y', 'answer': 'Yes, there are 2 pages for the birth information. There are also pages for info on the family tree, baby showers, what the world is like (world leaders, popular songs, price of gas or milk, etc). There are 12 pages for each month of life to simple record "memories and milestones", but there are also more structured pages such as "All of my Firsts" which records smiling, laughing, clapping, waving bye, etc. I hope this information helps!'}
