{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B004LE8TWM', 'answerTime': 'Mar 13, 2015', 'unixTime': 1426230000, 'question': 'does this have a section for a baby shower and if so what does that include', 'answer': 'It does :) there is 4 pages dedicated to a baby shower or even two baby showers. the first page has a heading saying "showers of good wishes" we were given a special party to celebrate my soon to come birthday! and then there\'s a spot to write host/hostess, date, location, guests and gifts. and on the page opposite to that, is a spot to glue or tape in photos of the day :) when you flick the page over, there\'s another two pages to write about another baby shower :) it\'s the exact same as the pages before (what i described) they just give you another two pages (one writing and one for pics) in case you had two showers or a shower and sprinkle or even just want more room to write and post photos about the first baby shower :) hope that helped! :)'}
