{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B004OR1DTC', 'answerTime': 'Apr 23, 2014', 'unixTime': 1398236400, 'question': 'Does it work for just drying glasses? I dont have baby yet but I am looking for a drying rack that make safe my glasses and cups', 'answerType': '?', 'answer': 'We dry everything with this: nipples, vent collars, brushes, bottles, glasses, cups - avoid some of the heavier items though. Another thing we did was to raise the mat up a bit higher to allow the water that collects to dry faster, this helps to prevent odors etc. Overall we are happy with the product, has held up well so far. My only gripe is the water collection, so you have to either raise the mat or remember to drain and wash it weekly.'}
