{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B004QXZEKI', 'answerTime': 'Jan 31, 2015', 'unixTime': 1422691200, 'question': 'can you fit the xplory frame and the stokke carseat in this? IE I am not taking the pram seat', 'answerType': 'Y', 'answer': "I use this bag for my baby jogger city select so I'm not speaking directly, but based on my experience it should fit fine. I have been able to fit my city select stroller with a graco snugride32 adapter and the graco seat/carrier itself and I was still able to fit the 2nd seat adapter and regular stroller seat for my older child. I did have to place everything in the bag carefully to keep it mostly balanced and make sure it fit well (ie with that much stuff I couldn't just throw it in all willy nilly), but it fit fine and all the straps inside and out made everything secure. I've had this bag for 2 years and it's seen a lot of travel and will certainly see a lot more."}
