{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B004TUTOLS', 'answerTime': 'Apr 4, 2014', 'unixTime': 1396594800, 'question': 'Has this been treated with fire retardants?', 'answerType': '?', 'answer': "I was wondering the same thing. I purchased one over a year ago and just recently learned about all the fire retardants in infant clothing and bedding. I contacted Serta and here was their response: Thank you for contacting Serta. We are glad that you took the time to email us and appreciate the opportunity to respond. Serta manufactures mattresses and foundations. We license independently owned companies to make many types of furniture and bedding accessories using the Serta brand name. For assistance with this matter, please check the manufacturing law tag that is attached to your product and contact the manufacturer directly. The manufacturer contact information is listed below: La Jobi Industries - (888) 266-2848, (609) 409-2495, www.lajobi.com, or email: bcurran@lajobi.com I am disappointed that they don't have more information--or that they are choosing to withhold the information--about a product sold under their name. I'll email the company mentioned and post what I find out."}
