{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B004UAD0RQ', 'answerTime': 'Nov 14, 2013', 'unixTime': 1384416000, 'question': 'Does the video and sound only come on when there is movement or noise? Or does the sound stay on all the time (we have a sound machine on at night)', 'answer': "The sounds stays on all the time. You can easily turn the volume up and down on the side. There is also a button you can push on top to turn the video on or off anytime you want. It does not come on only if movement or noise. I keep it plugged in on my nightstand at night and will turn the video off and the sound up a notch or two. If I heard her fussing I just push the button to see what's going on and then turn it off and go back to sleep. This thing is great!!! I swear by it. It's just so easy to use."}
