{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B004V8VQKK', 'answerTime': 'Feb 3, 2014', 'unixTime': 1391414400, 'question': 'IS there a way to hang this on a wall, for instance, above a changing pad?', 'answerType': 'N', 'answer': "There is a small hole/opening on the back I think you could hang it from a nail. It is not meant to be hung, however, because it could fall on the baby. You could always set it on your changing table and attach to the wall by a nail at baby's level. That way it's not hanging over baby and the baby would still be able to see the projection."}
