{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B004X0WBHS', 'answerTime': 'Apr 9, 2014', 'unixTime': 1397026800, 'question': "Can't decide to go for this or the Manhatten Toy Winkel.... suggestions? My baby is 6 months old.", 'answerType': 'Y', 'answer': 'My son received both as gifts and initially the toy winkel was his favorite for teething and grasping. Once he started pointing with his index finger & picking up more things, the Bright Starts Activity Clack Ball became his new favorite toy. He plays with it all the time; in the car, in his crib and even kicks it while he is in his Johnny Jump-Up. I would get the Activity Ball, or both if you can, either way you will not be disappointed..'}
