{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B004X0WBHS', 'answerTime': 'Jan 31, 2015', 'unixTime': 1422691200, 'question': "Mine doesn't seem to have the squeaker. Someone else answered that you push on the top but nothing squeaks. Anyone else has one that doesn't squeak?", 'answer': "I buy these toys for my niece and nephew in another state and send to them. Then tell me how the kids like it and if it catches their eyes. They didn't mention it squeaks. But one this for sure is the little girl is almost two the baby is 9 and she plays rouch and its a hard toy and she hit the little boy on the head. So be careful. But for a child they love colors and stuff. I have bought a lot of Lamaze toys and I have or I should say they have never been disappointed. Hope this helps. If the description says its squeaks contact seller. They will work with. (Once I had a problem and they helped right away."}
