{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B004Y3DX4O', 'answerTime': 'Dec 10, 2013', 'unixTime': 1386662400, 'question': "Do these wheels hold up well on roads? We don't have pavements where we live and the roads aren't super smooth either.", 'answerType': '?', 'answer': "The Joovy Tricycoo has been used on city sidewalks and on grass without any problems; however, not on bumpy roads. Unfortunately, I cannot answer your question. My son was initially worried about the tires of the trike wearning down after use, but since it was purchased in June, 2013 and used VERY frequently, the tires are holding up nicely. The entire bike is well constructed and will endure the play of an active toddler. Perhaps you may wish to contact the manufacturer directly about the trike's endurance."}
