{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B004Y9AKZI', 'answerTime': 'Jun 13, 2013', 'unixTime': 1371106800, 'question': 'does the pack n play come with a mattress?', 'answerType': '?', 'answer': 'It doesn\'t come with a Seally Posturpedic Crib Mattress, however it does come with a firm, yet padded "mattress". I put it in quotes, because you would not want to sleep on this thing as an adult-- However, with all the safety concerns of SIDs, the firm quality of this PnP floor pad is a good thing in my opinion. We\'re using the PnP as a co-sleeper for the first months until we can transition our lil\' spud into it\'s crib and own room. Good luck!'}
