{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B004Y99M52', 'answerTime': 'Mar 17, 2015', 'unixTime': 1426575600, 'question': "My car doesn't have LATCH interface. Can I use my car's seat belt to fasten car seat with rear-facing, forward-facing and belt-positioning position?", 'answerType': 'Y', 'answer': 'Yes. The base can be fastened only with the seatbelt (the horizontal belt part in fact). Once the base is fastened, you can attach the seat in any position.'}
