{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B0054WHTRG', 'answerTime': 'Mar 15, 2014', 'unixTime': 1394866800, 'question': 'Are the teethers dishwashable? Or i can boil them ?', 'answer': "The hard ones could probably go in the dishwasher. I just washed them by hand. The stuffed hanging toys can go in the washing machine (from my experience). I don't know what the product advises on how to clean the toys, but they held up to washing machine washes, hang to dry, and hand washings. :)"}
