{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B0055PJUL0', 'answerTime': 'Mar 26, 2015', 'unixTime': 1427353200, 'question': "I have a SE 2014 RIP STYLE 26 WOMEN'S will this fit I am at the lowest setting but might be able to lift a bit more seat?", 'answer': "You will need 2 inches of your seat post for the clamp wings to attach there. Measure 10 in. out level from the seat post. This is about where the seat begins to curve up into its handlebars and will give you an idea of how it will fit your bike. Call us if you think it is close and you are worried. We might have some other solutions for you. Let's get you riding!"}
