{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B005ASKQ42', 'answerTime': 'Aug 17, 2014', 'unixTime': 1408258800, 'question': 'what is the mattress made of? is it PVC? also, what are the dimensions of the mattress (length and width)? thanks!', 'answer': "I'm not sure. I think the mattress was a vinyl material w cottony fill inside. I didn't break it upon but... I would wipe it down with vinegar and water to clean it when it for pee'd on (through the sheet) and it wiped quite easily. I don't want to take a guess at the dimensions bc I'm terrible at that so I would say prob about the same as a Moses basket or bassinet. I bought sole bassinets sheets to trade out when the sheet that came with it was soiled and they for just fine. I hope that's was helpful."}
