{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B005DOS2EE', 'answerTime': 'Jan 29, 2015', 'unixTime': 1422518400, 'question': 'Do you have extentions for this gate? I have an 82 inch opening.', 'answerType': '?', 'answer': 'Contrary to what most believe, there is an extension option. Since I found out the 72" was not quite enough to go around my back door that swings outward, instead of returning the Supergate that I bought at a discounted open box item, I did some research and took a chance with the 2 panel extension for the \'Superyard\'. I used a phillips screw driver to take out the plastic end pieces of one of the panel from the extension and switched them around to make it connect between the gate panel and the 18" short panel...volla! Works perfectly! I will add a picture of the finish product in my review...when they ask for a review.'}
