{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B005DOS2EE', 'answerTime': 'Oct 16, 2014', 'unixTime': 1413442800, 'question': 'How would I mount this gate in a hallway opening with baseboards at the bottom and straight to wall at the top?', 'answer': 'With baseboards, you just use the bracket as a guide, trace around the bracket with a pencil onto the baseboard and cut a notch out of the baseboard so that the bracket sits flush against the wall. This ended up being pretty easy to do.'}
