{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B005F5RTAO', 'answerTime': 'Jul 25, 2013', 'unixTime': 1374735600, 'question': 'Can you position this mannequin?', 'answerType': '?', 'answer': "To some degree, as in the arms swing. And beware if you're small or not strong. It is cumbersome and hard to handle. Especially if selling clothing online and you need to change pants, etc. often. When returning the one I purchased I found that Customer service is non-existent and they treated me like a criminal. No refunds on shipping, which BTW is about 3 times more than what it should be. But it was worth it just to get rid of her. By far my worst experience with an Amazon vendor. Zero stars! Don't buy it Andra unless it's to remain stationary. Good luck! Karen"}
