{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B005F5RTAO', 'answerTime': 'Oct 23, 2013', 'unixTime': 1382511600, 'question': 'can she be used for shoe, handbag and pants display?', 'answerType': '?', 'answer': "Yes - the base has a stand that slides into the mannequin's calf to make her stand upright. The shoes can be slipped on before the mannequin is attached to the base. I think you may have some trouble if you are using long boots. I have not tried any boots. The pants can be put on and then the support slipped up inside the pant leg. Again, really tight pants may be a problem. The purse should not be a problem depending on how you position of the arm. The mannequin is really sturdy. I hope this helps."}
