{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B005FEOV88', 'answerTime': 'Nov 28, 2014', 'unixTime': 1417161600, 'question': 'the top of my pillow top mattress is 32" from the floor. will this co-sleeper be able to adjust to that height?', 'answerType': 'Y', 'answer': 'Our mattress is 30" and we just ended up using it in bassinet mode. The top of the rim is about 30" from the floor. With the side down the height is 23". The company does make extenders you can attach to the bottom for extra height, but they can only be used if the cosleeper is attached to the bed. We bought the extenders but never actually used them, because having it set up as a bassinet worked well for us with the high mattress. Hope this helps!'}
