{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B005IA84M8', 'answerTime': 'Jul 3, 2014', 'unixTime': 1404370800, 'question': 'Does this monitor have an option where it is completely silent (also a darkened screen) until activated by noise?', 'answerType': '?', 'answer': 'Yes, it does. That is what the VOX or voice activated control is. It is that reason alone why I love this system. I haven\'t found another that does this. It is dark, off-like until your little one makes a noise. Then it will light up for you to see and hear on the screen! This way I don\'t have to keep going back to "check" the monitor. When it lights up, it alerts me!'}
