{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B005IWM73S', 'answerTime': 'Dec 21, 2012', 'unixTime': 1356076800, 'question': "what is the difference between the snug a bunny RNP and the original? just cuteness, or is there benefits to it's functionality?", 'answer': 'The snugabunny RNP offers more body support and is made of softer material. I read that the original RNP caused some children to develop a flat head and that this softer, updated version was designed to correct that. My daughter has been sleeping in the Snugabunny version for 2 months and her head does not show any signs of a flat spot.'}
