{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B005JDOYF0', 'answerTime': 'Apr 8, 2015', 'unixTime': 1428476400, 'question': 'Can you rock the baby to sleep in this effectively?', 'answerType': '?', 'answer': 'It depends on your baby. I had both the keyfit caddy and keyfit 30 carseat, and my son would eventually (as in, after 30-40 minutes of continuous walking) fall asleep when pushing the baby in this set up. I think the carseat was comfortable for him, but the keyfit caddy was not a particularly smooth ride on lumpy sidewalks.'}
