{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B005LVNS4S', 'answerTime': 'Nov 19, 2013', 'unixTime': 1384848000, 'question': 'I have a Britax B-agile car seat will jolly humper arctic fit?', 'answer': 'I used the Jolly Jumper Arctic with the Britax B-Agile car seat. It was fine for the first few months (my son was 3 months old when we first used it - a lifesaver), but by the time he was around 6 months, he was getting a little big to get in and out of the little opening without the cover popping off. By that time, I just put him into the seat and reinserted the cover. I recommend this cover over the JJCole (which I also owned, that went under and over him). I liked that this completely sealed him in the cold outdoors. With the JJ Cole, his head is exposed to the cold and the straps on the car seat got snug because of the blanket underneath him.'}
