{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B005MQRAAK', 'answerTime': 'Feb 23, 2014', 'unixTime': 1393142400, 'question': 'Will the Radian RXT fit rear facing in a 2011 Ford Fusion? Also, what is the maximum height in rear facing position? Thx.', 'answer': 'I will fit but the seat in front of the car seat will not be to conferrable. When the car seat is in the rear facing position it takes up room. We have a BMW and a Scion and the passenger literally has to sit all the way to the front so the diono seat will have enough room. If i could go back in time i would get this seat once the baby was able to face forward!!'}
