{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B005MQRAAK', 'answerTime': 'Oct 22, 2013', 'unixTime': 1382425200, 'question': 'How does this compare with the Safety 1st Alpha Omega Elite Convertible Car Seat?', 'answer': "Hello. I researched so many different brands, types, & models of car seats before I purchased mine that I don't remember the different specs. I went to the actual manufacturers websites and called the manufacturers with lots of questions also. I just know that the Diono Radian RXT Convertible Car Seat was a better fit for my little girl. Just went and compared the two quickly and right off the Diono is forward facing with the 5 point harness up to 80 lbs whereas the Safety 1st is only to 40 lbs. I also like the steel alloy frame & aluminum reinforced side walls of the Diono. If you haven't visited the manufacturers website for Diono its us.diono.com. Thanks & Congrats:)"}
