{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B005MQR9J2', 'answerTime': 'Jul 11, 2014', 'unixTime': 1405062000, 'question': 'Has anyone purchased the seat that shows ships in 1-3 months? Did it really take that long to get? Thx', 'answer': 'We have it in stock and for immediate delivery. Depending in what state has to be sent can take 2-5 business days. Hope this helps you make a decision. Place an order and we will ship it asap!! -Just Kids Store.'}
{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B005MQR9J2', 'answerTime': 'Sep 17, 2013', 'unixTime': 1379401200, 'question': 'Does the nylon material get hot ? Anyone in hot climate have any trouble with the nylon ones being warm to the touch ? Florida here', 'answer': 'I have the spring version of the RXT and we live in Utah where it gets over 100* but it\'s dry heat. My LO is 3 mo old and so far she hasn\'t gotten too hot, however I am not sure our material is the same. My friend has the red ones and she bought this nifty air hose ar babies r us that connects to your vent to give a little more air directly on her girls. My lo does get a little warm, but not nearly as warm as she did in the graco snugride 35. She would sweat really bad if she got upset. There is a page on Facebook that you can get this question answered plus many more. There are over 23k members and these ladies that run the site are professional car seat techs and know so much about every seat on the market. They can let you know how well a certain seat will work if you have one in mind, also they will give you recommendations if you tell them the car u have, the height/weight of the child and what percentile they are in and budget. With that info they can give you recommendations for the best seat that will last you. Also anything you would want to know about the radian, including pics and personal stories. Its called "Car seats for the Littles" there are two pages, its the one with the most members. They also have a list if people all over the country, including FL that will help and or ck your installation of the seat and its free. I never knew there was so much to know about carseat safety! Sorry for the long answer. . Hopefully I helped some. :)'}
