{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B005P4R4CS', 'answerTime': 'Dec 13, 2013', 'unixTime': 1386921600, 'question': "Can anyone recommend bassinet sheets for this mattress? I am reusing mine from 2010 and frustratingly, the company can't sell me any!!!! I'm really upset bc their FAQ says its sooo dangerous to use any other but theirs and only 3 years after purchase...", 'answerType': 'Y', 'answer': "I was not happy with the thin mattress the bassinet came with, so I ordered this one & used wonderfully soft Carter's bassinet sheets. The mattress is AMAZING - firm, custom stiched, and great quality. My little one slept like a dream on it and I even used it as a changing table when I had it wheeled out into the living room. I see others have complained about the outer fabric on the bassinet (the curtains) but I found it durable and very easy to clean. Transitioned my son into his crib around 5 month and gave this lovely bassinet to my friend who just had a baby. But, I really do recommend getting a different mattress. Here is the one I used: http://www.amazon.com/gp/product/B003UGB6YU/ref=oh_details_o01_s00_i00?ie=UTF8&psc=1"}
