{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B005SP2LWW', 'answerTime': 'Apr 17, 2014', 'unixTime': 1397718000, 'question': 'I can see people like using this for smaller babies (&amp; preemies), but how big can a baby get and still allow this to be used comfortably?', 'answer': 'I bought this for my newborn and also have a 20 month old girl. My newest baby girl is about 13 lbs now and my older girl is about 22 lbs. When I first put it on, I put my oldest in it and she fit fine. As long as you wrap it tight, it will hold weight. My newborn is now 3 months old and I use it with her when I go out places where I need my hands free for my other 2 kids. I never got one with my first two kids and figured I HAD to have it with my 3rd. I now wish I had purchased this with my first child, because it really is practical and comfortable.'}
