{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B005U6ZFG8', 'answerTime': 'Jan 6, 2015', 'unixTime': 1420531200, 'question': "how long are the adjustable straps? we have a Ergo but with our 23lb daughter in it, it's rather snug for my husband who has a wide upper body.", 'answer': "I don't have a measurement, but my husband is quite a bit larger than me and a larger build - closer to 190lbs and only 5'9. He can wear a jacket or hoodie and still wear our toddler when he was in the 30lb range. This is compared to my 5'5 and 105lb frame - significant size difference, and there was still slack on my husband with the straps."}
