{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B005UV0UU4', 'answerTime': 'Jun 12, 2014', 'unixTime': 1402556400, 'question': 'Has any used a Apple iPod shuffle or another MP3 player with unit ?', 'answer': 'My son is almost 21 mo now, so its been a bit since I used it. But I do remember hooking up our tiny MP3 player once or twice. It worked fine, but the speaker is obviously tiny! But overall, we loved this pack n play. Totally worth it for the organizing compartment on the side. Everything was right there!'}
{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B005UV0UU4', 'answerTime': 'Nov 10, 2013', 'unixTime': 1384070400, 'question': 'Is the changing table machine washable? How do you clean it when it is dirty?', 'answer': 'The cover is made of a plastic-like material, so you can wash it with a wash cloth and soap, or I have used Clorox wipes on it and let it dry. I have a cloth changing pad cover on mine and change them out when they get dirty. It makes it really easy. Good luck!'}
{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B005UV0UU4', 'answerTime': 'Mar 13, 2015', 'unixTime': 1426230000, 'question': "Can the napper portion be used as the baby's primary sleeping location overnight for the first month or two?", 'answerType': 'Y', 'answer': 'Yes, that is what it is designed for. We used this play pen next to our bed for about 4 months. Our daughter slept in the little bassinet looking "napper" for about 2 months and then we used the higher sleeping area for another couple months. The napper was nice because it has a vibrating insert (batteries) that soothed her and also puts her on a slight angle with head higher than feet which helps with reflux issues. Worked great for us!'}
{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B005UV0UU4', 'answerTime': 'Mar 5, 2015', 'unixTime': 1425542400, 'question': 'Would you tell the shipping dimentions?', 'answer': 'On the shipping dimension Q. = I do not recall in exact size. However, since it is a foldable product, it was not too large, but sturdy weight. I am considered a "tiny" person, but still managed it, to bring the package into my home from the stoop, it was not too bulky, too. It\'s a great product, and I recommend it highly. Good luck.'}
