{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B005UV0USQ', 'answerTime': 'Sep 26, 2012', 'unixTime': 1348642800, 'question': 'Can Baby Sleep here overnight: Do I need a separate bassinet for baby or can the baby sleep here at night?', 'answer': "I've known a lot of people who have used Pack N Plays as cribs. They are meant to be a place for baby to sleep. Keep in mind though, that there are no government regulations for play yards (or bassinets), so they may not follow the same safety guidelines as cribs."}
