{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B005UV0UCM', 'answerTime': 'Oct 26, 2013', 'unixTime': 1382770800, 'question': 'so what else do i need - the mattress pad cover, the sheets. it comes with a mattress? anything for the bassinet that i need?', 'answer': 'Dear Lau, I remember buying the fitted sheet for the "mattress". The pack and play comes with a foldable bottom surface that is slightly padded. That surface is supposed to be just the right padding for a baby. My guess is that anything softer would be a suffocation hazard, which is why you\'re not supposed to add in another mattress. The basinet is ready to go once the pack and play is assembled. Good luck.'}
