{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B005UV0UCM', 'answerTime': 'Jan 25, 2015', 'unixTime': 1422172800, 'question': 'Ca I buy a separate napper to use with a pack n play I already own?', 'answer': "I've never seen one. Also, baby equipment should be as safe as possible, which means that you should use things as directed and as intended. Don't risk safety to save a few bucks. Its worth the ease of mind."}
