{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B005VM63X0', 'answerTime': 'Feb 12, 2013', 'unixTime': 1360656000, 'question': 'Has anyone tried to use the Safety 1st OnBoard infant seat with this stroller?', 'answerType': '?', 'answer': 'I have! My boys are 17 months apart so I needed my Safety 1st car seat to fit and it does! I use it in the "front seat" (the one furtherest from you). Sometimes I have to push the sides in, but its a nice secure fit! It\'s a great stroller! Highly recommend! Congrats on your growing family!'}
