{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B005VM63VC', 'answerTime': 'Sep 16, 2013', 'unixTime': 1379314800, 'question': 'Is this an awkward stroller to push around? Are the seats deep? Do the seats recline flat and multi-position? Is the basket adequate? Would you buy it again?? Thanks!', 'answer': 'The stroller is not bad to push around when going straight on a smooth surface but turning is tough as its so long, it is also VERY HEAVY to lift 48lbs and the wheels lock when folded so you cannot roll it. The back seat reclines back into a bassinet but the front seat only reclines half way and they are both cheaply made. They are multi position. NO.. I would not buy again and I would not recommend it.'}
