{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B005VX12HG', 'answerTime': 'Nov 1, 2013', 'unixTime': 1383289200, 'question': 'How soft are these? I\'ve read reviews from different styles and it seems some prints are softer and "wear" better than others.', 'answer': 'We also have a 2.5 tog GroBag in the "Alphabets Neutral" print. We\'ve had that one since last winter, so it\'s been worn and washed quite a bit more. That said, I remember it being softer when we first got it - more like flannel than regular woven cotton (though it lacks should snaps and zips down the front). The "Hippo Hop" and "Spot" ones aren\'t super scratchy, especially considering that our son only wears these when he\'s already in long-sleeve pajamas. They also have shoulder snaps and zip on the side. We are happy with our purchase.'}
