{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B005WPPT54', 'answerTime': 'Dec 8, 2014', 'unixTime': 1418025600, 'question': 'I will have 2 babies 13 months apart and looking for a bag big enough for 2 sets of diapers/clothes etc. Would this work?', 'answerType': 'Y', 'answer': "Yes! I think it would be perfect for 2 babies. I am one who over packs my diaper bags and I have a hard time over packing this one because it has so much space. I have had this diaper bag for a wile now and it is still my favorite diaper bag and that is saying a lot because I am one to always change diaper bags. But this one is great! It has 4 inside pockets that are very big and hold a lot and 8 outer pockets. ( 4 secret pockets that are really big 2 small pockets in front and two side bottle pockets. Like I said I have always over filled all my diaper bags and with this one I can't seem to fill all of the pockets. I am definitely going to use this diaper bag when I have a second child and will need a diaper bag for 2 kids."}
{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B005WPPT54', 'answerTime': 'Jan 4, 2014', 'unixTime': 1388822400, 'question': 'I have found with other diaper bags, one you fill the inside pockets, you have very little room inside for other items. Does this bag do the same?', 'answerType': 'Y', 'answer': 'Well, yes when you put stuff in the inner pocket it does eat up a bit of room but I ise the diaper bag both for just going out shopping and spending the night in my hometown for a visit. I pack 10 size 2 diapers in one of the 4 inner pockets; change mat wipes, diaper cream, and paci wipes in another; a change of clothes and a sleeper in another and two receiving blankets (used for burping) in the other. With all that packed in there I still have plenty of room for 4-5 toys, a quilted blanket for floor play, a bottle warmer thermos (tomee tippee brand) two bottles in the insulated side pockets and my wallet slid into one of the four exterior pockets. Now... Even them I have room to stuff more stuff in need be but by then the bag is getting a bit heavy lol.'}
{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B005WPPT54', 'answerTime': 'Dec 14, 2014', 'unixTime': 1418544000, 'question': 'Does the bag have "feet" so when you set it down it won\'t touch the ground? Also is it water proof? Any insulation for bottles?', 'answer': 'There is no feet on the diaper bag but there are five silver knobs beneath for protection. It is not not waterproof and there is no insulation.'}
