{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B005XJ2VGY', 'answerTime': 'Mar 16, 2015', 'unixTime': 1426489200, 'question': 'Fireproofing chemical question: Does the tag attached say that it complies with TB 117?', 'answer': "Nothing about TB117 is mentioned on the tags attached to the chair, nor in the booklet. It's a great chair. The only thing that bothers me is the fact that the legs stick out at an angle, which is OK, I knew that before purchasing it. But, if you have elders using it in their homes, especially if they wear glasses, it can be a dangerous tripping hazard. Otherwise, it is simple to use and folds up nicely. 5 stars!"}
