{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B005XJ2VH8', 'answerTime': 'Jul 23, 2014', 'unixTime': 1406098800, 'question': 'Did anyone have issues with the detachable tray and removing the sticker that it came with? It left a sticky residue all over my tray .', 'answerType': 'N', 'answer': "I don't recall but not surprised. Goo gone works awesome on adhesive residue as well as a good soak in dawn and water."}
