{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B0062BVY42', 'answerTime': 'Apr 18, 2013', 'unixTime': 1366268400, 'question': 'How does it work? How do you know when you have the lid on tight enough?', 'answer': 'I just screwed the lid on like any bottle or sippy cup. I did not over tighten or under tighten. Just snug. Then they suck on the edge and it comes out. I tried it.... Works great. My 4 and 6 year old kids want one too. I have not tried milk in it yet but it should be fine. No leaks that i have seen.'}
