{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B0062NJ4ZG', 'answerTime': 'Feb 11, 2014', 'unixTime': 1392105600, 'question': 'Cuisinart BRM-1000 vs. Sage Spoonfuls system?! Even though it does everything in one, the references to plastic melting (BPA-free) and mold are scary!', 'answer': 'I\'ve had my Sage Spoonfuls system for over a year now and love it. I have never had any issues with the plastic melting or mold growing. The quality is really good and the motor is on top so it never gets wet. Most of those "all-in-one" machines seem to have that same problem of plastic melting and mold growing. Pretty gross when you consider these products are for our babies. I definitely recommend Sage Spoonfuls.'}
