{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B0065LTW52', 'answerTime': 'Nov 25, 2013', 'unixTime': 1385366400, 'question': 'I have rather large breasts and am having trouble finding a pump with comfortable shields for my size. How well does this pump work for larger breast?', 'answer': "I have breast that are size 36K (also known as ginormous!) and this is the most comfortable pump used yet. I also have extremely sensitive skin, to the point the other shields have taken skin off, and these shields have never irritated my skin. My two negatives would be it is on the noisy side and you have to get all the pieces together perfectly or you won't have good suction. One bonus is, Dr. Browns will replace everything but the pump itself if you break something-- for free. GREAT customer service! I've used 5 different pumps and this is the best I've found so far."}
