{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B0068IQUFM', 'answerTime': 'Oct 29, 2013', 'unixTime': 1383030000, 'question': 'is it suitable for stokke? or is it only for umbrella stroller?', 'answer': "Hi Carolyn, the Hamster stroller bags are suitable for umbrella and other strollers but not the Stokke. The bags need something to hold them at the top so they don't slide down the frame. The bags will fit the Peg Si. They were originally designed for umbrella strollers which often tip backwards but they fit many other strollers."}
{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B0068IQUFM', 'answerTime': 'Oct 29, 2013', 'unixTime': 1383030000, 'question': 'does this work on stokke?', 'answerType': '?', 'answer': 'These bags attach to a stroller with a two-piece system. one piece wraps around a stroller frame (with velcro) and has a buckle at the end. The other piece is the bag itself with a buckle at the end. the two buckle pieces then fit together to lock the bag onto the stroller. So as long as the stroller has a frame that the velcro bands can wrap around (which i assume would be pretty much all strollers), then these bags would fit. I love these bags -- they fit everything and prevent the stroller from tipping over.'}
