{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B006AXWVP8', 'answerTime': 'Mar 16, 2013', 'unixTime': 1363417200, 'question': 'I read in one of the reviews that this pump was loud. Is this true? I will be pumping in an office where you can hear everything!', 'answerType': 'Y', 'answer': "Hi Kara, The Spectra 9 is an amazing little pump! It will fit anywhere and has so many features! But, because of it's size, I wouldn't say it is the quietest of pumps and it isn't the loudest of pumps. You will be able to hear it but it definitely isn't obtrusive! If you want complete silence with your pump, I highly recommend the Spectra Dew 350 or the Spectra S2. These are hospital grade pumps and, although they are a bit bigger(not TOO much), they are really efficient and quiet. Hope that helps. Let us know if you have any more questions. THANKS!"}
