{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B006K18VKO', 'answerTime': 'Jul 31, 2014', 'unixTime': 1406790000, 'question': "Some other cots I've looked at seem to have a high point or even a bar in the middle. Does this one have any weird lumps or bumps?", 'answer': "There isn't a bar in the middle but it is kind of taunt in the middle. However this doesn't seem to bother my grandkids. If it did bother them it would be easy to remember with a thick blanket. It's basically a mini cot for toddlers/pre-schoolers. I bought one years ago and between my grand daughter and those I've loaned it out to, we've wore it out. I bought 2 more since now that I have 2 grandkids that use them. They're well worth their money and have been a good purchase."}
