{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B006K4R3VO', 'answerTime': 'Sep 17, 2014', 'unixTime': 1410937200, 'question': 'is this stroller comfortable for baby under 6months?', 'answerType': '?', 'answer': 'The stroller does lay flat and you can buy a car seat attachment. There are several height adjustments for the straps as well. We started using it before our son was 6 months and he seemed perfectly happy.'}
{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B006K4R3VO', 'answerTime': 'Feb 7, 2014', 'unixTime': 1391760000, 'question': 'Does anyone know the vertical height of the handle from the ground at the smaller and largest setting? Is it easy to adjust?', 'answer': 'The smallest setting is 33" from ground to hands highest is 44" with several position in between.'}
{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B006K4R3VO', 'answerTime': 'Mar 6, 2013', 'unixTime': 1362556800, 'question': 'Does anyone know the height of the seat back? My 3 yr old is very tall and this has been my biggest challenge with finding a stroller that works. Thanks!', 'answer': 'My three year olds head still has a tiny bit of space. We bought the baby jogger over the BOB because it does have a taller seat. On the baby jogger site it says the seat back height is- 26". It was the tallest back of all th strollers we found, and we looked around for a few months. I will say I\'m extremely happy w my baby jogger city elite! My son is 42" tall and he is very comfy. We will definitely be able to use this until he doesn\'t need a stroller anymore.'}
{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B006K4R3VO', 'answerTime': 'Mar 16, 2014', 'unixTime': 1394953200, 'question': 'Hi, sorry for asking the question again: Does this model has a handbrake, and if so where is it installed (at the pictures it does not look like)', 'answer': 'yes, the hand brake is located on the right hand side of the handle bar.'}
