{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B006LJATXW', 'answerTime': 'Dec 22, 2013', 'unixTime': 1387699200, 'question': "Is this comfortable when worn as a backpack? I have a diaper bag and when converted to wear on ur back it sits slanted and it's uncomfortable", 'answerType': '?', 'answer': "Hi Paula, yes. I find it comfortable when I wear it as a backpack. I try not to overstuff it (hard to do when your a first time mom and have all that space) and I wear it on top of my ergo carrier straps. I use it daily. My husband at times has complained that it is a bit heavy and uncomfortable, but that's when I over stuff it. The backpack straps would benefits from a little more padding. But I truly love my diaper bag. People are always complementing me on it. I have a natural colored ergo that matches and people always think it is a combo deal."}
