{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B006NWMNT0', 'answerTime': 'Oct 21, 2013', 'unixTime': 1382338800, 'question': 'Do you think this will fit in my Honda accord as a rear facing seat without obstructing my rear view horribly??', 'answerType': '?', 'answer': "We have ours rear-facing in a VW Tiguan (a smaller SUV), and it doesn't obstruct our view, but we put it on the left side of the car, not the middle seat, for this very reason. The seat is very tall and quite large. That being said, it's the best on the market and we love it."}
{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B006NWMNT0', 'answerTime': 'Sep 4, 2013', 'unixTime': 1378278000, 'question': 'Does anyone know of a travel bag that fits this seat? Looking to take it for air travel and have it gate checked. Anything other than the really expensive wheelee they are selling?', 'answer': "Many other sellers are including the travel bag for free right now. That said, I have the Foonf and wouldn't ever think of traveling with it. The thing weighs a ton and I would not want to lug it through an airport with all of the other stuff you end up needing when traveling with kids. We used an older car seat that weighs 13 lbs less than Foonf when we flew with out daughter recently and leaving the Foonf at home was the smartest thing we did that trip."}
{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B006NWMNT0', 'answerTime': 'Aug 28, 2013', 'unixTime': 1377673200, 'question': 'Can this car seat be used in Canada?', 'answerType': '?', 'answer': 'Clek is actually a Canadian company && yes the foonf passes safety tests in both Canada & US. I am not sure of they are different at all though, so I would contact clek to make sure purchasing off amazon is appropriate! :)'}
