{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B006QH458Y', 'answerTime': 'Jun 27, 2014', 'unixTime': 1403852400, 'question': 'How well will these wheels hold up on a gravel road? Our gravel road had ruined the wheels on the chicco we have now.', 'answer': 'The wheels will be fine! The tires are solid and seem that can handle rough terrain. We have both a City Select and a City Mini GT double for our twins. We take the City Select on smoother streets and use the City Mini GT on harsher outdoor activities like the park, walking trails, etc. So I think the wheels will do fine on gravel.'}
