{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B006QI1PCW', 'answerTime': 'Dec 18, 2013', 'unixTime': 1387353600, 'question': 'Will this be well-suited for my 8 month old who is 20 pounds? There is no specification for age range listed with this toy. I wish there was!', 'answerType': '?', 'answer': "We used it from 4 months and still use it every now and then (my son is currently 11 months old). It is definitely a go-to toy when I just need to be hands free for a couple of minutes, but he's outgrown staying in it much longer than 5 minutes at a time. At 8 months, we probably used it several times a day still, but it might not be worth the $ at this point. I would be more concerned with the height. At 30 inches, my son is at the last height level, and I'm pretty sure that's the maximum recommended height, too. We'll probably pack it up right around his birthday..."}
