{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B006SFUEF2', 'answerTime': 'Oct 20, 2013', 'unixTime': 1382252400, 'question': "We've had Munchkin replace two of these already for the projector not working after a few weeks. Anyone know how to fix this?", 'answer': "I'm waiting for my second replacement unit now. They've already acknowledged that this is a design defect and that the project has been redesigned. Contact customer service again, request another replacement and ask for the redesigned unit instead. There's nothing you're doing wrong and I'm not aware of a way to fix this. I took the first one apart and it's just cheaply made with plastic gears and an undersized motor that don't hold up."}
