{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B006SFUENO', 'answerTime': 'Dec 14, 2013', 'unixTime': 1387008000, 'question': "What's the width when the pinch guard is NOT installed and the gate is fully retracted? Does the pinch guard prevent the gate from fully retracting?", 'answer': 'I am not sure if you can have \'pinch guard not installed\'. It is riveted and comes already assembled as part of the gate. When folded, the door will take up at least 26.5"-27" (you have to have a mounting hardware on both sides). Fully extended it would take up 63.5-64" (again, with the mounting hardware in place)'}
{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B006SFUENO', 'answerTime': 'Sep 19, 2013', 'unixTime': 1379574000, 'question': 'Does the gate "lock" in the extended length you choose, or does it expand/contract as you open or close it?', 'answer': 'It does not lock in the extended length. It expands or contracts as you open or close it'}
