{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B006UDLXGQ', 'answerTime': 'May 1, 2014', 'unixTime': 1398927600, 'question': 'Does this help to prevent flat head?', 'answerType': 'Y', 'answer': 'Yes, one of the main functions/purposes for this item is to prevent flat spots on the back of the head in infants. It also comes with a neck support piece, but we never used that (my son was born with a fairly strong neck and did not need it). We used the other Boppy version with our first child after the pediatrician noted she was getting a flat spot. Used this version with our second child from the start and he never developed a flat spot.'}
