{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B006UDLXGQ', 'answerTime': '6 days ago', 'question': 'I have the chicco keyfit 30. Do you take the infant headrest that comes with the carseat out in order to put this in?', 'answerType': 'Y', 'answer': 'I did . But what I did noticed is that every time my baby would fall asleep in the car seat his head would totally go forward . I would literally extend my arm while driving and hold his head upright until we got to our destination . I later on figured out that it was this thing that would caused my baby to sleep with his head forward. I wanted to return it but the expiration expired . Good luck'}
