{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B006UMUB92', 'answerTime': 'Oct 6, 2013', 'unixTime': 1381042800, 'question': 'Do I have to purchase the stair installation kit to use this gate for the stairs or does it come with everything I need?', 'answer': "Hi, i believe the stair installation kit is made so you don't have to screw in the banisters etc. I didn't get them. I will fill the holes with wood filler and paint over once we are done."}
{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B006UMUB92', 'answerTime': 'Oct 1, 2014', 'unixTime': 1412146800, 'question': 'Does anyone who has this gate also have cats? Can they fit through it easily? I have one tiny cat and one fat cat. Hoping the fat one can fit through.', 'answer': 'My kittens fit through but my bigger cats jump over. I bought it to keep the dogs from eating the cat food.'}
