{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B006VIHL48', 'answerTime': 'Aug 26, 2014', 'unixTime': 1409036400, 'question': 'Is this 3 full bottle sets? All pieces included? 3 bottles, 3 nipples, 3 ventilation, rings, and lids?', 'answer': "Yes, 3 three full bottles. I did end up purchases two extra silicone sleeves though. Amazon does have them for sale, but wouldn't ship to Alaska, so I bought them from Summer.com."}
{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B006VIHL48', 'answerTime': 'Mar 5, 2015', 'unixTime': 1425542400, 'question': 'Can I buy extra sleeves?', 'answerType': 'Y', 'answer': "Yes, I bought extras here on Amazon. They're Born Free silicone bottle sleeves that come in a two pack. You can choose either blue or pink. I found they work well. They are easier to get on/off than the green one that comes with them originally. Although I must say the bottles are extremely durable. I've dropped the bottles several times before I got the sleeves on them with or without fluid in them (I have grip problems with my hands) and never had one break. I think you'd half to slam them just right on the concrete before that would happen. Born Free products are all well made. I also took the toddler sippy cup handles off the Born Free sippy & use it on the bottles so my baby (& I) have an easier time holding the bottle. I love that the Born Free bottles & sippy cups all are the same size with interchangeable parts."}
{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B006VIHL48', 'answerTime': 'Jan 27, 2015', 'unixTime': 1422345600, 'question': 'are these bottles compatible with medela pump? meaning - can I use this bottle directly to pump using medela instyle pump?', 'answer': "Sorry,I've never used Medela Pump .You can measure the aperture to determine if appropriate"}
