{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B006W79MAY', 'answerTime': 'Nov 8, 2013', 'unixTime': 1383897600, 'question': 'Can this be put in the microwave after water has been put in the chamber and there is food in the compartments?', 'answer': 'Yes, but you have to leave the orange tab open if you do that. Also, the food might get too hot if you microwave it in the dish. It heats more evenly if you heat up the water in a separate container and then add it to the chamber to heat the baby food in the dish.'}
