{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B006YBHE6M', 'answerTime': 'Jan 18, 2014', 'unixTime': 1390032000, 'question': 'Hi! Can anyone tell me how many different songs this plays? Also, what is the longest duration the songs will play for? Thank you!', 'answer': "The number of songs- I'm not sure, maybe 6-8? There are 4 settings- music and lights, music only, water sound and lights, water sound only. The soother plays for 30 min total. For the settings with lights and music/sound the first 10 min is normal volume and brightness, second 10 min the lights dim slightly and music volume lowers, last 10 min the lights are off and music volume lowers more. The settings with music/sound only do the same, volume decreases in 10 min increments. There is also a remote that lets you turn the soother on, but I've never had to use it, baby is usually sleeping by the time the 30 min is up. I used the music and lights setting when I first got it, but have had better luck with the water sound and lights. The water sound kind of mimics the 'shhhh' noise babies like."}
