{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B006ZVV0P2', 'answerTime': 'Jun 26, 2014', 'unixTime': 1403766000, 'question': 'What is this mat made of? Is there PVC in it? I called Britax Customer Service and they said the "did not know"!', 'answer': "There're is no PVC. They are made of a water resistant fabric that is washable. It doesn't say on the packaging what it is...but feels like nylon. They are a tightly woven fabric which seems very durable, such as the type of material that would be in a raincoat. Hope this helps."}
{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B006ZVV0P2', 'answerTime': 'Jan 2, 2014', 'unixTime': 1388649600, 'question': 'Does the bottom of the mat attach to the seat with a clip/buckle?', 'answerType': '?', 'answer': "There is an elastic band at the bottom of the kick mat but it does not have a clip or buckle. You have to slip it down the entire length of the seat back. The top has an elastic with a buckle that goes around the head rest. Both are very snug fitting on my car seats which is good because they have not moved since I installed them. It's been almost a year now since I've had them."}
