{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B0071MQ0NG', 'answerTime': 'Mar 20, 2014', 'unixTime': 1395298800, 'question': "When should my baby start wearing it? She's almost 4 months and has started to teeth, but it seems too ig.", 'answer': 'My kids all started teething at 4 months, so they were wearing them before that. I bought one for a friend as well. All my friends have started their babies wearing them at least as early as 4 months. My 18 month old has been wearing his since then and has only had it off a handful of times. I have never had a problem with it even when it seemed a bit big at first.'}
