{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B0072APMHM', 'answerTime': 'Mar 15, 2014', 'unixTime': 1394866800, 'question': 'Could you please tell me if RUMBA color is girly.Is it like dark pink.Can it be used for guys.', 'answerType': '?', 'answer': "We use it for our little boy. Not pink at all, apple red. (We love our Kiddy car seat though now our son is 2 I wish it had a drink holder and it's pretty tricky for him to hold anything whilst in the seat - eg soft toy or snack pot - as the shield makes it too difficult. But this is a small price to pay for what I feel is the safest car seat out there. And so unbelievably easy to get him in and out. I never mind running car errands with him to several shops, even with a winter coat on."}
