{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B0072IINY8', 'answerTime': 'May 7, 2014', 'unixTime': 1399446000, 'question': 'How sturdy is it? My baby likes to "dance" (rigorously) when she\'s sitting in her regular high chair, so I am worried about it tipping over.', 'answer': 'I used this at a family reunion with several babies of various ages and squirminess. A very large child with something to push their feet against might get this to topple over backwards but we found the footprint big enough to be very sturdy. We only used it on flat surfaces. On a bumpy surface, like grass, it might be another story.'}
