{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B0076A7R8U', 'answerTime': 'Jan 22, 2014', 'unixTime': 1390377600, 'question': 'Does the front wheel swivel?', 'answerType': 'Y', 'answer': 'Yes and it has the option to lock as well. I love mine and it is light to push'}
{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B0076A7R8U', 'answerTime': 'Jan 21, 2014', 'unixTime': 1390291200, 'question': 'Any opinions about "every day" use- doctor\'s visits, shopping etc.? Any different suggestions?', 'answer': "This stroller is awesome! I nannied for two boys (1 and 3) and this stroller was awesome for many uses from travel to putting them to sleep. Rain cover is really handy too. I will mention I was in a quiet area and didn't have to do sidewalks and load unload from car often in that case I think you might find it a little on the bulky side depending in your needs."}
{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B0076A7R8U', 'answerTime': 'Jan 8, 2014', 'unixTime': 1389168000, 'question': 'Will a newborn be able to ride in this stroller without issue?', 'answerType': 'Y', 'answer': "Hard to say. The seat reclines flat so you can lay them down but pending size of baby I can't say for sure if straps get tight enough. We used ours for 2 year old and six months and it worked great. Easy to use. Light. Don't understand any of the negative reviews about wheels coming off. If you put together right its fine. We love ours wish I got sooner. Only downside is its wide. Hope this helps. We had front back double stroller where we could put car seat. But it was to hard to use. Went to this and wished we got this first."}
{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B0076A7R8U', 'answerTime': 'Jan 2, 2014', 'unixTime': 1388649600, 'question': 'Can aI fit the car seat in the stroller?', 'answerType': '?', 'answer': 'This stroller does not support the use of an infant car seat but the seats do recline almost completely flat. I used this stroller with my youngest when she was three months and I bought one of those snuzzler head supports that you can get anywhere even here on amazon and reclined the seat all the way back and she was completely comfortable and her head was supported.'}
