{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B0077J2KA0', 'answerTime': 'Mar 1, 2014', 'unixTime': 1393660800, 'question': 'I was looking at product detail specially the weight,the shipping weight is 47.65pound.But the item weight is24pound,is the box that heavy ?!', 'answerType': '?', 'answer': "i'm not quite sure how heavy the box was when it shipped, but it was still easy for me to carry from my car to my apartment. there are two boxes inside the actual box: box for the stroller and bassinet. both padded really well. i hope this helps."}
