{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B0077J2KA0', 'answerTime': 'Aug 21, 2014', 'unixTime': 1408604400, 'question': 'What items are included in this price for the stroller?', 'answer': "The stroller frame, the toddler seat, the bassinet,(which can be used as a mosses basket or pram- my kids slept in there for the first month of their lives and ride in it until 6 months-no need to buy a cosleeper or special infant insert), both the bassinet and the toddler sun visors are huge, especially the toddler seat! Also I love the height of te stroller- no need to transfer your toddler to a high chair, it's a muh taller seat so you can pull it right up to a table at dinner and it saves your back! We got this stroller with our first and are atill using it everyday with him (on the hitchhiker -sold separately) and our one year old twins (second seat also sold separately). It really does grow with you and fits through the door. Best stroller out there if you ask me! Oh and fantastic customer service!"}
{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B0077J2KA0', 'answerTime': 'Aug 4, 2014', 'unixTime': 1407135600, 'question': 'without the bassinet, can baby lay flat in the stroller while sleeping? Does this stroller sell without bassinet ? Thanks,', 'answer': "it reclines to 180 degrees i would suggest getting a infant carseat snuggler if you're going to use it for a newborn ( i would use the summer infant of the uppababy infant snugseat for extra support) if you don't want the bassinet then I would suggest the uppababy cruz which does notinclude the bassinet and is slightly smaller than the vista but it has all the features such as the reversible seat etc..."}
{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B0077J2KA0', 'answerTime': 'May 27, 2014', 'unixTime': 1401174000, 'question': 'While a toddler is in the stroller can you make it go quickly/easily from front to rear facing (if I encounter sun)? or must remove child?', 'answer': 'I have not tried to change the seat while my daughter is in there. It would most likely be safer to remove them before. The sunshade should provide enough shade if you run into the sun'}
