{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B007ATWM46', 'answerTime': 'May 29, 2014', 'unixTime': 1401346800, 'question': 'Could people say what model/type/size toilet seat they have when they say it does or does not work for their specific toilet?', 'answer': 'Mine is Kohler and its was a tight fit..I can tell you that the back piece in the picture is going be what makes it or breaks it..let me see if you can follow this..See the U shapes on both sides of the back piece? Those have to fit around the toilets lid attachments (where the lid attaches to the toilet). From the outside of the U to the other outside of the U is just over 6 inches. The inside of the U to the inside of the U is about 4 and 3/4 inches. If that thing fits the seat part snaps on! Good luck, I hope this helps!'}
