{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B007CTPWXW', 'answerTime': 'Mar 23, 2014', 'unixTime': 1395558000, 'question': 'does it work on the City Select stroller', 'answerType': 'Y', 'answer': "Yes it does. We have a City Select and it works just fine! It's a great organizer - much better than the City Select organizer! It's deeper, so my water bottles fit it without toppling out. It does get a little tight when the stroller's seat back is raised (to accommodate a taller child) - I have to push the seat forward an inch or so to put the drink in (but this would happen with ANY organizer)."}
