{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B007CTPWXW', 'answerTime': 'Dec 10, 2013', 'unixTime': 1386662400, 'question': 'Can it hold a hot cup of coffee?', 'answerType': 'Y', 'answer': 'It can hold tall mugs without handles, or small bottles of water. Also, a starbucks cup (the paper ones they give you) fits fine but it spills a little if walking on a side walk or uneven pavement.'}
