{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B007CTPWXW', 'answerTime': 'Jun 19, 2014', 'unixTime': 1403161200, 'question': 'will this work with a b-agile double stroller?', 'answerType': 'Y', 'answer': "Yes. We use it on ours. It took a few minutes to adjust it properly and at first glance we didn't think it would work. We have it on the left side of the stroller and it's stayed on perfectly for about three months now. Highly reccomend it! It's very durable and I never realized how loud zipper pouches were around sleeping babies until I used the super silent magnetic pouch on this. Like I said, it just takes a little adjusting to make sure it's snug enough to stay and level enough for drinks. I recommend placing it as close to the back of the stroller as possible to keep it level. Get it! :-)"}
