{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B007E8RSGA', 'answerTime': 'Aug 24, 2014', 'unixTime': 1408863600, 'question': 'Would this work for both my husband and I? How expandable are the straps? He is a lot bigger than I am.', 'answer': 'My DH is 6\'2" and I\'m 5\'4" and we are both able to easily babywear with this or our Beco Soleil. The straps are very adjustable. The reason we love this brand is because you can cross the straps when front carrying.'}
