{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B007F337NM', 'answerTime': 'Nov 24, 2013', 'unixTime': 1385280000, 'question': 'How heavy is this car seat?', 'answer': "It weighs about 20 pounds. It is also long and kind of awkward to carry. If you get one, you'll definitely want to get a liner to put underneath to protect your cars upholstery. My suggestion is that if at all possible, buy one for each car you own to reduce the necessity of having to wrestle it in and out of cars. One of the reasons it is so heavy is that it has two steel bars--one on each side, running down the sides to protect kiddo in the event of a side collision. The plastic is thick and heavy duty, also to protect kiddo."}
