{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B007G5FZ4I', 'answerTime': 'Jan 11, 2014', 'unixTime': 1389427200, 'question': 'How firm is the mattress they provide? it looks rather soft. Has anyone used a different but firmer mattress?', 'answer': "It is softer and thicker than a pack-n-play bottom, but not so soft that you'd need to worry about it. I always thought the pack-n-plays must feel like lying on a board, so I wanted a thicker and softer mattress because I thought it would be more comfortable for our little guy so I haven't used a firmer mattress. He loves it though and goes right to sleep in it just like he does with his crib at home. This is seriously one of the best purchases we've made. We've traveled all over the world with our guy and it's been super convenient. It's easy to set up and break down (it takes literally 60 seconds) and the zip-up bag it comes in means you can check it when flying too."}
