{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B007HKOL8S', 'answerTime': 'Apr 5, 2014', 'unixTime': 1396681200, 'question': 'how often should you change the nipple?', 'answer': "I change mine as my baby grows. NB flow #1 I used for the first 2-3 months. #2 I used for 3-6 months. #3 I used for 6-8 months. #4 fast slow I used from 8+ months. They are very sturdy. I haven't had any break. Clean them well and sanitize and they will last a long time. I'm saving mine to see if I can use them again for my next baby. They do turn a little yellow, but as long as they are shiny and clean, they are good to go."}
