{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B007NG5UGS', 'answerTime': 'Jun 15, 2014', 'unixTime': 1402815600, 'question': 'How long does the music play?', 'answer': "I've never used this feature, but to answer you question my husband turned on the music. Apparently each of the 5 songs plays for about 30 seconds and then plays again,and again, and again for approximately 20 minutes. You select which song you want to play. I hope this answers your question. The monitor is really a sanity saver because it lets me do some things while the baby sleeps. One more thing, don't expect to see anything on the screen in bright sunshine. It is completely washed out in that kind of light, but well worth having outside because you can hear the baby when he wakes up. I wouldn't be without it."}
{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B007NG5UGS', 'answerTime': 'May 10, 2014', 'unixTime': 1399705200, 'question': 'my present monitor is not very loud. 1. Will the tv on in the room interfere with the sound and how loud is the audio? I need it to be very loud.', 'answer': "I've never experienced any interference between the tv and the sound of the monitor. And in my opinion, the audio is loud enough to hear over a loud tv. There are seven volume levels and an option to mute. We have been using this monitor for over a year and love it. The option to buy additional cameras and link them to the tv monitor has also helped us so much."}
