{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B007S76KSE', 'answerTime': 'Aug 9, 2013', 'unixTime': 1376031600, 'question': "How much does the seat alone weigh? I'm trying to find a seat that I can actually carry around!", 'answer': "The bucket on it's own weighs 9.6lbs which is just about the same as the SnugRide35. By comparison, the Britax Chaperone is 10.2lbs."}
{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B007S76KSE', 'answerTime': 'Dec 1, 2013', 'unixTime': 1385884800, 'question': 'The Britax Chapperone does not go in shopping carts. Does the B-safe??', 'answerType': 'N', 'answer': 'No infant car seat should ever be placed in a shopping cart on the top part where the child seat is. All infant car seats come with warnings about this. Babies have died because the car seat fell off of the shopping cart. Do not do this. Instead, hang the car seat sideways over the deep part of the cart so that most of the car seat is inside the cart but hanging from the sides of the cart. You can still put stuff underneath the car seat and to the side of the car seat in the cart and your baby will be much much safer. Hope this helps.'}
{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B007S76KSE', 'answerTime': 'Jun 5, 2014', 'unixTime': 1401951600, 'question': 'Do you need a newborn insert for this??', 'answerType': '?', 'answer': "You should never use any after-market products with a car seat, including head supports/snugglers. If it did not come with the car seat, it hasn't been crash-tested to be safe, and can also void the warranty of the seat."}
{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B007S76KSE', 'answerTime': 'Nov 1, 2012', 'unixTime': 1351753200, 'question': 'Is the cushion covering washable?', 'answerType': '?', 'answer': 'The removable cover is washable, yes. The EPS foam under the cover is not removable and can be wiped with a damp cloth (no solvent) per the manual. The straps can be wiped clean but should also not be submerged or washed with a harsh cleanser or solvent. Hope that helps!'}
