{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B007S76KSE', 'answerTime': 'Sep 3, 2014', 'unixTime': 1409727600, 'question': 'This car seat seems to be a bit deep and seems have an acute angle compared to others. Does anyone feel if it will be uncomfortable for infants?', 'answerType': '?', 'answer': 'Our little one was born 6 lbs 18 inches and we have used this car seat from the day we left the hospital. She is now 6 months and we still use this car seat and have even used this car seat to help calm her down when nothing else would work and I am not just talking about the 2:00 a.m. car rides, we just strap her in and carry it around....she just feels comfortable in the car seat I guess....but as I have quickly learned some things will work for you and your little one and others might not...so if you think it has to acute of an angle, don\'t buy it b/c if your little one is upset in the car seat all your going to think about is "its that stinking acute angle and that darn car seat making him/her uncomfortable", even though it might not be.'}
