{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B007W68CE6', 'answerTime': 'Apr 8, 2014', 'unixTime': 1396940400, 'question': 'Is the seat cover padded?', 'answerType': 'Y', 'answer': 'Hi, Kathy! Yes, there is padding in this precious seat cover - However, there is not as much padding as there is in some originally installed seat covers. I bought this adorable cover for my sixth granddaughter, who received her "hand-me-down" car seat from her young cousin! I bought the Bella Maya cover to \'dress up\' the used car seat. We cleaned the original car seat liner and placed the new cover over it to make it "fluffier". Everyone loves the cover and thought we had it custom made! (I had my neighbor embroider the baby\'s name in a pink to match the hood ruffle, and it looks great!) I believe you will enjoy the cover if you purchase it; I would definitely buy another one... looks great!)'}
