{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B007W68CE6', 'answerTime': 'May 29, 2014', 'unixTime': 1401346800, 'question': 'is were the seat belt goes threw are there adjustable whole3. i have a graco car seat and it has 3 set sfor the belt that goes around the baby', 'answerType': '?', 'answer': 'Hi, I emailed my supplier and this was her response.. "Our covers have openings that open and close with snaps, so they adjust to any height of the safety belts. There is no need to remove manufacturer\'s cover, ours fit over the existing one, you just pull the straps through the openings and snap around the straps. With that said, the covers only fit on the infant car seat covers, not the convertible ones that go from infant to toddler." hope this helps.'}
