{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B007X58GQ0', 'answerTime': 'Mar 6, 2014', 'unixTime': 1394092800, 'question': 'Which car seats are compatable with this stroller? Are the adapters included? Also, is there a rain cover available specifically for this model?', 'answer': 'Valco sells a rain cover for this stroller. The car seat adapters are for several of their strollers. You can find the list of car seats that are compatible on www.valcobaby.com'}
{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B007X58GQ0', 'answerTime': 'Apr 10, 2014', 'unixTime': 1397113200, 'question': 'How does this close? With 1 hand?', 'answer': "Yes, with one hand. You push a safety release button on the left side (with hand or foot) and then push and twist/turn the handle at the top and it closes in a snap. This truly is a fantastic stroller. My only complaint is that when using the infant car seat adapter (not included) you must remove it or the stroller will not close. Not an issue if you don't intend to use it this way. Even with this slight hassle, I would buy this stroller again hands down. Oh, and I have it in black not silver."}
{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B007X59W5Y', 'answerTime': 'Dec 11, 2013', 'unixTime': 1386748800, 'question': "Did anybody have trouble with adjusting the harness? I want to get this stroller but I've read reviews on how difficult it is to adjust straps. Thanks", 'answerType': '?', 'answer': "It's maybe not the easiest system out there in terms of adjusting, but I didn't really find it difficult. I LOVE this stroller and was so glad I purchased it!!"}
{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B007X59W5Y', 'answerTime': 'Jan 28, 2014', 'unixTime': 1390896000, 'question': 'Can it be used for an infant as is? Or does it accomodate an infant car seat?', 'answer': 'The Snap stroller does accomodate Infant Car seats. There are adaptors that you can purchase that work with the following infant car seats. Graco, Peg-Perego, Chicco/Maxi Cosi, Britax.'}
