{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B007X64EKG', 'answerTime': 'Jul 14, 2014', 'unixTime': 1405321200, 'question': 'how does this fold? and also can i put my graco snugride car seat on?', 'answer': "It's a two step fold - there's a beige button about mid-way down the handle on the left that you have to push and then you squeeze the larger black button on the top middle part of the handle. You push the handle towards the ground like you're going to touch your toes. I'm not sure about the car seat though. I'd imagine there's probably an adapter you'd need because there's nothing on the stroller itself that the car seat would clip to. I know the cup holder is a separate option too."}
