{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B0080D59Y6', 'answerTime': 'Mar 24, 2014', 'unixTime': 1395644400, 'question': 'How hard is this chair to fold? And when folded does it still take up a ton of space?', 'answer': "It doesn't really fold. The base swivels up FORWARD, which is a little hard to do, and that's it. So it keeps being bulky, and it won't stand by itself when folded. Also, there's no latch, so the base is loose in that position. We just have it standing all the time. Our 2 year old still uses it, though, and loves it."}
