{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B0080D59Y6', 'answerTime': 'Sep 2, 2014', 'unixTime': 1409641200, 'question': 'Do the wheels lock?', 'answerType': 'N', 'answer': 'No. I just checked mine and the wheels do not lock, but it stays steady when our son is seated in it. The bar across the back keeps it steady and prevents un intended movement.'}
{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B0080D59Y6', 'answerTime': 'Aug 15, 2014', 'unixTime': 1408086000, 'question': 'Does this fold flat?', 'answerType': '?', 'answer': "Not completely flat, and it folds in a very strange way. I wouldn't recommend this chair. It only lasted six months for us before it was too ruined to use.. Not at all easy to clean, by the way, unless you have the tidiest baby in the world."}
