{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B0080D59BO', 'answerTime': 'Dec 24, 2014', 'unixTime': 1419408000, 'question': 'What is the width of the straps? Is it 1-inch? 3/4-inch?', 'answer': 'They are definitely an inch, if not a bit wider. Straps are good, no problems at all with them the only notable and possible safety consideration is the toy tray insert. It is really great in that my godson loves it and plays with the toys mounted on it quite a bit he is however also quite strong and has, on a couple of occasions pulled the toy tray insert out of the tray. Love this chair but I keep an eye on him when the toy tray insert is in because when pulling it out he almoT hit himsel with it once. Just want you to be aware. Have had much great use of this chair though, also great for feeding.'}
