{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B0080D59BO', 'answerTime': 'May 3, 2014', 'unixTime': 1399100400, 'question': "What's the difference between this booster and the Fisher Price Healthy Care Deluxe Booster? It seems that they're the same except for the toy tray.", 'answer': "The only difference is the toy tray. I purchased one for Grandma and Grandpa's house and one for home and haven't had to purchase a highchair. My daughter is now over a year and a half and still using both. The toys were short lived, but they did entertain her for a bit. I definitely recommend either. They are great space savers!"}
