{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B00834D7CS', 'answerTime': 'Dec 27, 2013', 'unixTime': 1388131200, 'question': 'does this seat fit in a honda civic?', 'answerType': '?', 'answer': "I don't know if the seat fits in a honda civic. I'm temped to say yes. I have mine in an older style Subaru outback and forward facing my 29 inch tall baby can't kick my seat. I'm not sure what position you require forward or rear facing- I put mine in the center seat sometimes. Hope that helps!"}
