{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B00838BNK2', 'answerTime': 'Nov 20, 2014', 'unixTime': 1416470400, 'question': 'How big is it collapsed?', 'answer': 'Collapsed, it\'s 39"x19"x12", rounded up to the nearest inch. This would be the size of rectangular box that could hold it. In reality, it\'s deepest and widest at the end with the wheels. At the handle end, it tapers down to about 3"deep and only about 17" wide. To give an example, my car\'s tiny trunk has instructions and a diagram to help fit (cram) two golf bags inside, and this carrier fits in the trunk collapsed with a little room for small bags of groceries or toothpicks or something.'}
{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B00838BNK2', 'answerTime': 'Nov 1, 2013', 'unixTime': 1383289200, 'question': 'Will this snap and go fit with the Chicco&reg; KeyFit 30 Infant Car Seat?', 'answerType': '?', 'answer': 'CCons repts reviewer says it does not.'}
{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B00838BNK2', 'answerTime': '27 days ago', 'question': 'Will this fit the Nuna Pipa car seat? Thanks', 'answerType': 'Y', 'answer': 'It should because the seat doesnt click in to anything its a strap that goes around it and buckles sonim pretty sure it will &#128522;'}
{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B00838BNK2', 'answerTime': 'Apr 23, 2015', 'unixTime': 1429772400, 'question': 'Does the Baby Trend Single Snap-N-Go work with the Cybex Aton 2 or the Uppababy Mesa infant car seats? If so, how sturdy is the strapping mechanism?', 'answer': 'I have the Cybex Aton car seat and when I tried it with the Snap n Go EX I did not find the fit to be secure. The plastic underside of the carseat is very wobbly in the stroller frame, even with the straps underneath and across the top adjusted.'}
{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B00838BNK2', 'answerTime': 'Mar 11, 2014', 'unixTime': 1394521200, 'question': 'Can I use the peg perego primo viaggio sip car seat with this stroller?', 'answerType': 'Y', 'answer': 'Yes; I bought this for a recent trip and we used our Peg Perego Primo Viaggio 30/30 just fine. The big caveat with this (and it probably applies to all makes infant seats, not just the 30/30) is that the car seat doesn\'t "snap" in anywhere - rather, it rests "on" the frame (there\'s a strap to help secure it, but it\'s still not locked in in any way.) As such, the seat is always in more of a slight recline position than in an upright seated position (like it is in the base in a vehicle.) That said, it worked out great for our 2 month old, and got us comfortably all around the airports, Walt Disney World, shopping centers, etc. on our trip. I wouldn\'t go "off-roading" in it (since it\'s not "locked" into place), but it was definitely secure enough for our basic travel needs. It also folds up super easily.'}
{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B00838BNK2', 'answerTime': 'Jun 30, 2014', 'unixTime': 1404111600, 'question': 'Does it work with the graco click connect travel system car seat.?', 'answerType': '?', 'answer': "No...I wouldn't recommend it. I returned it"}
{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B00838BNK2', 'answerTime': 'Sep 28, 2013', 'unixTime': 1380351600, 'question': 'can i use this stroller with my britax b safe car seat??', 'answerType': '?', 'answer': "Just got this to use with my Britax B Safe...technically it works but it's not anywhere close to a perfect fit. We are using it for a trip across the country but would NOT use it for my everyday stroller."}
{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B00838BNK2', 'answerTime': 'Oct 19, 2013', 'unixTime': 1382166000, 'question': 'Does it work with bassinets or just car seats?', 'answer': "If you mean like a woven moses type basket no. The reason it works with the car seat is that the lower curved section of the seat drops down into the frame helping to secure that the car seat doesn't slide off the stroller frame. If you buckled a flat moses type basket onto the frame it would just slide off. Wouldn't recommend it for that."}
