{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B0084BEYYA', 'answerTime': 'Apr 2, 2013', 'unixTime': 1364886000, 'question': "When your iPhone or iPad shuts off how would you know the baby is crying if you can't constantly see and hear on the screen. Like if I was cleaning and not on the Internet, etc. Do you have to constantly turn back on or are there sound alerts if the...", 'answer': "The BabyPing app runs in the background and alerts you of any issues, so even if your iOS device's screen is off or you're in a different app you can monitor. If the Smart Filter is on you don't hear any background noises, just when the baby is making noise."}
{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B0084BEYYA', 'answerTime': 'Jan 8, 2014', 'unixTime': 1389168000, 'question': 'is there any plan for android app?', 'answerType': '?', 'answer': "Hello Vincente, BabyPing is designed to work with iOS devices and they have never announced any plans for Android compatibility. iOS has been a main focus since day one and I do not expect that to change. If you are interested in a similar product that works with Android I suggest AVTECH's Push Video products or Y-cam Cube, which is the same manufacturer as BabyPing. Thank you, Ashley Sales Support Team Network Camera Store"}
{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B0084DQFPE', 'answerTime': 'Mar 26, 2014', 'unixTime': 1395817200, 'question': 'What are the measurements of the individual shelves?', 'answer': 'The sizes vary. Top 2 shelves are 5"h x 10"w x 11"d (excluding the netting). The 3rd shelf down is split in half vertically, each 10"h x 5"w x 11"d. The bottom 3 shelves are 9-10"h x 10"w x 11"d.'}
{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B0084DQFPE', 'answerTime': 'Sep 13, 2013', 'unixTime': 1379055600, 'question': 'how much weight the shelves hold?', 'answer': "I returned mine after I saw that only the bottom shelf had a semi-sturdy hard surface. The others are just the cloth, papery material. I have a similar one and use it for clothes, maybe 3-4 shirts per shelf, and they all sag. Unless you are using this product for very light clothing or objects, or if you don't mind the sagging/pockets all the shelfs will eventually become, I would not recommend it."}
