{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B0084VBPHO', 'answerTime': 'Apr 9, 2014', 'unixTime': 1397026800, 'question': 'Does this seat recline?', 'answerType': '?', 'answer': 'negative. it is a hard plastic one piece frame designed for safety . It was rated above much more expensive seats for safety. Its padding is not as plush, but has worked very well for my 1 year old granddaughter. As a retired Deputy Sheriff, I have seen some very negative results of adults reclining their car seats and being involved in collisions. Except for rear facing infant seats I would be VERY cautious about having a child in a reclined seat.'}
