{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B008BGNT3A', 'answerTime': 'Oct 21, 2014', 'unixTime': 1413874800, 'question': 'Is the seat made of foam? Is it removable? (Trying to figure out whether there are flame retardants.) Thanks!', 'answer': 'It is removable, yes. The material is pretty tough and it\'s got foam in it. I just tore off the tag and looked, it says "All new material consisting of Polyurethane foam pad 50.5%, Polyester Fiber Batting: 49.5%". It does not mention flame retardant, only "Certification is made by the manufacturer that the materials in this article are described in accordance with law." Hope this helps.'}
