{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B008BGNT3A', 'answerTime': 'Mar 25, 2015', 'unixTime': 1427266800, 'question': 'Are the wheels removable so this walker can be brought into Canada legally?', 'answerType': '?', 'answer': "Not without a lot of effort. It would essentially mean taking it apart. They don't just pop off and on, unfortunately. The front wheels are casters that could be relatively simple; however the back wheels are integrated into the rear of the walker and the housing is fused to the upper portion. To remove them, you'd have to separate the top from the bottom, which renders it useless..."}
