{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B008C2YKWC', 'answerTime': 'Jul 10, 2014', 'unixTime': 1404975600, 'question': 'is this suitable for twins?', 'answerType': '?', 'answer': "it is suitable for twins, however you would not be able to use it as a cosleeper after a couple of months because of the weight limit, it is also narrow my L.O is 31/2 months and weights 14lbs she's tall 25 inches and I prob wont be able to use soon since her arm span is longer than the width and she is almost touching head to foot length wise. I would recommend it tho, I had a hard delivery and not having to climb OOB every hr for feedings diapering etc really helped me plus amazon gives the best price. check this out https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=pzGpJuSYRG0"}
