{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B008CJI7KQ', 'answerTime': 'Oct 29, 2013', 'unixTime': 1383030000, 'question': 'if i order 30pcs. today when will i receive it? i actually in an APO address and i need the stuff in the next 4weeks', 'answer': 'if you place the order today it will ship out in one business day. Shipping to the APO is approximately 7 business days, however, shipping time from APO addresses to your destination takes 4-5 weeks and no guarantee. We will provide you with tracking number for the US portion of the transit.'}
