{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B008G4LKJ2', 'answerTime': 'Apr 27, 2013', 'unixTime': 1367046000, 'question': 'Is the material waterproof?? Or can the child get wet using it in the rain without an umbrella??', 'answer': "It is pretty waterproof. It is thin and my son hasn't been in drenching rain with it but it is good as a light basic rain jacket."}
{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B008G4LKJ2', 'answerTime': 'Jul 25, 2013', 'unixTime': 1374735600, 'question': 'Will this rain coat fit a 5 year old boy?', 'answerType': 'Y', 'answer': 'I bought this rain coat for my 6 year old, he is almost 7 now (skinny though) and the coat still works and will be just fine for the next school year. My 3 year old wears is sometimes although it is a little too long for him. So, if your 5 year old is about average size it will fit just fine with some room to grow.'}
