{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B008OHWNOC', 'answerTime': 'Apr 30, 2015', 'unixTime': 1430377200, 'question': 'Will this chair fit the Carry On "Travelpro Expandable Business Plus Rollaboard" Luggage (size 20x14x9 inches) for international air travel? Thanks.', 'answerType': '?', 'answer': "I've had to Google the Travelpro, and I can't see why it wouldn't fit. As long as there is some rigidity in the case and the case is packed it should be fine. We use a very cheap handluggage case. I fill the case, nappies, spare clothes, to make sure the case doesn't collapse in on itself, not that it ever has!"}
