{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B008OHWNOC', 'answerTime': 'Aug 20, 2014', 'unixTime': 1408518000, 'question': 'Does the seat have straps for a baby/ toddler?', 'answerType': 'Y', 'answer': 'Yes. It has a little seat belt which we used when our boys were younger. After they have used the seat a few times they get the hang of it and it becomes unnecessary as they are leaning slightly back into the suitcase/chair assembly. We travel a lot with our kids and these things are the greatest travel accessory we have.'}
