{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B008RJF4PC', 'answerTime': 'Dec 11, 2013', 'unixTime': 1386748800, 'question': "Does this fit the new Avent Naturals bottles? The naturals top isn't the same size as the older version, I've been told.", 'answerType': '?', 'answer': "I have both the Avent Classic and Avent Natural bottles; the systems work quite well together - sippy cup spouts, breast pump, and sealing discs fit well on both systems. Avent Classic has an extra ring in the assembly (on top of the bottle directly, before doing the screw-top portion with the nipple), which the Naturals seems to have integrated into the bottle itself. While I've not used THIS specific sippy spout, I've found everything I've used on one system can fit on the other. Including nipples and the rings -- you're not *supposed* to mix and match the nipples and bottles, but you can."}
