{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B008U4MKU6', 'answerTime': 'May 15, 2014', 'unixTime': 1400137200, 'question': "Why don't you list all of the car seats that are compatible with this stroller??", 'answer': 'Check out this site for compatible car seats: http://www.babytrend.com/strollers_snap-n-go_sup_174_sup_/SG33100.html'}
{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B008U4MKU6', 'answerTime': 'Jan 2, 2014', 'unixTime': 1388649600, 'question': 'Do the Chicco Keyfit30 carseats actually snap into this stroller frame?', 'answerType': 'Y', 'answer': "Yes. I purchased the original Double Snap for my first set of twins and the Chicco car seats fit after a few adjustments. I currently have this version for my second set and they have made a ton of improvements so no alterations are needed! There isn't an actual snap...the car seat sits in the frame and there are straps to secure it. Two straps wrap around the base of the car seat and tighten, and two straps cross over the car seat under the seatbelt slot and snap together. Hope this helped!"}
{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B008U4MKU6', 'answerTime': 'Jul 15, 2013', 'unixTime': 1373871600, 'question': 'is the baby trend universal double snap n go stroller compatible with the graco snugride 30', 'answerType': 'Y', 'answer': 'I believe it is compatible with almost every infant car seat. The car seats just sit in the frame and there are straps to adjust how deep they sit. There are also straps that go where the seat belt would go. It also has a nice big basket, 2 cup holders & a place for keys & phones. I use it with Chicco seats and just love it.'}
{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B008U4MKU6', 'answerTime': 'Jan 7, 2014', 'unixTime': 1389081600, 'question': 'Does it fit a Graco Snugride 32', 'answerType': '?', 'answer': "It does, only it doesn't click like the single one i had. It kind of just hammocks on the straps under, but it still seems sturdy. At first I didn't like it cause it didn't click, but we once I figured it out that it doesn't need to, I became more comfortable with it."}
{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B008U4MKU6', 'answerTime': 'Aug 23, 2013', 'unixTime': 1377241200, 'question': 'Does anyone know it the Britax B-Safe car-seats fit to this stroller?', 'answer': 'They will not fit unless you remove the click n go pieces on the sides which would defeat the purpose. I tried it and the carriers are just too wide for this stroller frame.'}
{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B008U4MKU6', 'answerTime': 'Apr 9, 2013', 'unixTime': 1365490800, 'question': 'the max weight is 40 lbs? most infant car seats alone are about 15 lbs, so your twins can only weigh 5lbs apiece?', 'answer': 'Recommended max weight is 40lbs each or 80lbs total for the stroller.'}
