{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B008VQLPY0', 'answerTime': 'Jun 2, 2013', 'unixTime': 1370156400, 'question': 'Does it fit the Bob Revolution stroller?', 'answerType': 'Y', 'answer': "Have to say that we couldn't get it to fit. The model we were sent was actually defective and had two left side clips (but no right side). Beyond that the instructions were so atrocious that we opted to send it back. (Not even my mechanical engineer father was able to find a way to salvage it.) Theoretically, however, it should fit if you can get one with both the left & right side clips."}
