{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B008WNV4J8', 'answerTime': 'Feb 6, 2014', 'unixTime': 1391673600, 'question': 'Would this bag fit under an airplane seat as a carry-on? I am looking for a good bag to bring on the plane for a long flight.', 'answerType': 'Y', 'answer': "Yes it would. Although this bag didn't work for me as a diaper bag, I think it would be an excellent bag for a long flight."}
{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B008WNV4J8', 'answerTime': 'Oct 20, 2014', 'unixTime': 1413788400, 'question': "Is this bag big enough for twins? I'm debating between this and the duo double.", 'answerType': 'Y', 'answer': "I would definitely say yes. It has the 3 main compartments and they are so big. In the middle I keep lots of diapers a big wipe container and a can of formula. On the side pockets I put snack containers, puff containers and juices. Then, in the 3rd big pocket, I put changes of clothes, shoes, and medicines. I've even packed my own clothes in it overnight and still have plenty of room. There's even little hidden pockets and I can keep 2 bottles in each of the small edge side pockets. I don't even carry a purse anymore. I just keep my things in one pocket. Lol. I hope this helps. Sorry it's so long. Good luck with your babies."}
{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B008WNV4J8', 'answerTime': 'Sep 14, 2013', 'unixTime': 1379142000, 'question': 'Are the bottle pockets big enough for an insulated sippy cup to fit into?', 'answerType': 'Y', 'answer': "Yes they are big enough for that! They seem to be able to fit a lot in the side insulated pockets. I haven't had baby yet but have the bag packed for the hospital! I just tried to fit my 32oz water bottle and it fits with extra room for something else small as well!"}
{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B008WNV4J8', 'answerTime': 'Apr 28, 2015', 'unixTime': 1430204400, 'question': 'Honest opinions--is this huge to lug around in addition to several young kids? (Pregnant with twins; currently have 1, 3, 5 yo children))', 'answer': "If you are the type who carries around a lot it might be ok for you. For me it just seemed like a bag I'd use for a day where we would be out of the house all (more diapers than normal, extra clothes, etc) day as opposed to just our normal routine."}
