{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B008WNV4J8', 'answerTime': 'Feb 21, 2015', 'unixTime': 1424505600, 'question': 'Some people say that this bag is quite bulky when packed. Is it? And does things fall out the side pockets?', 'answer': "I love this bag! This bag is large with many pockets. It's benefit over other bags is you can fit a lot in it in an organized manner and still be able to reach in and get things. With my first child, we tried a more sleek bag with lots of compartments. It frustrated me. It could fit what I needed and I could get my hand in it. So yes, this bag is bulky but how can it not be. While it may be bulky, it is in a soft comfortable or way. I was concerned about the side pockets too. ... But I have not had anything fall out of them."}
