{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B008WNV52E', 'answerTime': 'May 2, 2014', 'unixTime': 1399014000, 'question': 'Will be a 1st time mom, I like the appearance of this bag, but am concerned that it is embarrassingly big.Should I start out w a smaller one? Which?', 'answer': "1 st time mom here (7 months of using). I have to say it is quite large, however I've used it mainly hanging on back of stroller. When I do carry it on my shoulder, it is a bit heavy...so I switch shoulders often. With all that said, I LOVE this bag. It fits everything and then some!! I'd rather have more than enough stuff with a large diaper bag than not enough!"}
