{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B008YL94PY', 'answerTime': 'Mar 19, 2014', 'unixTime': 1395212400, 'question': 'It says there are 6 positions. I see inward and outward facing, on the back and on the side. What are the other 2? Thanks!', 'answer': "Well, actually there's 5 (to my knowledge). Face in, face out, on hip, on back, and the cradle position for newborns. Unless your right hip and left hip count for 2 positions... LOL :D anyway, have had this carrier since my baby was 5 months and shes now 16 months. Most often use face out position... She's almost big enough for the piggyback position... Haven't tried that one yet. Me and my daughter absolutely love this carrier! Perfect support... Could wear my 23 pound baby for hours if I had to!"}
