{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B008YL94TA', 'answerTime': 'Dec 18, 2013', 'unixTime': 1387353600, 'question': 'How long are the waist and arm straps and are there any extenders? My husband is a bigger guy and im looking for a carrier we both can use.', 'answer': "I am a bigger gal (size 16 -18) and it fits around me with slack to spare. There is also a little elastic band that keeps the slack coiled up nicely so it doesn't dangle. I am not sure of the exact measurement on the waist or arms but my husband is tall an lanky and he can carry our 20mo toddler with no problem, while I can carry our 2 week old with ease. I had these same concerns and I absolutely LOVE this carrier. Wish I hadn't wasted money on all the others I bought previously! Hope this info helps :) good luck!"}
