{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B00914P9UW', 'answerTime': 'Mar 1, 2014', 'unixTime': 1393660800, 'question': 'Does this cover a single round outlet for an ac?', 'answerType': '?', 'answer': "I would say no, this wouldn't work for a round AC plug. In order for the cover protector to work properly there is a cover plate included in the package that has to replace your current cover plate. The special cover plate included has tracks that allow the protector to slide onto it. This special cover plate also screws in with one central screw. I don't think a round AC three-prong plug allows you to attach this special cover plate with the center screw. I hope that helps you some."}
