{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B0091HXG72', 'answerTime': 'Jul 14, 2014', 'unixTime': 1405321200, 'question': 'In the upright position, it the seat back completely straight (90 degree) or is there still a slight recline?', 'answer': "It's pretty straight up and down. I have not used the position with my 7 month old yet. We use the position where he's semi upright or all the way flat. I think the position your talking about is best for an older toddler, around 2 or 3 years old. At least for me, it's too vertical for an infant, but the other positions are great. We love this stroller! Very happy with our purchase and would buy one again in a heartbeat. I wish I knew about this when my oldest was a baby. I had 4 different strollers at one point and wasn't in love with any of them. Good luck and hope I helped with your question."}
