{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B0091UN3FE', 'answerTime': 'Apr 22, 2015', 'unixTime': 1429686000, 'question': 'What is the difference between this product and the $499.99 one? (See Juicepresso Cold Press Juicer with Easy Clean 3 in 1 Smart Extraction System..)', 'answer': "This one is old model has screw/mash screen/rotating brush three parts individually that is the same setting as many other brands. The new Juicepresso has three parts in one and higher power and slimmer shape, also easier to clean after use it. Honestly I found it's difficult to convince me the enhancement worth the huge price difference as fist timer , also I like the older straight shape better, so I bought the older model. So far I have good experience on it. It is not that perfect as some commercial shown in YouTube, but it is pretty good for me. The juice is naturally sweet and taste really good. And it's easy to clean. Only the mash screen needs extra time to brush it ( I believe the new model is the same), the other parts are easy to rinse. I only use it to juice the fruits, so far my is still up and running as new."}
