{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B0093NN15G', 'answerTime': 'Jul 3, 2014', 'unixTime': 1404370800, 'question': 'Is this stiffer like a lap pad or like a piece of cloth? Can a 3 mo old sleep straight on it (on his belly) or would it slide and bunch under him?', 'answer': "I use it as a changing pad. It is stiffer, but I think it would bunch up if your child try's to sleep on it and moves a lot like my daughter does. It works great as a take along changing pad! I got the froggy design so the baby also likes looking at it when they get older;)"}
