{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B00952P7PC', 'answerTime': 'Apr 22, 2014', 'unixTime': 1398150000, 'question': 'How do they hold up when washed in dishwasher - do the lids still fit after several washes, do they crack?', 'answerType': '?', 'answer': 'I have a daycare, so they get washed every day and they hold up extremely well! Mine have probably been washed upwards of 100 times a piece.'}
