{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B0097D4ZMU', 'answerTime': 'Mar 7, 2015', 'unixTime': 1425715200, 'question': 'Is this loud enough to drown out noises from our hotel suite? We will put our 2 yr old down for naps but the older kids will be in the other room.', 'answerType': '?', 'answer': "My one year old just used it at a hotel and my two year old, husband and I were up. He slept thru. He's a great sleeper tho. He did not sleep thru a tantrum however"}
