{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B0097F3YES', 'answerTime': 'Feb 21, 2014', 'unixTime': 1392969600, 'question': 'When can you hear the heartbeat of the child with this system? We tried another one and it didnt work at all. We are around 12-13wks.', 'answer': 'This Bellybuds are only Headphones for your baby, so that you can play some music on your ipod or iphone and your baby can listen to it...it is nOT a system for listening to your babys heartbeat. They are just headphones for the belly, babies love the music...i recommend playing them Rockabye baby lullabies from various artists! Good luck!!'}
