{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B009HPGA5I', 'answerTime': 'Jan 2, 2014', 'unixTime': 1388649600, 'question': "I see this can hold two infant car seats, but does the helix frame accommodate two toddler car seats? I'm having twins..", 'answer': "It fits two toddler seats, according to some videos I found, you can also attached the toddler carseat (that's a different seat) The infant seat is good until the baby is about 30lbs..... I don't think you will want to carry your toddler in the carseat to the stroller, that will be way to heavy for you"}
{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B009HPGA5I', 'answerTime': 'Aug 26, 2014', 'unixTime': 1409036400, 'question': 'I already have this frame but baby #2 has yet to come - how much of a pain is the assembly/disassembly with a second baby?', 'answer': 'Absolutely no problem- the handle (if you have to change that) should be like 10 minutes and a screwdriver, changeing the basket- 3 minutes and the second seat itself clicks onto the frame in 10 seconds.'}
