{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B009HPGA5I', 'answerTime': 'Dec 16, 2014', 'unixTime': 1418716800, 'question': "what's the different about the G2 frame and the G3 frame", 'answer': "Orbit Baby Double Helix is only in G2 even it's black like G3. You could buy G3 single stroller plus helix upgrade kit. This is from their website: G3 Stroller Base Fully compatible with all G2 products (as are all other G3 bases) Improved Handling: Feel the difference in push, made by many improvements in manufacturing and design. Improved Braking: Now includes linked flip-flop-friendly brakes. Hassle-free, no-pump tires:New tires have a 12-spoke hub, high-performance rubber outer tire, and cushy foam liner. Comes in 2 colors: Black and Grey. Storage options: Choose between Cargo Basket and Cargo Pod, and add Stroller Panniers. 2 cupholders 3-position handlebar: Same highest position as G2, but with fewer adjustment decisions. Simplified folding: No twist-grip lock, just twist and lift to fold. Front wheel connection: Front wheel forks stay in place more reliably with an improved connection system. Foam grips: By popular demand, plush foam grips replace the harder G2 handles. http://www.orbitbaby.com/g3-info/g3-compare/"}
{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B009IVKY7Q', 'answerTime': 'Jul 30, 2013', 'unixTime': 1375167600, 'question': 'Do I really need this system or can I just buy their 50 ct pouches and use a jumbo syringe to fill them?', 'answer': 'You can try a syringe. I tried one, ...as well as pastry bags, they mostly worked, but it took a TON longer and it was a much bigger mess. I hate having extra kitchen gadgets around, but when you are doing 20-30 packs at a time, I found this filling station made things go much more smoothly... I wanted to hate it. I love it.'}
