{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B009IX0J06', 'answerTime': 'Jan 3, 2014', 'unixTime': 1388736000, 'question': 'are these reusable or one-time only?', 'answer': 'The freezer sleeve, which is the white container shown in the image, are certainly reusable and durable. The individual pouches however, are not reusable.'}
{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B009IWNPXK', 'answerTime': 'Aug 12, 2013', 'unixTime': 1376290800, 'question': 'can you reuse the pouches', 'answerType': '?', 'answer': 'They are not designed to be reused. They are meant to be one-time-use and disposed of. You can clean them out if you want... But I would not. There is no real way to effectively dry them out due to the small opening. When we used them we just threw them away and it was still cheeper than the store bought ones. I hope that this helps.'}
{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B009IWNPXK', 'answerTime': 'Feb 13, 2014', 'unixTime': 1392278400, 'question': "Are these BPA Free? I don't see that listed anywhere like I usually do on this type of item.", 'answerType': '?', 'answer': 'BPA, PVC, and Phthalate Free.'}
{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B009IWNPXK', 'answerTime': 'Aug 19, 2013', 'unixTime': 1376895600, 'question': 'can you freeze the pouches', 'answerType': 'Y', 'answer': 'Yes you can! They work great in the freezer. Just defrost in hot water or fridge overnight. They cannot be microwaved.'}
