{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B009K8NFG4', 'answerTime': 'Jun 19, 2014', 'unixTime': 1403161200, 'question': "Does this fit an oval-like toliet? Does it wiggle while sitting on it or getting on/off? I'm between this and babybjorn toliet trainer.", 'answer': "It does for the enlongated toilet seat and it does not wiggle or move. My daughter likes it, as it's comfortable, but I wish the hole was a bit larger. I've read great reviews on the bjorn trainer. The other one we have for our other bathroom is the Oxo tot potty seat, which I like a bit better than the dream baby. It's cheaper than the bjorn, fits an elongated toilet and doesn't move. Also stands up on the floor when not being used by my daughter. It's not foam though, it plastic like the bjorn, but so far no complaints from my daughter. Plus the handles are nice for her to hold onto."}
