{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B009M8P2CW', 'answerTime': 'Oct 15, 2013', 'unixTime': 1381820400, 'question': 'Adding a 2nd camera. Everytime I "pair" the 2nd camera the first becomes "unpaired". You have to manually press the button on the camera to work?', 'answer': 'You should not have to pair the cameras separately all that often, let alone ever more than once. Many times users get the menu interface confused where they will go to the pairing option rather than the scanning option, in which case it can almost seem like you have to pair the cameras every time. Be sure to make it to the scanning mode rather than the pairing mode, as the menu images do seem a bit similar.'}
