{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B009M8P2CW', 'answerTime': 'Sep 19, 2013', 'unixTime': 1379574000, 'question': 'Can this monitor also be used as a motion detector? I would like to be able to turn the sound off and only use a motion alert. (Elderly patient.)', 'answerType': 'N', 'answer': 'No it cant. It is only affected by sound. If the baby does not make any sound it will not show any image on Sleep mode. You can turn the sound off and keep the image on forever (turn off the "sleep" mode). But it doesnt have the feature to turn on only when a motion happens in front of it.'}
