{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B009RPH71Y', 'answerTime': 'Dec 23, 2014', 'unixTime': 1419321600, 'question': 'Will this fit the Evenflo Portable BabySuite Deluxe Playard?', 'answerType': '?', 'answer': "Personally I feel that the Dream On Me Evenflo Baby Suite Selection 300 Foam Mattress with Square Corner (http://www.amazon.com/gp/product/B009RPH72I/ref=od_aui_detailpages00?ie=UTF8&psc=1) is a better fit, even though its not as firm. As another reviewer mentioned, the mattress is a bit narrower than the Evenflo Portable Baby Suite, there are some noticeable gaps, not HUGE gaps, but definitely doesn't fit as snug as the other mattress I mentioned."}
