{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B009RPH714', 'answerTime': 'Apr 14, 2014', 'unixTime': 1397458800, 'question': 'Do you use the mattress pad that comes with the Graco Travel Lite Crib and put this on top of it or do you just use this mattress to replace it?', 'answer': "The instructions say not to use an extra mattress while in the bassinet mode due to suffocation hazards. We use the extra mattress in the play yard mode. The Travel Lite mattress becomes the bottom of the play yard and then the mattress just sits on top of that. It's been perfect for both afternoon naps and regular sleep during late evenings at the office."}
{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B009RPH714', 'answerTime': 'Nov 3, 2014', 'unixTime': 1415001600, 'question': "Graco Travel Lite Crib's instructions state to NEVER add another mattress in bassinet mode (Step 1) so do you ONLY use this mattress for Steps 2 &amp; 3?", 'answer': 'They have to state that for liability reasons. I used this in the bassinet mode before my daughter was rolling over with no problem. Obviously if your child is mobile/rolling it would no longer be safe to use it with the bassinet, but it worked just fine for my newborn.'}
