{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B009S1DWP2', 'answerTime': 'Oct 9, 2013', 'unixTime': 1381302000, 'question': 'What type of fabric is more suitable for such a climate as South Florida?', 'answer': 'We have the grey R120 and we live in southern georgia. It is fine for my 3 year old who is still rear facing. Since the sides are low profile it lets the air circulate better than the seats with the higher or rounded sides.'}
