{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B009S1DWOS', 'answerTime': 'Mar 11, 2014', 'unixTime': 1394521200, 'question': 'Would three of these fit in the back of a 2014 Subaru Forester? With one being rear-facing? Thanks!', 'answer': "Hello, I don't know the inside dimensions of a Forester, but we are able to fit 2 facing back and one facing forward in a 2014 Civic Sedan (rear facing near the doors). We are also able to re-configure to all 3 facing forward as well. You might want to check the Honda website or go to your local Honda dealer to compare with your Subaru Forester (visually is a better confirmation than looking at dimensions in a website is our experience). Note that the 3 facing forward is a tight fit, where getting the seats installed will require strong fingers and hands..."}
