{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B009SYWJNA', 'answerTime': 'Jun 3, 2014', 'unixTime': 1401778800, 'question': 'What are the 7 CD choices?', 'answer': "There are a variety of CD types. Three of them are Fun Bouncy. Two of them are Lullaby Music (one Christian and one not). We also have a Christian CD that sings some of the old standards. And we have a Happy Birthday Party CD. Each album has 8 or 9 tracks and all of the songs are personalized with the child's name in the songs. You will be able to listen to samples of each of the songs with your child's name in the sample before selecting which album you want. Once you select an album and enter the code in your kit you instantly have access to the music. Brian - Friendly Songs Brand Manager"}
{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B009SYWJNA', 'answerTime': 'Dec 2, 2014', 'unixTime': 1417507200, 'question': 'Would a 7 year old enjoy the Everyday Fun songs or is this more appropriate for younger children?', 'answer': 'I bought them for my six month old granddaughter last year. She still loves it this year. I think 7 is on the cusp for these CDs. I also bought a personalized CD sang by Mickey Mouse last year for an older boy and he really enjoyed it. These CDs are a good option for the younger crowd, but he liked singing with Mickey and the gang. If your son is into Disney I would check them out at www.centerstagepersonalizedgifts.com. They also have cute personalized books. My grandkids love to see their names in everything!'}
{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B009SYWJNA', 'answerTime': 'Oct 28, 2013', 'unixTime': 1382943600, 'question': 'how do you personalize it?', 'answer': "Hey Cynthia, Everything you need to get the personalized name in the CD will be included in the kit you receive from us through Amazon so Amazon does not need to collect the personalization information at time of your order. We collect that information when you use your kit. Once you get your kit it will tell you how to start to personalize your CD. 1. You just Search for your child's name 2. Under the possible name matches click on the pronunciation that matches the name 3. Listen to samples from each of the albums that are available 4. Select the album you want 5. Then download your CD It's easy and fun to do. If the child is available you can even include them in the process of selecting which album they want. Friendly Songs Customer Service"}
{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B009SYWJNA', 'answerTime': '3 days ago', 'question': 'Is the name Parker and Paisley available?', 'answerType': 'Y', 'answer': "Hello Grandpa, Thank you for interest in a My Friendly Songs Personalized CD Kit from us through Amazon. Yes, with now nearly 14,000 names the names Parker and Paisley are already available. And even if they were not already available, we can record any custom names within just a few days for you. Everything you need to get the personalized name in the CD will be included in the kit you receive from us through Amazon so Amazon does not need to collect the personalization information at time of your order. We collect that information when you use your kit. Once you get your kit it will tell you how to start. 1. After going to www.MyFriendlySongs.com you then just Search for your child's name 2. Under the possible name matches click on the pronunciation that matches your child's name 3. Listen to samples from each of the albums that are available 4. Select the album you want 5. Create an account 6. Continue to check out and enter your download card number that is in your kit 7. Then download your CD It's easy and fun to do. If the child is available you can even include them in the process of selecting which album they want. If you have any questions feel free to call us at 803-485-1544. Sincerely, Brian Friendly Songs Customer Service"}
{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B009SYWJNA', 'answerTime': 'Jan 5, 2015', 'unixTime': 1420444800, 'question': 'Can you add the name Tyson to the songs', 'answerType': '?', 'answer': "Janelle, Yes, Tyson is already available in all the albums. Here's an easy way to see which names are available by clicking here and doing a quick search: http://www.personalizedfriendlysongs.com/ Everything you need to get the personalized name in the CD will be included in the kit you receive from us through Amazon so Amazon does not need to collect the personalization information at time of your order. We collect that information when you use your kit. Once you get your kit it will tell you how to start. 1. You then just Search for your child's name 2. Under the possible name matches click on the pronunciation that matches the name 3. Listen to samples from each of the albums that are available 4. Select the album you want 5. Create an account 6. Continue to check out and enter your download card number that is in your kit 7. Then download your CD It's easy and fun to do. You can even include Tyson in the process of selecting which album they want. If you have any questions feel free to call us at 803-485-1544. Sincerely, Brian Friendly Songs Customer Service"}
{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B009SYWJNA', 'answerTime': 'Sep 15, 2014', 'unixTime': 1410764400, 'question': "I have nieces with crazy names. I'm worried they wont be able to find them. Lilith &amp; London available??", 'answer': "Richele, Yes, the name London is already available in all of our music albums. You have 7 albums to choose from and each kit can make one album for one name. The name Lilith isn't currently ready for immediate download but ANY NAME can be added at any time if you use one of these kits. There is no additional costs but it does take 2 to 4 days for the studio to record the name and then you can download the music to your CD or device. To check the pronunciation you can listen to samples at www.FriendlySongs.mobi We have over 13,000 names already recorded and, as previously noted, we can do custom names if a name isn't available in 2-4 business days if a name is needed that we don't already have. Just follow the directions provided in the package to get either the standard name (immediate download) or custom name. If you have any questions feel free to call our office at 803-485-1544 for further assistance. Brian - Friendly Songs Brand Manager"}
{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B009SYWJNA', 'answerTime': 'Aug 9, 2014', 'unixTime': 1407567600, 'question': 'My grandchild has a Japanese name. Are all names included in the 13,000 American?', 'answerType': '?', 'answer': "Jacky, The music is sung in English but many of the names are not necessarily American names since we've done many names for children of many other cultures. You have 7 albums to choose from and each kit can make one album for one name. To check the pronunciation you can listen to samples at www.FriendlySongs.mobi But if the name you are looking for isn't among the names already recorded, then we can do a custom name for you if a name isn't available. So if the name you need isn't in our system, and we don't have the correct pronunciation, then we can record the correct one for you. It just takes a few extra days to do a custom name and it doesn't cost anything extra. That process happens after you get the kit from Amazon and go on our site to fulfill it. Brian - Friendly Songs Brand Manager"}
{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B009SYWJNA', 'answerTime': 'Jul 6, 2014', 'unixTime': 1404630000, 'question': 'Hi, can you confirm you have Maile (prounounced mai - le, similary to miley)? Thanks!', 'answer': "May, Yes, the name Maile (Mye-Lee) is available in all of our music albums. You have 7 albums to choose from and each kit can make one album for one name. To check the pronunciation you can listen to samples at www.FriendlySongs.mobi We also have over 13,000 names already recorded and we can even do custom names if a name isn't available. So if that name isn't the correct pronunciation, and we don't have the correct pronunciation currently, then we can record the correct one for you. It just takes a few extra days to do a custom name and it doesn't cost anything extra. Brian - Friendly Songs Brand Manager"}
{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B009SYWJNA', 'answerTime': 'Apr 29, 2014', 'unixTime': 1398754800, 'question': 'is the name Judy avilable ??', 'answerType': 'Y', 'answer': "Basil, Yes, the name Judy is available in all of our music albums. You have 7 albums to choose from and each kit can make one album for one name. Besides Judy, we also have over 13,000 names already recorded and we can even do custom names if a name isn't available. Brian - Friendly Songs Brand Manager"}
{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B009SYWJNA', 'answerTime': 'Apr 1, 2014', 'unixTime': 1396335600, 'question': 'Can you make more than one copy from each kit? Can you change the name?', 'answer': "Johnna, each kit makes one CD for a child. You can hear the name in the music before you decide which album you want to make and you can change the name or album until you are happy with your selection. But once you complete the process by using the code each kit has the name or album can't be changed. Friendly Songs Customer Service"}
