{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B009UGYOZ2', 'answerTime': 'Jul 28, 2014', 'unixTime': 1406530800, 'question': 'I live in Florida. It seems to only come in Black. Is it breathable? How hot will baby get in it...?', 'answer': "I don't live in Florida, but did use this over the hot weekend at SD Safari Zoo while it was 90F, and baby was fine in it comfortably. There wasn't excessive sweating, but I did also used a stroller canopy extension and that could have helped reduced the temperature."}
