{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B009UO3GJ4', 'answerTime': 'Apr 7, 2014', 'unixTime': 1396854000, 'question': 'What is the minimum size and weight for a baby for this stroller?', 'answer': "I would check with the manufacturer for specifics. We bought it for our 2 year old who is 27lbs and 3 ft tall. He fits in it pretty perfectly (he's on the skinny side for his age). If he was any shorter his feet probably wouldn't reach the foot rest though."}
