{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B009UPUC36', 'answerTime': 'Dec 5, 2013', 'unixTime': 1386230400, 'question': 'Can the timer function be turned off so the night light stays on for extended periods of time?', 'answerType': 'Y', 'answer': "I doubt it. This is a pretty low-tech device with only one button. By the time I bought it, my son was old enough (2.5) to press the button if the light turned itself off before he was done. I will say that it's lasted a year of nightly use on the same battery, so that's something!"}
