{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B009UPUC36', 'answerTime': 'Mar 7, 2014', 'unixTime': 1394179200, 'question': 'My toddler likes a light on to read by. Is this bright enough for her to view her books while in bed?', 'answerType': 'Y', 'answer': "I actually wasn't sure so I took a book and the nightlight in to the closet and yes, when it's held up closer to the book, it is bright enough. My kids (4 and 3) LOVE this nightlight! It does turn off on it's own after 15 or so minutes I believe. It's really light and pretty durable, we have had these lights for a while now and haven't had to change the battery yet either."}
