{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B009VARM42', 'answerTime': 'Nov 29, 2013', 'unixTime': 1385712000, 'question': "Would anyone recommend this stroller for a tall 18month old? My daughter is already 32 inches and 25 lbs. I'd like one that she won't outgrow soon?", 'answer': 'My two and a half year old son who is very tall for his age (90th percentile) is still fitting in fine, but I suspect he will outgrow it in not too distant future. It really is an amazing buggy though and we sure will be using when we have our next one.'}
