{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B009VXPQRE', 'answerTime': 'Jan 10, 2014', 'unixTime': 1389340800, 'question': 'Does this mattress have an untreated wood board in it and also glue? Any toxins leaking from this mattress?', 'answer': 'The organic mattress does not have wood board in it. If you purchase the Clear Vue Co-sleeper, it comes with a thin mattress. You can purchase the organic mattress and swap it. The board is part of the frame of the co-sleeper. The organic mattress is a soft mattress. It is MUCH better than the plastic, thin, terrible mattress that comes with the co-sleeper. I am so glad we purchased the organic mattress.'}
