{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B009VXPQRE', 'answerTime': 'May 19, 2014', 'unixTime': 1400482800, 'question': 'How does this differ from the Arms Reach Concepts Inc. Mini Organic Mattress? My father is building me a cosleeper, can I use this as the mattress?', 'answer': 'According to ArmsReach.com, this Clear-Vue Co-Sleeper Organic Mattress measures 17.5" x 31" x 1", it doesn\'t have a wooded support board, and fits Clear-Vue, Angelica, Santa Barbara Toffee, and Cambria models. The Mini Organic Mattress measures 18.75" x 31.75" x 1.5", has a wooden support board, and fits the Mini, Mini Classic, Mini Convertible, Euro Mini and Curved Mini Arm\'s Reach models. There is no way for anyone on Amazon to tell you if these mattresses would fit a custom co-sleeper that your father is building from scratch! You should ask him what dimensions he needs and if he is including any mattress support in his design.'}
