{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B009X4C796', 'answerTime': 'Jun 26, 2013', 'unixTime': 1372230000, 'question': 'Does this Pria 70 recline? 5 positions? Thanks', 'answer': 'Hi Camila, I was very disappointed to find out that "it doesn\'t" the way the prior models do, which as you may know, you just pull the handle between the child\'s fit and adjust, that easy... this model has 3 different positions but you can only change it by removing the carseat from the seat, adjusting the new position pulling a lever from the bottom back of the carseat and then installing it again, witch is very disappointing to me, I have 4 children (always have bought Maxi-Cosi) and that was the main thing I loved about this car seats.. the child is asleep, pull and change position, the child woke up, pull and seat him/her up again, sadly doesn\'t work like that with this one.'}
