{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B00A0H1BEC', 'answerTime': 'Oct 24, 2014', 'unixTime': 1414134000, 'question': 'Do you need to order separate straps for using with a toddler carseat? We have one of the large Britax models. Thanks.', 'answerType': 'Y', 'answer': "I don't think so? I used it with a peg perego convertible carseat and it worked fine. If I remember correctly, the straps follow the same path that you would use if you used the seatbelt installation options."}
{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B00A0H1BEC', 'answerTime': 'Feb 9, 2015', 'unixTime': 1423468800, 'question': 'will it work with the uppababy mesa infant car seat?', 'answerType': 'Y', 'answer': 'I have found it works with pretty much everything. The good/bad thing about this is that they provide a variety of straps/buckles in different styles so that it can accommodate any size/style. I have used it with a Chicco infant seat & base, a graco smart ride, and a friend of mine used it with hers which was a britax.'}
