{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B00A2HUFG0', 'answerTime': 'Oct 11, 2013', 'unixTime': 1381474800, 'question': 'When was this car seat manufactured-year and date PLEASE?', 'answer': 'The seat you order will be different from any previously ordered. The manufacture date will be printed on the seat and on the paperwork that comes with it. I ordered my seat in August and it had been manufactured in May of this year.'}
