{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B00A2HUH04', 'answerTime': 'Oct 6, 2013', 'unixTime': 1381042800, 'question': 'can this chair use by new born baby?', 'answerType': 'Y', 'answer': 'Yes, it fits a child from 5lbs up to 40lbs rear-facing; then up to 70lbs forward-facing.'}
{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B00A2HUH04', 'answerTime': 'Jul 10, 2013', 'unixTime': 1373439600, 'question': 'How ideal is this seat for a tall child with long legs?', 'answer': 'Depends on how long you want to keep him facing backwards, but I\'m not sure what seat you have matters for that. My boy is about 34" tall right now and his legs are a little scrunched up, but he\'s still good for long trips. If you are going for forward facing, you\'ll need a Suburban to get away from the kicking in the back of your front seat, but that has more to do with the car than the car seat. Basically, your car makes a lot more difference with the legs than the car seat. I can\'t imagine that this seat would give a long-legged child any trouble.'}
{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B00A2HUH04', 'answerTime': 'Dec 22, 2014', 'unixTime': 1419235200, 'question': 'My chest pads have recently broken after having this carseat for less than 2 years.Is there any possible way to replace the chest pads this carseat?', 'answerType': '?', 'answer': "Britax sent me new HUGs pads free. They came via two day shipping. Just call or email customer service. They're really nice. Make sure to write down the info from the sticker on your carseat. There are several versions of chest pads."}
{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B00A2HUH04', 'answerTime': 'Nov 26, 2013', 'unixTime': 1385452800, 'question': "what's the difference between the color onyx and the color anna? Why the weight of onyx is 21.6 pounds, but the anna is 25 pounds?", 'answer': 'The Onyx is a small black and white print and the Anna is a brown/pink floral print. I have no idea why there is a difference unless it has something to do with the print on the Anna having more ink or thread. The different covers have no effect on the safety of the seat though!'}
