{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B00A2HUH72', 'answerTime': 'Oct 14, 2013', 'unixTime': 1381734000, 'question': 'What is the max height? If anyone knows it, I would really like to know the max height rear facing and max height forward facing. Thanks!', 'answer': 'Hi Nicole, On the Britax website (http://www.britaxusa.com/car-seats/boulevard-70-g3) it says that the max height for both rear and front is 49 inches. They recommend your child be rear facing until the age of 2. Hope this helps!'}
