{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B00A2HUH72', 'answerTime': 'Jul 8, 2013', 'unixTime': 1373266800, 'question': 'I just bought this car seat, I plan to use it rear facing in a 2012 Honda CRV. Is the top tether easy to use rear facing?, I find the instructions a bit confusing, I have not started to install yet, just reading the manual first. Any comments?', 'answer': "I haven't used the top tether rear-facing basically because the anchor is behind the seat, meaning the tether would end up over the seat itself making it hard to put the child into the seat. If the anchor is on the floor than that would make it easier to use but I don't think your car has that."}
