{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B00A2HUGXC', 'answerTime': 'Sep 11, 2013', 'unixTime': 1378882800, 'question': "Is the serene teal or blue? It looks teal until you magnify the swatch, then is looks more blue. Wondering if it's too girly for my son....", 'answer': 'I saw it in the store today, it is more teal in my opinion, and I think would be considered a unisex print. The patterned material also comes out more laterally than the onyx cover, and this seems to be a higher quality fabric compared to the black portion of onyx which was pilled in the store sample. This is my favorite pattern, but I just bought a black-interior car so will probably go with something else.'}
