{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B00A2HUFBU', 'answerTime': 'Dec 10, 2013', 'unixTime': 1386662400, 'question': 'Where can we purchase extra bases for this car seat?', 'answer': 'This car seat is one piece. There is no separate base. So, unlike the infant seat which you can move from car to car as long as you have additional bases, you would have to move this car seat each time you switch cars...which can be tedious depending on how you strap it into your car. It was impractical for us to do this so we had to purchase two (a pavilion and a marathon), one for each car.'}
{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B00A2HUGYQ', 'answerTime': 'Dec 16, 2013', 'unixTime': 1387180800, 'question': 'Has anyone installed this in a smaller auto? I have a 4 door jeep wrangler so am a bit limited on space in the back seat.', 'answerType': 'Y', 'answer': "It fits fairly well. We've had it in my husband's Ford Focus (forward facing) and it fits. You might have to move the front seat up a little, but it will fit. It does take up more room rear facing because it has to be reclined farther, but it should fit."}
