{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B00A2HUGYQ', 'answerTime': 'Oct 28, 2013', 'unixTime': 1382943600, 'question': 'My child is 8 1/2 months and she has no leg room in the seat when I installed this car sect rear-facing. Can you let me know how I can resolve this?', 'answer': "A couple of things that I thought of: Is the seat in recline position 3? Have you removed the infant body pillow? (It's not needed if your child can sit without support.) If it helps, it looks like you can adjust the angle of the car seat in position 3, the manual talks about this on page 20. Good luck!"}
