{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B00A2HUF9M', 'answerTime': 'Mar 29, 2014', 'unixTime': 1396076400, 'question': 'is the material hot to sit in', 'answerType': '?', 'answer': "It's only spring so far but my child has sat in the seat for hours in jeans a tshirt and a fleece jacket and he wasn't sweating as much as he did in his infant seat.... Hope that helps answer your question"}
{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B00A2HUF9M', 'answerTime': 'Dec 30, 2013', 'unixTime': 1388390400, 'question': "Does anyone else find that the velcro on the straps scratches their child's arm/hands when strapped in? Any suggestions if so?", 'answer': "My son never had that problem with this car seat. The Velcro on the straps is the soft side of the Velcro, but if it's a problem, you could probably put thin shoulder straps over it."}
