{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B00A2HUFBK', 'answerTime': 'Dec 10, 2013', 'unixTime': 1386662400, 'question': 'Where can we purchase extra bases for this car seat?', 'answer': 'This car seat is one piece. There is no separate base. So, unlike the infant seat which you can move from car to car as long as you have additional bases, you would have to move this car seat each time you switch cars...which can be tedious depending on how you strap it into your car. It was impractical for us to do this so we had to purchase two (a pavilion and a marathon), one for each car.'}
