{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B00A3XNUQA', 'answerTime': 'Apr 17, 2014', 'unixTime': 1397718000, 'question': 'Is this product dual voltage?', 'answerType': '?', 'answer': 'No but I use a step up converter (something like this http://www.amazon.com/Goldsource-STU-750-Voltage-Transformer-Converter/dp/B0022TL1BE). Using for 20-30 min here and there with a converter should be ok but prolonged use on a different voltage over time (or using it for multiple hours at once) might decrease its lifespan. Have had mine for ~1yr.'}
