{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B00A5AZ1UE', 'answerTime': 'Nov 27, 2013', 'unixTime': 1385539200, 'question': 'Is this the 2013 model? Can it be fitted to the BJ Compact Newborn Pram? Thanks', 'answer': "Yes, it's the 2013 model. I'm not sure about the fit of the newborn pram, as I purchased this for my son when he was 1.5 yrs old. I love it! Do not reqret my purchase at all."}
{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B00A5B319Q', 'answerTime': 'Nov 4, 2013', 'unixTime': 1383552000, 'question': "Help! What's max height in inches a child be to sit without head losing support? Seats independent? Thnx!", 'answer': 'Hi - not sure on the max height as I have twin infants who are laying back flat. The seats ARE independent though. Hope that helps at least a little!'}
{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B00A5B319Q', 'answerTime': 'Aug 16, 2014', 'unixTime': 1408172400, 'question': 'Can someone answer whether the seats on this one will allow the kids to sit up if they wanted to compare to the City Mini Double or GT Double? Some articles says that joggers typically recline more than normal strollers so I want to confirm if kids can...', 'answer': 'They sit about the same as the BOB Revolution. My petite 9 year old can sit on the foot rest and her feet dangle and she is comfortable. This was a plus for me as I have 3 kids and another on the way. My friend has the BOB sport and the Summit has so many more features that she wishes she had.'}
{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B00A5B319Q', 'answerTime': 'May 23, 2014', 'unixTime': 1400828400, 'question': 'What is the gross weight?', 'answer': "about 30 lbs. its super agile and easy to fold up. my Wife loves it. it's a piece of cake for her. we have the single version of this and this double is way easier to turn and go up curbs. it rocks. get it. if you have tall kids it will out last the Bob because it has more head room. high quality and durable. plenty of storage. it's worth the investment."}
{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B00A5B319Q', 'answerTime': 'Dec 30, 2014', 'unixTime': 1419926400, 'question': 'Can you put the infant seat attachment on this stroller?', 'answerType': 'N', 'answer': 'No. I called customer service (in Nov. 2014) to ask and I was told they do not currently have an infant attachment for the double but one may come out in the future. The representative also told me the stroller is suitable for use from birth as the seats recline quite far.'}
{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B00A5B319Q', 'answerTime': '3 days ago', 'question': 'is green color different from 2014?', 'answerType': '?', 'answer': "I haven't seen the two side by side yet, but the 2013 green is a little more on the sage side, whereas the 2014 looks more kelly green"}
{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B00A5B319Q', 'answerTime': 'Feb 21, 2015', 'unixTime': 1424505600, 'question': 'What is the difference between this prior model and a new model?', 'answer': "We have this stroller and love it. Looked up the 2015 model manual and I'm not seeing anything different from the one we have. The websites I checked said the straps where updated and it has a new logo."}
