{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B00A5AWV48', 'answerTime': 'Jun 25, 2014', 'unixTime': 1403679600, 'question': 'Is this the 2013 model? Can anyone tell me the difference between the 2013 and 2014 models?', 'answer': 'I read the harness has changed, folks said not for the better, and apparently you can lock the front wheel turned in or out as opposed to only out with the old model, apparently that matters for hardcore joggers.'}
