{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B00A5AWV48', 'answerTime': 'Jun 22, 2014', 'unixTime': 1403420400, 'question': 'Can a toddler sit on the foot area if there is a baby in the stroller? Obviously not for going for a walk. I see people doing this w the Bob.', 'answerType': '?', 'answer': "There is room for it but the front wheel has a shock in it and a bigger kid can compress the footwell into the wheel if they sit there. So it is not as versatile as the bob in that way. We used to have a bob and I was used to doing that with the bob, tried it with this stroller initially but I don't think it's good for the stroller. :-( It beats the bob in a lot of other ways, though"}
{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B00A5AWV48', 'answerTime': 'Dec 3, 2014', 'unixTime': 1417593600, 'question': "Why does it not state handle height, isnt that the most important detail, for comfort in jogging? Is it adjustable, what if taller than 6'2?", 'answer': 'Hi, I just measured ours. The handle height is 40". And, no, it isn\'t adjustable. I\'m guessing it will be comfortable for you. Though, to be sure, maybe you should go to a store, adjust a random jogger\'s height, and see what it feels like at 40". We absolutely love this jogger. It does so much more than at least 90% of the jogging strollers out there. For something we will use often for the next 3 years, it\'s worth the cost. Hope this helps.'}
{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B00A5AWV48', 'answerTime': 'Oct 29, 2014', 'unixTime': 1414566000, 'question': 'I am wondering about the shade of orange? Is it more red or brown?', 'answer': 'It is a burnt orange/red. Nice color and definitely not brown. This is an excellent stroller. We have 2 baby jogger strollers; one for jogging and one for everything else! Love it!'}
{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B00A5AWV48', 'answerTime': 'Sep 6, 2014', 'unixTime': 1409986800, 'question': 'does it have a lever on the side of the stroller to control lock or unlock front wheel.', 'answer': 'Yes, on the right side.'}
