{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B00A67C5XC', 'answerTime': 'Oct 21, 2014', 'unixTime': 1413874800, 'question': 'Is there any head padding or cushion that is not shown in the picture?', 'answer': "No, there is not. My son is 11 months and we bought this for his sitter and grandmother to have in their cars. It serves it's purpose for quick trips around town for them, but I would not buy it for a child smaller than 6 months as there is no head support or cushion. It is very basic but has a good safety rating. For our family car my son has a much nicer Graco. It came with several head cushion options to add or subtract to the seat. On that note, the Graco takes up a lot of space in my Envoy. This car seat is smaller and fits in my husbands extended cab truck that only has a bench seat."}
