{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B00A72MXMO', 'answerTime': 'Apr 29, 2014', 'unixTime': 1398754800, 'question': 'Is it stable if the car seat is attached and the older child is not seated up front?', 'answer': 'Hi Julia, yes, it is very stable if you only have the car seat attached. The distance between the front and back wheels provides a stable base. We are happy with the stroller, it is not perfect, but a good deal for the overall price and has held up well with a decent amount of use. It is also pretty versatile with all the seating positions (and standing position). Good luck!'}
{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B00A72MXMO', 'answerTime': 'May 31, 2014', 'unixTime': 1401519600, 'question': 'what are the dimensions when it is all folded up? I see the product dimensions but I am not sure that when it is fully assembled', 'answer': 'Folded standing straight up wheels on ground. 41" tall, 24" wide cup holder to cup holder and 26" depth. Dimensions are very close but it is too oddly shaped to be perfectly accurate. It fits in both my cars trunks fine, however not much room for anything else.'}
