{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B00A8EZOIQ', 'answerTime': 'Feb 24, 2014', 'unixTime': 1393228800, 'question': "In the facing forward position, can a toddler nap without their head flopping forward? I'd like a seat in which they can sleep comfortably. Thanks.", 'answerType': '?', 'answer': 'My daughter is three now and never seen her head flop forward while sleeping. Side to side, yes, but not forward. There is ample reclining angle for the seat. I believe there is one level adjustment to recline it further, but, it is not too significant. Your car seat might be a factor too and removing some of the pads will help also. Highly recommend this seat. It is FAA approved for airplane flight to.'}
