{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B00A8EZOKE', 'answerTime': 'Mar 24, 2014', 'unixTime': 1395644400, 'question': 'What type of FABRIC is used in these models? Perhaps different patterns have different fabrics? Is is comfortable/hot/scratchy?', 'answer': "Having never sat in it personally, I can't say whether or not it's comfortable, but my kids don't seem to mind it at all. We have two different patterns of this car seat, and both appear to be the same fabric type. We live in a very hot and humid climate, and I was concerned they would heat up, but so far we haven't had any problems that way. The fabric is smooth and they seem to like it. Even on the hottest days their legs don't seem to stick or anything."}
{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B00A8EZOKE', 'answerTime': 'Aug 26, 2013', 'unixTime': 1377500400, 'question': 'Does this seat give your little one head support while they are sleeping? I would like a seat that prevents the child\'s head from "dangling"?', 'answer': "I usually don't have a problem with head support in this car seat. I have it facing forward and it sits up with a little recline. Only a few times do I remember his head falling forward. He usually leans his head to side of the head support and goes to sleep. As they get older, they get better at laying their head to the side and not forward. You can always place an extra head support in the seat for peace of mind. It's a really good seat though."}
{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B00A8EZOKE', 'answerTime': 'Mar 5, 2014', 'unixTime': 1394006400, 'question': 'Does this seat fit well in a sedan (specifically Impala) behind one of the seats while rearfacing?', 'answerType': 'Y', 'answer': "It fits just perfectly in my Prius in rear-facing, and I have to believe that's smaller/tighter than an Impala. It's much smaller than similar Graco models. I used a loaner that took up two seats in the back! With this car seat, grandma and I can still squeeze in the back seat with the baby and let dad and grandpa have the long-leg seats up front."}
