{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B00A8EZOKO', 'answerTime': 'Oct 2, 2013', 'unixTime': 1380697200, 'question': 'Did this seat come with a manual when you bought it from Amazon? Mine just arrived, but there is no manual. I am now concerned it may have been a return.', 'answerType': 'Y', 'answer': "Ha, I went through the same thing. Only after I found the the manual online and printed it out did I find the manual that came with the seat.The manual is actually in a pocket on the seat. The pocket is on the outside of the chair's left bolster. In other words, if your child was in the seat, the pocket is on the same bolster your child's left arm is touching, but on outside. Hope that helps."}
