{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B00A8EZOKO', 'answerTime': 'Apr 27, 2014', 'unixTime': 1398582000, 'question': 'Is the fabric removable and if so, is it machine washable?', 'answerType': 'N', 'answer': 'It is. This is the best part! You just unsnap it from the seat and remove it without even having to unlatch the seat from your car. Huge win! That, plus not having to unstrap and rethread to increase the shoulder height. Those are the reasons why I bought it and why I got it again to replace one from a car accident.'}
