{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B00AH8F5G4', 'answerTime': 'Jul 25, 2013', 'unixTime': 1374735600, 'question': 'Will this pillow fit in a flight seat? Not the small local flights, but international flights?', 'answer': "I've not taken on an international flight, but I took it on a domestic flight and it barely fit -- this was a small plane with only two seats on each side of the aisle. It doesn't fold or compress easily so it wont fit under a seat, but it would fit in an overhead bin. I did enjoy having it on the plane because it provided a firm supportive surface for my baby to sleep with out requiring me to support him with my arms."}
