{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B00AH8IUKM', 'answerTime': 'Jan 20, 2014', 'unixTime': 1390204800, 'question': 'Do these fit inside gdiapers?', 'answerType': 'Y', 'answer': "Yes they do - I'm currently using med/large gpants. Might have to double them over in the small ones. They scrunch up a little bit inside the plastic gpant, but not to the point where they touch the outside (fabric) part of the gdiaper. I just kind of hold it in place with my hand while I pull the diaper up and over kiddo's bottom."}
