{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B00AHQ021Y', 'answerTime': 'Dec 4, 2013', 'unixTime': 1386144000, 'question': 'Has anyone fully reclined the seat and put an infant in the stroller without the attaching the car seat? Chicco said you can do this until he can sit.', 'answerType': 'Y', 'answer': 'Yes. My baby has used only the stroller since he was born. He sleeps very well in the cosy reclined space.'}
{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B00AHVR3ES', 'answerTime': 'Feb 11, 2014', 'unixTime': 1392105600, 'question': 'How does the fabric hold up to wear and washing? Does it fade? Show stains easily? Thanks!', 'answer': "I have only had mine about 6 months. So far the fabric still looks great. I haven't had to do much with it yet though. I will say that I do really like this stroller."}
