{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B00AHVR3ES', 'answerTime': 'Sep 10, 2014', 'unixTime': 1410332400, 'question': 'Does the back support recline all the way back to become completely flat ?', 'answerType': 'Y', 'answer': 'Yes. I recline the back so it is flat often when my baby falls asleep on walks or I need to change a diaper and just have the stroller to put him down in.'}
{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B00AHVR3ES', 'answerTime': 'Feb 12, 2015', 'unixTime': 1423728000, 'question': 'how good is the suspension? is it a rough ride for the baby if lets say you go out for a walk in the park', 'answerType': 'Y', 'answer': 'It is a little bumpy over rocks and grass. Though I am guessing most would be. However we take my son for long long walks in it all the time on sidewalks and paved paths and he loves the stroller. He sleeps for an hour or so often in it while we walk.'}
{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B00AHVR3ES', 'answerTime': 'Dec 7, 2014', 'unixTime': 1417939200, 'question': 'how much does the stroller weigh', 'answer': "It's light. Definitely under 20 lbs. My husband has back issues and has no problems lifting the stroller in and out of the car."}
