{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B00AHVR94W', 'answerTime': 'Apr 23, 2015', 'unixTime': 1429772400, 'question': 'Is the actual seat part of this wide enough to be comfortable for bigger kids who need a booster? My 10 year old son is 4\'6" and average build.', 'answerType': 'Y', 'answer': 'Not trying to be rude in any way here, but as long as he is average size and not "over wide", it should be fine. We plan on buying two more for our kids. The locking straps on this model are a GREAT feature.'}
