{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B00AHVR1QI', 'answerTime': 'Oct 30, 2013', 'unixTime': 1383116400, 'question': "Can this seat be attached to a Bob stroller with the Bob adapter? Bob's website says it is compatible with the Graco Snugride Classic Connect.", 'answerType': '?', 'answer': "I've checked with both Bob and Graco, and both have advised that this carseat does NOT connect with the Bob with the GRACO connecter, as that only works with the Classic Connect. HOWEVER, it IS compatible with the Bob CHICCO adapter. I went to Buy Buy Baby to confirm. I even had the sales guy put on the Chicco adapter to the Bob Revolution SE stroller and the Graco Snugride 35 Click Connect fastened very securely."}
