{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B00AHVR708', 'answerTime': '1 day ago', 'question': 'Is this high chair JPMA certified?', 'answerType': '?', 'answer': 'Maybe reading this will help: The Graco DuoDiner LX Highchair in Orange and Gray grows with your child from infant to toddler, then converts to a space-saving booster. The 5 different height settings let you to perfectly position your growing baby at the family table to make including your little diner into the mealtime routine a breeze. This versatile highchair features a removable infant support and a 3-position, 1-hand-adjustable reclining seat. The frame compactly folds up for transport or when you\'re using the highchair in booster mode. Features: Transitions to Toddler Seat, Removable Tray, Adjustable Straps, Padded Seat, Safety Harness, Collapsible, Reclining Seat, Footrest Includes: 1 Dishwasher-Safe Tray Insert, Seat Pad Converts to: Booster Seat Safety and Security Features: 5-Point Harness Certifications: JPMA Certified Material: Plastic, Polyester, Metal Care and Cleaning: Wipe Clean With Soap and Water, Machine Wash High Chair Max Weight Capacity: 40.0 Lb. Manufacturer\'s Suggested Age: 6 Months and Up Dimensions: 43.5 " H x 29.25 " W x 24.5 " D Weight: 25.21 Lb. Warranty Description: 1 Year Limited Manufacturer Warranty'}
