{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B00AHVR5QY', 'answerTime': 'Aug 7, 2013', 'unixTime': 1375858800, 'question': 'can i use as a crib for infant', 'answerType': 'Y', 'answer': "My baby is 2 months old. She has slept in this every night so far. Right now I'm using it on stage 1 bassinet. But as she grows I will switch to stage 2, then take the bassinet out and use it as a crib that way until I feel like I can move her out of my bedroom. I would think you could use this up until 18 months old as an every night crib. But it is small, so after that I think you would want a bigger size for older infants to have more sleeping room."}
