{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B00AKKDSNG', 'answerTime': 'Mar 30, 2014', 'unixTime': 1396162800, 'question': 'Is there another travel crib sheet that would fit this the Lotus travel crib mattress? I find their fitted sheet extremely difficult to put on!', 'answerType': '?', 'answer': "I'm not sure, but I would be nervous that another sheet wouldn't stay on well throughout the night without the velcro tabs since the mattress doesn't lay very flat. I always put the sheet on and thread the velcro tabs through the slots ahead of time. Then put mattress with sheet in carrying case so when I get to my destination that part is done and I just have to attach mattress to crib."}
