{'answer': "I don't have an iPhone, however my HTC M8 with a large case on it, fits with room to spare. I believe the iPhone is smaller than the M8... The phone and cards should work just fine. The material has a slight stretch to it so you may be able to get keys in there too (depending on how bulky your key collection is). The wrist strap snaps on to the back of the wallet and is very durable, you could slip your key ring around it if they do not fit in the wallet. I have to say that overall, I love this organizer as a whole (wallet and cup holders). It holds a lot of items (two drinks from Starbucks, my very bulky wallet, 2 phones, keys and a small pack of wipes) and I only had to utilize the wallet once. The wallet measures 7 in (length) by 4.5 in (height). Hope this helps!", 'asin': 'B00APIN7U2', 'answerTime': '23 days ago', 'question': 'Does the removable wallet hold an iphone6? Plus some cash/credit cards/ keys?', 'questionType': 'open-ended'}
