{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B00AQAI2KE', 'answerTime': 'Mar 2, 2014', 'unixTime': 1393747200, 'question': 'How is the battery life? And how easy is it to change the batteries? The description says battery life is 2.5 hours, is that a typo?', 'answer': "Battery life is so-so. It depends on how much your little one keeps hitting the button. Battery life is definitely not 2.5 hours, maybe 2.5 weeks? I haven't really counted. Changing batteries is a pain (but I've used a few of these and they're all alike) due to the way the thing mounts to the crib. The actual battery changing isn't the hard part, it's taking the toy down and putting it back up that sucks."}
