{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B00AQAI2KE', 'answerTime': 'Oct 27, 2014', 'unixTime': 1414393200, 'question': 'Is this visible in daylight? Wondering if it would be a useful distraction during tough teething times and vaccinations. Thank you.', 'answerType': 'Y', 'answer': "It is visible in daylight. For our son, it was more of a calming distraction at night or early morning when he was alone and wanted the comfort of some music while falling asleep in his crib. This soother definitely reduced the number of times we had to get up in the night; however, I'm not sure how helpful it would be if he was riled up with the pain of teething or a vaccination."}
