{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B00AQE6Z6I', 'answerTime': 'Jul 22, 2014', 'unixTime': 1406012400, 'question': 'Can you open and close it easily with just one hand? Do find the opening wide enough to walk through or do you have to walk in sideways?', 'answer': 'The door opens very easily with one hand. The opening is VERY wide and can easily be walked through normally. I especially like that the door swings both ways, which makes it easier to walk through in both directions.'}
