{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B00AQKG1CA', 'answerTime': 'Sep 4, 2014', 'unixTime': 1409814000, 'question': 'How do you get the night mode from going in and out. It is flashing so my screen keeps going black and then the picture comes back?', 'answer': 'Make sure the monitor is turned to "on" and not "vox" mode by sliding the on/off switch all the way up. That is the only instance that should make your screen cut to black from the picture intermittently. Vox mode sends the screen to black when no noise is detected and then pops the picture back up when the cameras microphone picks up sounds. Hope that helps! Good luck!'}
