{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B00ASI748K', 'answerTime': 'Oct 15, 2013', 'unixTime': 1381820400, 'question': 'Does this stroller recline flat?', 'answerType': 'Y', 'answer': 'yes it does recline flat so the baby can lie down and be strolled around. and it also is able to click in the car seat for the newborn. I am pleased with this, its a great value for the price, and easy to use. I put my baby in the car seat and then pull the stroller out of my trunk, snap it open with one pull, then transfer the car seat to the stroller, it snaps on easily. The stroller does recline to a flat lying down position without the car seat attached, and also a sitting up position for a larger baby. Cup holders on top and diaper bag storage underneath, its the complete package.'}
