{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B00AVATUDW', 'answerTime': 'Aug 25, 2014', 'unixTime': 1408950000, 'question': 'Is this the 2014 model? Also, I have a 5 mo. old and a tall 3.5 year old. Do I need to purchase a carseat adapter for my 5 mo.old to ride safely?', 'answer': "I'm not sure about the model. I purchased it when I believe it was 2013 model... You won't need the car seat adapter, the five point restraint and back that lays all the way down is fine ever for a newborn! We tried the adapter and hated it! (Awkward, super heavy, and makes the stroller almost impossible to get into the car)"}
