{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B00AYZFFQU', 'answerTime': 'Dec 15, 2014', 'unixTime': 1418630400, 'question': "How many pages pertain to showers and pregnancy? I want to get this for my daughter's foster baby and pregnancy information would not be available.", 'answer': 'There\'s only 3 for that. One is titled "Spread the News....A Baby is Due" and asks questions about reaction and how you celebrated, so you could probably still use. The next is "Anticipation and Preparation" and asks about cravings and such. The third is "Showers and Good Wishes". I bought this book for my third child so I didn\'t have a shower so I just covered up the title and text prompts with pictures of our family and such. We had a homebirth too so the prompted pages about hospital stuff I covered with other things/pictures. Its pretty easy to keep the cute matching bordered pages, but skew the info to whats applicable to your babe.'}
