{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B00B07STBO', 'answerTime': 'Sep 23, 2014', 'unixTime': 1411455600, 'question': 'Has anyone used this stroller with the b-safe infant car seat? I wanted to check others experiences before I bought this online.', 'answerType': '?', 'answer': 'We actually use a UNIVERSAL car seat attachment system which is INCLUDED with the purchase of a Caboose Stand On Tandem, Caboose Ultralight Stand On Tandem and Big Caboose. It works with most car seats on the market. Here is a list of car seat brands we tested: Baby Trend Flex-Loc Britax B-safe Britax Chaperone Britax Companion Britax Romer BABY-SAFE Chicco KeyFit Chicco KeyFit 30 Combi Shuttle Cybex Aton Lamaze Via Evenflo Embrace Graco Junior Baby Graco SafeSeat Graco SnugRide Graco SnugRideR 32 Graco SnugRideR 35 SnugRide Click Connect 40 Maxi Cosi Mico Maxi Cabriofix Maxi Prezi Maxi Pebble Mothercare Traveltot Peg Perego Primo Viaggio Peg Perego Primo Viaggio SIP Peg Perego Primo Viaggio SIP 30/30 Safety 1st Designer 22 Safety 1st onBoard 35 Safety 1st onBoard 35 Air'}
