{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B00B1DRRW4', 'answerTime': 'Apr 23, 2014', 'unixTime': 1398236400, 'question': 'what are its dimensions? I need to knowo if it will fit into a rocking stand', 'answer': 'Here is the information from the uppababy website-Unfolded with canopy up: 27.5" L x 13"W x 24"H (bassinet is 9" deep). Uppababy sells a stand for the bassinet. We purchased the bassinet, along with the CRUZ stroller, and unfortunately we got very little use out of it. Even though our baby was on the smaller side, we felt that she outgrew it very quickly, and we really didn\'t use it too much with the stroller, because the baby lays completely flat inside it. We also purchased the uppababy carseat and, while our baby is still young, we prefer that over the bassinet to attach to the stroller. There is a removable part that stabilizes the babies when they are small. Plus, you can face the MESA forward or backward in the stroller, and the baby is in a reclining position, so he/she can enjoy the scenery better. Hope this helps.'}
