{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B00B507DN6', 'answerTime': 'Dec 4, 2014', 'unixTime': 1417680000, 'question': 'What are the pros and cons of the Recaro Pro Ride (which I own and love) versus the Recaro Performance SPORT? I need to buy another booster/car seat.', 'answer': 'I only have the Pro-Sport (two of them) but looking at the Pro Ride I think the main difference is the booster only option with the Sport. I could be wrong but it looks like this option is not available with the Pro Ride. We have not gotten to that stage now but from what I understand the top part comes off of the Pro Sport and the seat can be used as booster only. This allows us to not ever need another seat, our daughter can sit in this seat up to 120 lbs and 59 inches in booster mode. This to me is a major Pro, and the other features look very similar so I am not aware of any Cons.'}
