{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B00B507DN6', 'answerTime': 'Oct 7, 2014', 'unixTime': 1412665200, 'question': 'How high is the seat compared to the Recaro ProRIDE? Our son bonks his head when he tries to get into his ProRIDE. Is the Perf. SPORT seat much lower?', 'answer': 'If you are referring only to the seat bottom, then yes the Recaro Performance Sport is lowed than the Recaro ProRide. The former is a combination harness/booster, while the latter is a regular car seat. The latter category generally has higher seat bottom than the former.'}
