{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B00B64AY5A', 'answerTime': 'Jan 6, 2015', 'unixTime': 1420531200, 'question': "I bought this monitor set and can't enable the scan mode. How do I do it? Thank you.", 'answer': "First make sure both cameras are connected. Then make it so that you can only see one camera full screen. Next push the check mark twice. (Pushing the check make once allows you to choose with the arrows whether to add, subtract, or scan cameras. It's automatically on the scan option with the refresh like arrows and hitting the check mark again selects scan.)"}
