{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B00B64AY5A', 'answerTime': '5 days ago', 'question': 'If I purchased 2 of these, could all 4 cameras be hooked up to both monitors? That way my niece could have a monitor upstairs and downstairs.', 'answerType': 'N', 'answer': 'Thank you for your question. You can only have 1 monitor synched to the 4 cameras. Additional monitors can not be added. We recommend adding additional cameras, not systems, as running more than 1 system may cause interference.'}
