{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B00B7XUVLW', 'answerTime': 'Oct 22, 2014', 'unixTime': 1413961200, 'question': 'does the moby wrap fit inside?', 'answerType': 'Y', 'answer': 'YES! I would roll it into a ball to give you more space inside the bag but it really is SO roomy! I am constantly surprised at how much I can fit into it and I usually carry at least three cloth diapers inside the bag too!'}
