{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B00B7XUVLW', 'answerTime': 'Dec 11, 2013', 'unixTime': 1386748800, 'question': 'How is the changing pad that comes with this bag? Would it be necessary to also purchase the matching changing station?', 'answer': "Truthfully I haven't had a lot of use with it yet since my baby is only 3 weeks old and we haven't gone out much. It's a simple tri-fold pad that secures with Velcro. It doesn't have pockets or anything to hold wipes or diapers, so if you think you'll need that then you might want to purchase the matching changing station. For me, I think I'll going to be happy with it since I'll always have the diaper bag around to hold what I need. The diaper bag is AWESOME."}
{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B00B7XUVLW', 'answerTime': 'Jul 9, 2014', 'unixTime': 1404889200, 'question': 'Can this bag be worn as a backpack?', 'answerType': '?', 'answer': 'It has no back straps for carrying , only the long one for shoulder or crossbody and the short handles .'}
{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B00B7XUVLW', 'answerTime': 'Mar 11, 2014', 'unixTime': 1394521200, 'question': 'Does the french strip design have any interior pockets?', 'answerType': '?', 'answer': 'There are two zippered pockets on top of the bag - you can see them a little bit in the photo. The bag also has two pockets inside. I do like this bag and even though we bought another larger Skip Hop bag (we have two babies now), if one of us is going out with one baby we still use the Skip Hop Duo for our errand.'}
{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B00B7XUVLW', 'answerTime': 'Jul 27, 2014', 'unixTime': 1406444400, 'question': 'Where could you store a sippy cup with this bag? In the front pockets? Or only the hidden (insulated?) pockets?', 'answer': 'I store them in the hidden pockets. The playtex and the munchkin brand sippy cups fit perfectly.'}
{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B00B7XUVLW', 'answerTime': 'Mar 6, 2015', 'unixTime': 1425628800, 'question': 'Does the main compartment has a zipper or magnetic closure? Does the 2 front pockets have magnetic closure?', 'answer': "The main compartment has a zipper but the two front pockets don't have any closure at all"}
