{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B00B7ZMORE', 'answerTime': 'Jan 6, 2015', 'unixTime': 1420531200, 'question': "My husband and I are rather tall, so we're wondering when the handle is adjusted to its maximum, how high is it from the ground level?", 'answer': 'I\'m 5\'8", and find that with compact strollers, especially umbrella strollers, I feel hunched over. I love this feature, especially when jogging, I can adjust to maximum height, and hold sides, rest my forearms, whatever is comfortable. It also helps with the steering. I\'ve had other joggers in the past, but none had this feature, and I wouldn\'t get another without it. Hope this helps'}
{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B00B7ZMORE', 'answerTime': 'Nov 12, 2014', 'unixTime': 1415779200, 'question': "What is the height limit? My daughter is 40' tall wanting to make sure she will be comfortable.", 'answer': 'My son was 40" when we purchased it and it really didn\'t work out too well.'}
{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B00B7ZMORE', 'answerTime': 'Sep 28, 2014', 'unixTime': 1411887600, 'question': 'Can you adjust the canopy 180 degrees to block baby from sun/wind when running?', 'answerType': '?', 'answer': "If I'm understanding you correctly the canopy does not pull down all the way forward to cover the front. I had to clip a small blanket to the canopy to cover the front, the sun and wind. It does give the best coverage of all the jogging strollers that I checked out. I have an issue with the sun but I go walking/jogging right when the sun is coming up because of the heat in Vegas in the summer. There also is a weather guard option that is available for this model."}
{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B00B7ZMORE', 'answerTime': 'Sep 4, 2014', 'unixTime': 1409814000, 'question': 'Is it green and beige or grey?', 'answer': "It's green and grey..."}
{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B00B7ZMORE', 'answerTime': 'Jul 21, 2014', 'unixTime': 1405926000, 'question': 'Is this a harness seatbelt? If so does it have the option just to use the lap belt (no shoulder straps)????', 'answer': "Yes it's a harness. You can un clip the shoulder straps from the lap belt as well. And the pads for the shoulder straps slide off easily for cleaning. This is an awesome stroller!"}
