{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B00B98DU9U', 'answerTime': 'Aug 4, 2014', 'unixTime': 1407135600, 'question': 'Does the seat cover remove for washing? What chemicals are in the fabric?', 'answer': 'Dear Sew Sew We can advise that the fabrics are detachable and as global suppliers of nursery products we exceed the requirements of the many international standards for all of our lines. This includes material and chemical properties as required by law. Our strollers in the United States are not treated with any chemical flame retardants. Kind Regards,'}
