{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B00B9ZRZFS', 'answerTime': 'Jul 29, 2014', 'unixTime': 1406617200, 'question': 'How long do the batteries last? Do you need to change them too often?', 'answer': 'Since most kids toys use batteries, I would recommend getting a battery charger and rechargeable batteries. My daughter bought the Energizer Recharge Universal Charger for both of us, it works great and charges AA, AAA, C, D and 9V. It works great and I highly recommend it.'}
{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B00BAAX39E', 'answerTime': 'Feb 7, 2014', 'unixTime': 1391760000, 'question': "I have a large toddler,has anyone found the hole too small? Anyone have the dimensions of the hole? He's got a big bum.", 'answer': "After much shopping, this was the largest opening we could find. My son was 35 lbs while using this seat. The others didn't have enough room from front to back so you had to change positioning depending on what it was you were on the potty to do. This one was a nice size between the usual children's potty seat and the regular adult seat."}
{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B00BAAX39E', 'answerTime': 'Feb 18, 2014', 'unixTime': 1392710400, 'question': 'Is it easy for toddlers to get on and off by themselves? My granddaughter uses a Bemis child/adult built in potty seat at home and can do it by herself.', 'answerType': 'Y', 'answer': 'My 3 yr old can use it by herself, but only with a step stool. The hump in the front prevents her from simply scooting or lifting herself onto the toilet without the step stool.'}
{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B00BAAX39E', 'answerTime': 'Mar 3, 2015', 'unixTime': 1425369600, 'question': 'is it soft or the same plastic feeling like the regular toilet?', 'answer': 'It feels like hard plastic. It is not padded in any way where it come in contact with the user. It is like a regular toilet seat that is made of hard plastic. Ours works perfectly in our odd Toto toilet seat and besides being cold in the morning, our 3 year old daughter fits comfortably and it is very stable with no sliding issues.'}
