{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B00BATQJE6', 'answerTime': 'Sep 2, 2014', 'unixTime': 1409641200, 'question': 'I have read that microfiber smells from the urine...do these and also that they get a rash because they are so absorbent.', 'answer': "Retained odor is only if the diaper is not adequately washed of all ammonia. And rashes from microfiber only occur if the material is directly touching the baby's sensitive skin because of it's over-drying tendency. This is not a problem with these diapers, because there is an added layer of microfleece on top of each absorbent flap to protect baby's skin."}
{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B00BATQJE6', 'answerTime': 'Mar 1, 2014', 'unixTime': 1393660800, 'question': 'Do these come with the inserts and everything I need?', 'answerType': '?', 'answer': 'Yes, there are two flaps, one sewn at front one at back, so no inserts needed. Very absorbent. Our fav by far.'}
