{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B00BATQJE6', 'answerTime': 'Feb 17, 2014', 'unixTime': 1392624000, 'question': "Do these really fit from newborn up to around 2 years of age? I don't want to buy something that isn't adjustable for all sizes", 'answerType': 'Y', 'answer': "Yes! My youngest daughter just turned 2 and she is still wearing these every day! They adjust really well. I was worried about her getting too big for them because she is in the 90th percentile with height and weight... But I don't even have to use the buttons further out. Just remember that they won't absorb all that great without leaking until they have been used and washed maybe a good seven times."}
