{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B00BBKLWWI', 'answerTime': 'May 4, 2014', 'unixTime': 1399186800, 'question': 'What is the recommended age for this product?', 'answer': 'Hi Lindsay, I don\'t own the box anymore, so I don\'t know what the "technical" recommendations are, but we started using it around 6 months. It\'s great for helping to sit up. It has a lap restraint system, so they can\'t pull themselves up and over and, at least for my daughter (whose height and weight measurements have routinely been near, at, or over the 100th percentile), it was a nice snug fit inside the saucer. The other nice thing is that you can add or take away the toys as you see fit, so if there is something you don\'t want a wee one to have early on, simply leave it off.'}
