{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B00BBKMMFO', 'answerTime': 'Jun 20, 2014', 'unixTime': 1403247600, 'question': 'My baby is 4 months 12lbs and 23 inches, will this accommodate his length?', 'answerType': '?', 'answer': "Yes it will. Although you probably won't get that much use out of it because soon your baby will want to move around and see more of his/her surroundings and because the angle of the seat is not adjustable (i.e. can't be set into a more upright position and it doesn't bounce, your baby little one may get bored. That said, as long as your baby isn't that inclined to move yet, it's a good + safe place to put your him/her for a short nap or a bathroom/shower break for whoever is taking care."}
