{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B00BEJP3VC', 'answerTime': 'Apr 2, 2015', 'unixTime': 1427958000, 'question': 'Have anyone successfully fitted this stroller into a ford focus? And were you able to put in a checked luggage as well? Thanks a lot!', 'answer': "We've fit the stroller into a Subaru WRX with no problem. I think the trunk size is pretty similar to a Focus. Using the UPPAbaby G-Luxe travel bag that we bought, checking the stroller in has been uneventful with no damage. The travel bag is well worth it in our opinion."}
