{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B00BEJREIC', 'answerTime': 'Nov 3, 2014', 'unixTime': 1415001600, 'question': 'Does this bassinet rock on its own? If yes, how long is the rocking cycle before it has to be restarted? Also, can the music be silenced while rocking', 'answer': "It's more of a sway than a rock, but yes. It sways as long as you leave it on. You can do sway and music, music only, or sway only. I love it."}
