{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B00BEJREIC', 'answerTime': 'Aug 31, 2014', 'unixTime': 1409468400, 'question': "Does anyone have a video they can post to show the auto rocking motion? We bought the Simmons Soothing- didn't realize we had to manually rock it.", 'answerType': 'Y', 'answer': "I'm sorry, I don't have a video, but if the battery compartment is in place correctly (seems like I hadn't turned the plastic piece sufficiently the first try) the cradle part gently sways back and forth with the option of cheesy music. I should say though that my grand-baby actually enjoyed the music (ears not fully developed?) She has just about out grown the bassinet now, but we loved it; it is easy to move around the house and the height was just right. Hope you can get it to work for you!"}
