{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B00BEVF2NY', 'answerTime': 'Feb 8, 2014', 'unixTime': 1391846400, 'question': 'Will this fit in a midsize sedan?', 'answerType': 'Y', 'answer': 'Probably as long as you aren\'t trying to get three across in your mid-sized sedan. The seat should be fine on either outboard seat, but often, car seats don\'t work well in the middle if you have a, "hump" in your backseat. This seat works fine in my husband\'s 2011 Honda Accord. It is so very easy to install, just make sure you read the manual and install the tether. Hope this helps!'}
