{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B00BEVF1XA', 'answerTime': 'Jan 10, 2014', 'unixTime': 1389340800, 'question': 'how old chirldren can use it?', 'answer': "It's not really age as much as it is size. Children up to 90 pounds and 58 inches tall can use it in car seat mode. Then as a booster seat, it can be used to 62 inches tall and 120 pounds. It depends on each child's size, but it will likely be for many years. My 11 year old nephew, who is tall for his age, would still meet the requirements to be able to use it."}
{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B00BEVF1XA', 'answerTime': 'Sep 15, 2013', 'unixTime': 1379228400, 'question': 'would someone please clarify for me what the width and the depth are? (at the widest and deepest points) thanks!', 'answer': 'http://www.britaxusa.com/car-seats/frontier-90/specs Child Weight (lbs) Forward Facing Harness: 2 years & 25, up to 90 Booster: 40 - 120 Child Standing Height (in) Forward Facing Harness: 30 - 58 Booster: 45 - 62 Child Seated Shoulder Height (in) Forward Facing Harness: 12.5 - 20.5 Booster: 15 - 23 Product Weight (lbs) 25 Product Dimensions Harness Minimum (in) 19W x 28H x 21D Product Dimensions Harness Maximum (in) 19W x 36H x 21D Product Dimensions Booster Minimum (in) 19W x 28H x 21D Product Dimensions Booster Maximum (in) 19W x 36H x 21D Seating Compartment Height (in) 23.5 Seat Area Depth / Width (in) 13.5 / 12 Shoulder Width (in) 15.5 Harness Slot Heights (in) 12.5 / 13.5 / 14.5 / 15.5 / 16.5 / 17.5 / 18.5 / 19.5 / 20.5 Buckle Strap Depths (in) 7.0 / 9.0'}
