{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B00BM9MJNE', 'answerTime': 'Nov 1, 2013', 'unixTime': 1383289200, 'question': 'Does the milk go through the tubing at all? Will I need to clean the tubing, is my main concern', 'answerType': '?', 'answer': "No, the milk shouldn't get into the tubing. There may be some condesation build up, but if you just run the pump on highest setting for abt 5 min after you are done pumping it will clear it out. I've had my pump 2 months and I am very satisfied."}
