{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B00BMJPEFY', 'answerTime': 'May 25, 2014', 'unixTime': 1401001200, 'question': 'Does the battery need to be replaced often? I got mine 3 months back and no matter how long I charge it the battery shows dead. Is this a defect?', 'answer': "Probably a bad battery. Ours can be off the charger for days and still have a power, not being used that whole time. As in, I had it for a nap time while I was outside and turn it off after nap (couple hours) but don't plug it in, it will still have charge a few days later. It has also lasted over night (audio only) not being plugged in."}
