{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B00BR0ON8M', 'answerTime': '11 days ago', 'question': 'Is it possible to change the fabric? Someone bought us one with pink flowers but we are actually having a boy!', 'answerType': '?', 'answer': "Yes, call Graco and give them the model number. You can order a new cover from them that's approved and safe. Be aware that this seat may not fit a newborn, as the harness slots are too high. They are set at 8in and most newborns torsos are 5-7in. The harness must come from at or below the child's shoulders when rear facing. Never above. I'm a certified CPST. (Child Passenger Safety Technician)"}
