{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B00BSD7PXI', 'answerTime': 'Oct 12, 2014', 'unixTime': 1413097200, 'question': 'What is the distance between the tray and the seat? My baby has chunky thighs... thanks!', 'answer': 'We purchased this chair for our chunky son when he was 6 months old and over the 100th percentile for weight, 85th percentile for height and fit in the chair with no issues with the tray and seat in their "smallest" setting. He is now 13 months, 28 pounds, and we still have yet to adjust the seat and tray to the next step. Your chunky baby will no-doubtedly fit in this chair, based on our experience with our hefty boy! :)'}
