{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B00BVDHGW0', 'answerTime': 'Dec 28, 2014', 'unixTime': 1419753600, 'question': 'What is the recommended age range? up to what age?', 'answer': 'We used this as newborn, I can see a toddler also loving it. My 7yr old also flops on it watching tv though he is a bit big. One thing i reccomend is adding filler. I found the best price was at Walmart.com. For a newborn it is nice to have more support & as with all bean chairs they need refill over time ( especially when older kids jump on it). Very comfy, but parent should never leave child unattended. Enjoy :)'}
