{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B00C2KW3II', 'answerTime': 'Jan 2, 2014', 'unixTime': 1388649600, 'question': 'Are all of the fabric pieces of this removable and washable or just the insert?', 'answer': "The whole thing (all fabric) comes off leaving only two fabric straps which aren't removable. All of the inserts, bedding can be thrown in the washing machine. Washes up nicely. I've done it several times. Once you strip fabric, you're left with the plastic and metal frame and two fabric straps. Sorry forgot, the very top headpiece doesn't remove I don't believe but that really shouldn't ever get dirty since the baby isn't touching that ever."}
