{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B00C2MBPUI', 'answerTime': 'Sep 14, 2014', 'unixTime': 1410678000, 'question': 'Can you wall mount the camera or is the clip the only option?', 'answer': 'You can mount it to the wall with the little adapter it comes with. It makes it very easy to take the camera off the wall for traveling and put it back up.'}
{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B00C2MBPUI', 'answerTime': 'Jun 16, 2014', 'unixTime': 1402902000, 'question': 'Does it have the Voice Activated Power Saver Mode?', 'answerType': 'Y', 'answer': 'Yes, it does have a feature that allows the monitor screen to turn off while the audio stays on. If the audio level rises above a preset level then the monitor screen will come back on. So it really depends how loud the room is that your monitoring how effective this feature will be.'}
