{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B00C2MBPUI', 'answerTime': 'Jan 3, 2015', 'unixTime': 1420272000, 'question': 'Is the camera recharable as well as the monitor or does it run off AC power?', 'answer': 'The camera has a battery and will work un-plugged.'}
{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B00C2MBPUI', 'answerTime': 'Nov 3, 2014', 'unixTime': 1415001600, 'question': "Can the screen be turned off while still functioning? I don't want to go to sleep with a bright screen on next to me. Thanks!", 'answerType': '?', 'answer': "Kind of.. It has a function where the screen will stay off until it detects some level of volume from the camera. Once the sound is detected the screen will come on, but then go off again until more sound is detected (like when the baby cries, talks, etc.) I don't remember exactly what this function is called, but its some type of voice activation."}
