{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B00C7JW2R6', 'answerTime': 'Sep 6, 2014', 'unixTime': 1409986800, 'question': 'Do you need to prep the shell? If so, how? Otherwise, how do you wash these on a normal bases?', 'answer': 'I just do a rinse on cold first to get all the pee rinsed out. Once I do that I wash it on heavy duty and use a biodegradable laundry detergent'}
