{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B00C7JW3GQ', 'answerTime': 'Jul 22, 2014', 'unixTime': 1406012400, 'question': "About how big are these when you stuff them and fold them up? I'm purchasing baskets for my changing table.", 'answer': 'Depending on how you\'re stacking them, I would say 1 inch per diaper if standing them up top down in a basket and grabbing each one from the middle, or if you\'re stacking them one on top of the other, a basket about 6" by 9" would do great.'}
