{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B00C7JW3GQ', 'answerTime': 'Feb 2, 2015', 'unixTime': 1422864000, 'question': "Is there a band of PUL on the inside of the diaper to help keep the baby's tummy dry?", 'answerType': '?', 'answer': 'It is my understanding that PUL (polyurethane laminate) is the waterproof lining on the inside of the diaper that does not touch the skin. Yes, these are very waterproof. If you are asking about a band of fleece or some other type of soft fabric near the tummy, no, there is no such band. I hope that helps!!'}
