{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B00CB4KIIM', 'answerTime': 'Aug 4, 2014', 'unixTime': 1407135600, 'question': 'Will this product work on a regular umbrella stroller?', 'answerType': '?', 'answer': "Our Edelein Stroller Organizer will work on a regular umbrella stroller--we use it for our umbrella stroller, regular travel stroller with buggy board and even on our double stroller. We always make sure that when we are using one of our Edelein stroller organizers we don't 'overload' it and make sure to press the velcro on the straps firmly together and avoid 'overloading it'. You can quickly release the straps when folding up your stroller or leave it attached for full collapsability. Thank you for your question."}
