{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B00CB4KIIM', 'answerTime': 'Aug 16, 2013', 'unixTime': 1376636400, 'question': 'Is this compatible with double strollers? More specifically an in-step jogging stroller?', 'answer': "Dear Leslie, Thank you for your interest in our Edelein Stroller Organizer. This organiser will fit across almost all strollers where the left and right handle bars are spaced up to a maximum of 20-22 inches. (at 16-18 inches the velcro side straps allow the organiser to hang most comfortably). The instep inline or tandem double strollers allow a good fit. I am not sure of the model you have, the double stroller models with a middle support bar make it easy to attach the organizer or two side by side, however the velcro straps are sturdy enough that you could hang the organizer centered on the front handle bar(with enough curvature to the handle to allow access to all of the organizer's compartments and versatile features). Diagonal attachment from one of the side bars to one side of your front grip is also possible. I hope this answers your question and is helpful to you and your family. We look forward to serving you as one of our valued customers. Thank you again Leslie and have a great day. Sincerely, Zaccheo"}
