{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B00CCA025O', 'answerTime': 'Nov 4, 2013', 'unixTime': 1383552000, 'question': "Hi, how does the parent unit return from the sleep mode? I mean when it is silent and off because baby's room is quiet and it captures a noise.", 'answer': "When it's on it's charging base it's never in sleep mode (or doesn't have to be). When not on the base the picture will turn off, but the sound will remain on. There is a large oval button in the middle of the top of the camera the label says video on/off. Just press that button and the picture will come back on. Since it's not on the base you will have to press it every so often to keep seeing the picture."}
