{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B00CCKC108', 'answerTime': 'Nov 20, 2013', 'unixTime': 1384934400, 'question': "Would anyone recommend getting this instead of a pack-and-play? I'm trying to decide if I need both or if I could use this product regularly indoors.", 'answerType': 'Y', 'answer': 'We have both. The Pea Pod is great for sleeping while traveling, but for every day around the house, a small child is NOT going to be happy in the pea pod. We have a one year old and the pack in play is great for when i need to contain him in another room for a short while. We used the pea pod while on vacation in Hawaii. It fit into my carry on luggage and is easy to put up and then fold up... but i definitely recommend a pack n play for home.'}
