{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B00CE8C7SO', 'answerTime': 'Sep 10, 2013', 'unixTime': 1378796400, 'question': 'what is the hieght?....', 'answer': 'Just purchases two if these gates for my porch to confine my dogs. The gate is 27 1/2" high. The installed height will depend on how far off the floor you mount the brackets. I have Dachshunds and Chihuahuas so U mounted my low so they could not go under the gate. It is mounted 1 1/2" off the floor (or deck in this case). That now makes the installed height 29". If your dog is bigger, you will be able to raise the mounting brackets high enough that your dig cannot go under and not hopefully not jump over. So far very pleased with the gates. Only complaint is one of the set screws would not set as it was stripped. Hope this helps.'}
