{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B00CMQ7YZ4', 'answerTime': 'Jun 24, 2014', 'unixTime': 1403593200, 'question': 'Has anyone tried this with a Diono Radian rxt? How did it fit? Was it comfortable for your child?', 'answer': 'My carseats are diono. They are 14 inches across bottom on their leg area and the tray fits just fine. My child was comfy. I have the straps fitted around the back of the carseat and the buckle for it is on the side so i can undo it easily take it off and place to the side of the seat without completely undoing the tray. Over all the tray will do its job but if you are wanting to put color books on it that does not fit...only smaller things or food for the kids is fine. The overall quality of the product could be better in my opinion for the price of it. The zipper is weak. I needed to open to wash it. Otherr than that it did its job.'}
