{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B00CMRWNYU', 'answerTime': 'Jul 8, 2014', 'unixTime': 1404802800, 'question': 'Hi! I heard Spectra issued new stocks of M1 that are compatible with wide-neck bottles. Is this one of them? Does it come with 2 wide-neck bottles?', 'answer': 'I received my M1 two months ago and it is not compatible with wide neck bottles and comes with two "standard" sized bottles. The best way to find out if they have a model that is compatible with wide necked bottles is to email the company, visit their website at spectrababyusa.com, click on the contact link at the top, and you can email or call them through that link. They were really prompt in answering an email that I sent them, so they shouldn\'t take too long to answer your question.'}
