{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B00CXPYWCC', 'answerTime': 'Oct 2, 2014', 'unixTime': 1412233200, 'question': "Please share if you've warmed milk in these w/o the kiinde warmer. They fit inside our bottle warmer, but I'm not so sure that makes it ok.", 'answer': "I haven't used other bottle warmers, but what I often do is put hot tap water into a tall Tupperware container and heat it in that. I actually think that works better than the Kiinde warmer for full bags because it reaches to the top of the bag."}
