{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B00CXSPL24', 'answerTime': 'Jul 31, 2014', 'unixTime': 1406790000, 'question': 'Which nipples are compatible with the pouches?', 'answer': "The pouches have a hard top with a screw-on cap, so when that's unscrewed (and the pouch is inserted into the case for the bottle), the nipples they provide pop right in. Like Erika H. said, there are three flow options - fast, medium, and slow. They also come with an adapter that's used to connect directly to the breast pump, and those can be used to connect to nipples not made by the manufacturer."}
