{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B00CYRXU4A', 'answerTime': 'Jun 16, 2014', 'unixTime': 1402902000, 'question': 'so the jars are not 4oz? I believed these were 4oz. Thank you', 'answer': 'Yes, these jars are 4oz if you fill it to the top. The markers on the side of the jar only read up to 2oz. So when I initially received these jars I thought they sent the wrong item. But it is the correct item. I measured four ounces from another container and placed it in this jar and it fit perfectly.'}
