{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B00CYRXU4A', 'answerTime': 'Mar 6, 2014', 'unixTime': 1394092800, 'question': "Can these be used for repeated heating in a bottle warmer, or are they merely for storage? I'm concerned about the lids holding up in the heat.", 'answer': "I never heat with the lid on. When I want to warm the food contents, I boil a pot of water and then place the uncovered glass jar in the pot once the water is boiling hot. Then I just stir the food content to distribute the heat evenly. I've been using these jars for about 4 months now and they've worked well."}
