{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B00D04R2JA', 'answerTime': 'Jun 14, 2014', 'unixTime': 1402729200, 'question': "Is this car seat ok for a 30 lb almost 3 year old? I'm trying to find something that works for two grandchildren.", 'answerType': 'Y', 'answer': 'Yes. My son is about 30 lbs and almost 4. He is on the shorter side for his age, so I would say he is close to the height an early 3 year old would be. The easy adjustability of the shoulder straps will please you also if you have to accommodate two different children in one car seat.'}
