{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B00D04R2JA', 'answerTime': 'Jan 12, 2015', 'unixTime': 1421049600, 'question': 'How is the head support? Is it comfortable for kids when they fall asleep in the seat?', 'answer': "The head support is actually very good. We were able to recline the seat a bit (not as much as our previous car seat but enough) for my daughter to sleep in the Britax seat. We routinely make a 14hr roadtrip to see family, and she has slept very comfortably in the seat. This was one of my main concerns too, and I'm happy to say she is quite comfortable sleeping in the seat."}
