{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B00D04R1M8', 'answerTime': 'Mar 25, 2015', 'unixTime': 1427266800, 'question': 'what age is this appropriate for?', 'answer': 'It is suitable for children 40-120 pounds AND 38"-63" tall. Typically children can be at least 4 years old, but it is highly recommended to keep them in a 5-point harness booster seat instead (like the Britax Pioneer, Frontier or Pinnacle). We usually recommend this seat for children around 6 years old.'}
