{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B00DBKFFJM', 'answerTime': 'Oct 29, 2013', 'unixTime': 1383030000, 'question': 'Are larger flanges available? Does this pump work with pumpin pals?', 'answer': 'Basically the tubing connector supports the same inside diameter as Medela, Ameda, and probably others. Therefore you can use Medela collection kit with Pumpin Pals flange if you wanted. This is how my wife uses it. Or you could use Ameda collection equipment (and probably others). Great machine by the way. The pump action seems a little strange at first as it sort of flutters but she got used to it and actually prefers this model over the fancy $2,000 Ameda Platinum we rented.'}
