{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B00DJQOREC', 'answerTime': 'Sep 21, 2014', 'unixTime': 1411282800, 'question': 'Can you mount this mobile on a crib with a solid wood panel (no bars)?', 'answerType': '?', 'answer': 'Not without involving some other contraption. If you look at my little video, you\'ll see how I had to arrange a crate to hold it. you might be able to hang something onto the crib and then attach the mobile to that. tiny love also has a smaller portable mobile would attach to a solid crib. It isn\'t nearly as fascinating, but it does the trick and by the time the baby is 7 or 8 months old you won\'t need the mobile anymore anyway since the baby will be physically able to "get" it by then.'}
