{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B00DJQOREC', 'answerTime': 'Jan 9, 2014', 'unixTime': 1389254400, 'question': 'Does this model have a remote control?', 'answerType': 'N', 'answer': "No, it does not. It runs for about 20 minutes at which time you must manually press a button or select a new option to make it start again. The sesame for shutoff...it must be done manually if you don't want to wait 20 minutes."}
{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B00DJQOREC', 'answerTime': 'Aug 27, 2014', 'unixTime': 1409122800, 'question': 'Is it possible to turn the light off?', 'answerType': 'Y', 'answer': 'Yes. The switch includes the option to have any combination of motion, music and light. We usually just have motion with real music in the background. It is a lovely mobile, and the view from underneath is almost Dr. Suess-ian. Also the way they have balanced the items on each of the three arms causes each arm to have its own movement within the entire system.'}
{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B00DJQOREC', 'answerTime': 'Mar 26, 2015', 'unixTime': 1427353200, 'question': 'Is it too late to use it on a three-month-old?', 'answerType': '?', 'answer': '3 months is a perfect age for this product. My baby started responding to it more at 3 months than earlier.'}
