{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B00DMD2348', 'answerTime': 'Jun 29, 2014', 'unixTime': 1404025200, 'question': 'Does the cosleeper comes with the strap and plate trAvel bag, removable fabric liner,fired sheet, etc. ?', 'answerType': 'Y', 'answer': 'Yes, this cosleeper has the strap and plate that anchors it to the bed, the bag that holds it for transport, the liner is removable and washable, and there is one sheet included.'}
