{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B00DMCYENW', 'answerTime': 'Jun 4, 2014', 'unixTime': 1401865200, 'question': 'Do we need to buy extra paddings/skirts for the bassinet? Looks like it was surrounded by mesh all around... .', 'answerType': '?', 'answer': 'It is not recommended that you add any extra padding by the manufacturer. The mesh makes it breathable all around. The only things I added were risers to bring it to the correct height next to my bed.'}
