{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B00DNBA82S', 'answerTime': 'Apr 17, 2014', 'unixTime': 1397718000, 'question': 'Can be plugged to 220v? thanks!', 'answerType': 'Y', 'answer': "Yes, the power supply says it can take 220 volts. But it only comes with a US format plug, so you'll need an adapter to plug it into what ever UK/European outlet you are planning to use. It's a great monitor system. I highly recommend it."}
