{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B00DNCF02A', 'answerTime': 'May 12, 2014', 'unixTime': 1399878000, 'question': 'Can you use a split screen to see both cameras at the same time?', 'answerType': '?', 'answer': 'I do not own this camera (yet) but from what I have gathered from other reviewers you can either view 1 or 4 cameras at the same time...meaning if you have 2-3 cameras, the image will be just as small as if there were 4 images. Or, you can toggle back and forth between one large image. I plan to use the camera primarily for my newborn (due in June) with the ability to "check in" on my toddler as needed.'}
