{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B00DOR6F5K', 'answerTime': 'May 1, 2015', 'unixTime': 1430463600, 'question': 'Will this fit in any affordable jogging stroller? By affordable I mean not the Bob that is out of my budget.', 'answerType': 'N', 'answer': "Hello Scarlett! Unfortunately, we do not manufacture jogging strollers at this time and while there are a wide range of other manufacturers that state they do make adapters to allow for use with our Mico platform of car seats, we do not test those for compatibility. The stroller manufacturers actually design, develop, test, manufacture, and distribute/retail their own adapters for use of car seat brands they select with their stroller brands/models. For instance - as Quinny/Maxi-Cosi, we offer adapters in the box with each of our active strollers (with the exception of the Yezz) that allow for use of these strollers with our Maxi-Cosi Mico platform of car seats as well as the Prezi. We also offer a few select multi-model adapters for the Buzz Xtra, Zapp Xtra, and the Moodd that allow for those specific strollers to be used with a selected group of competitors' car seats. We tested those seats to meet/exceed standards with our adapter and our stroller - the car seat manufacturers may or may not have done the same on their own. This is just to give you an example of how the interchange with different brands and adapters works. I have included all the brands below who have advised us they have tested/released adapters that are compatible with our Mico products. You would just want to check with them to see if this includes any double strollers as they do not advise us regarding individual stroller model. If you should have any additional questions, you are more than welcome to contact us at 1-800-951-4113 or via email consumer@maxicosi-us.com. Here is the list of compatible competitor brand: Maxi-Cosi adapters are currently available from the following manufacturers: Baby Jogger, Bugaboo, Bumbleride, iCandy, Contours, Maclaren, Mamas & Papas, Micralite, Mountain Buggy, Phil & Teds, Quinny, Stokke, UPPAbaby, and Valco Baby.*** ***Other than Maxi-Cosi and Quinny the stroller brands listed are the trademarks of their respective owners. They are not associated with Dorel Juvenile USA and no endorsements by them should be implied."}
{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B00DOR6F5K', 'answerTime': 'Apr 27, 2015', 'unixTime': 1430118000, 'question': 'Could you please tell me if it has hte Canadian Saftey approval stamp? Thank you!', 'answer': 'Hi Andrea, If the Car Seat on this website is purchased, it will for US only. If you purchase the Maxi-Cosi Mico AP on amazon.ca, it will have the Canadian Safety approval stamp. We have got you covered either way you go. Buy from the US it meets US regulations. Purchase it from Canada it meets Canadian Regulations. If I can answer anymore questions, please let me know.'}
