{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B00DQED5YA', 'answerTime': 'Feb 15, 2014', 'unixTime': 1392451200, 'question': 'Do regular changing pad covers fit on this product? Has it been a real burden to clean ? Thanks in advance.', 'answer': 'The regular changing pads are the same size for the PooPoose, however; you have to cut two new slits because the straps on the PooPoose are wider and in a different place. I know that the manufacturer is working on getting pads to fit. The PooPoose is very easy to clean. Just wipe it clean like you would the regular pads. Hope this helps you.'}
