{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B00EAAY11A', 'answerTime': 'Jun 10, 2014', 'unixTime': 1402383600, 'question': 'how wide is this bike trailer? Is it hard to bike with this trailer on a sidewalk? Also, is the only opening for air flow in the front of trailer.?', 'answer': "I can measure the width tomorrow and give you a better answer but my guess is that it would be difficult on a busy sidewalk. (You aren't supposed to bike on sidewalks anyway it's dangerous for pedestrians and illegal I believe). The front is the only air opening but it is quite large allowing plenty of air"}
{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B00EAAY11A', 'answerTime': 'May 22, 2014', 'unixTime': 1400742000, 'question': 'Does the front cover have a bug guard or just a vinyl cover?', 'answer': 'It is a two layer cover attached with Velcro. The bug net and a vinyl rain/splash cover that rolls up and is secured by Velcro straps when not in use.'}
{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B00EAAY11A', 'answerTime': 'Aug 9, 2014', 'unixTime': 1407567600, 'question': 'Can someone who has purchased this bike trailer in the past please write a review on it as there currently are none. Thanks in advance!', 'answerType': '?', 'answer': "This is probably not the best quality but good product for the price....wheels are good, it does look stylish, assembly is easy, we only use it as a bike trailer and it does not feel like I am even pulling any extra weight. HOWEVER, we have a issue with the straps.....my son is 15mo old average height BUT he seems to slide down in the seat (even though we tighten the belt around his waist)...and when this happens the shoulder straps end up on the sides of his face. We have placed a pillow under his bottom to give him more height but this still doesn't help bc he eventually slides down.....the straps needed to be adjustable for various heights/ages and they are not...my husband is going to see if we can somehow use something else for the shoulder straps....anyone else have this issue....if so,.....any suggestions?"}
{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B00ECG0IFA', 'answerTime': 'Jul 7, 2014', 'unixTime': 1404716400, 'question': "Will this tip if the bike it's attached to does?", 'answerType': 'N', 'answer': 'No'}
{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B00ECG0IFA', 'answerTime': 'Jul 2, 2014', 'unixTime': 1404284400, 'question': 'Does it fold up for storage or traveling in a car? Do you need to remove the wheel if it does fold.', 'answerType': '?', 'answer': "Unfortunately, it doesn't fold up. However, it comes apart quite easily and is easy to reassemble, without tools, so we have broken it down and taken it on longer trips when we were planning to spend some time in one place. Overall, we've been very pleased with our with it."}
{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B00ECG0IFA', 'answerTime': 'Jun 20, 2014', 'unixTime': 1403247600, 'question': 'Do you need tools to change to stroller/bike/or storing for travel?', 'answer': 'Hello, no tools are needed. Everything can be assembled & disassembled by hand. Thank you!'}
{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B00ECG0IFA', 'answerTime': 'Jun 11, 2014', 'unixTime': 1402470000, 'question': "What's up with the price increase? Two in 24 hours? I'll order it from you off ebay. It's still $145.95 with the shipping on there.", 'answer': 'We are running low on inventory. As the quantity of inventory decreases, the price increases. Otherwise we would sell out completely. Our prices on all marketplaces, including eBay, have increased as well.'}
{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B00ECG0IFA', 'answerTime': 'Jun 10, 2014', 'unixTime': 1402383600, 'question': 'Is the seat padded at all?', 'answerType': 'Y', 'answer': 'Yes, it has a thin layer of foam padding.'}
{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B00ECG0IFA', 'answerTime': 'Jun 10, 2014', 'unixTime': 1402383600, 'question': "How does the top close? Zipper? Velcro? And what is the overall weight? I'm almost convinced this is for me.", 'answer': 'Hello, the windscreen and the window screen are fastened by velcro. The overall weight is about 40lbs.'}
