{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B00EUV2BSE', 'answerTime': 'Mar 20, 2015', 'unixTime': 1426834800, 'question': 'Has anyone figured out how to fold this thing? Also it seems difficult to do? I would like to fold it to make room for my boys to play temporarily.', 'answer': 'It does not actually fold- you press the white buttons on the base and remove the arched upper tubes and lay each one down flat on the bottom part of the base and the chair can be slid under a bed or stood up against a wall to take up less room-also to put in car trunk'}
