{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B00EUV2BSE', 'answerTime': 'Jan 26, 2015', 'unixTime': 1422259200, 'question': "What's the big difference between this jumper and the Baby Einstein Activity Jumper Special Edition, Neighborhood Friends?", 'answer': 'There are a lot of differences. The basic frame is the same, but the items that go on the frame as well as the pattern of the fabric and colors are different. It looks like you have a bird instead of a cloud, and the Keyboard unit for music looks very different. The other two activity inserts look very similar/identical. This item often has new versions released of it (my brother has the Baby Einstein Jumper from 2 revisions ago... prior to the too springy Sun Recall) This may just be a revised version.'}
