{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B00F2MQ0EQ', 'answerTime': 'Jun 15, 2014', 'unixTime': 1402815600, 'question': 'Can one drain the tub easily with little one sitting in it at stage 3 &amp; 4 (no sling)?', 'answerType': '?', 'answer': "Nope. The drain is located below the green seat, so you'd have to take the seat out to drain it. I lift my LO out and rinse her in the shower; then I just flip tub over to drain it. It's a vey comfy tub, however. LO loves it If you're looking for an easy to drain one, I definitely recommend the 4moms, also sold by Amazon. I have one at my mother's house, the drain is located at LO's feet. It really depends on your bathing situation. If you bathe LO in shower or tub, the easiest way to drain is flipping the tub over after you've finished bathing and dressing LO. This really is a comfy tub, and my LO's favorite."}
