{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B00F2MQ82K', 'answerTime': 'Oct 31, 2014', 'unixTime': 1414738800, 'question': "My baby is going on 5 months, weighs 16 lbs however, she's on the tall side. Is this swing ok for longer/taller babies?", 'answerType': '?', 'answer': "I would say no. My 7 mo old is on the talk side weighing almost 19lbs. And while she does still sit in it, she prefers the side to side motion vs the the front to back and her legs hit the rail. I just wouldn't invest in it this late in her growth. Was awesome from newborn up."}
