{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B00F56IY9S', 'answerTime': 'Sep 25, 2014', 'unixTime': 1411628400, 'question': 'what is the range of this camera?', 'answer': "We live in a large, old house that has thick walls which dampen the wireless signal to the point that we finally had to install routers on the main level and upstairs in order to get serviceable speed on our devices. The camera is in my son's room upstairs, and the signal broadcasts without degradation of fidelity throughout the entire house, including the basement. While I have not subjected the camera to rigorous testing, based on the above, I would surmise that it has pretty good range."}
