{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B00F57O766', 'answerTime': 'Feb 9, 2014', 'unixTime': 1391932800, 'question': 'How do the dual cameras work? Can you flip between two rooms manually? How often does it auto scan? Does sound work when scanning between two cameras?', 'answer': 'If you purchase extra camera then you be be able to use auto scan feature which scans between the two cameras every 8 seconds. This auto scan feature happens automatically, not manual. However, you can manually switch to other camera view at any time. Volume will be heard for camera being shown on monitor screen at that time. Hope this helps. Overall a great monitor for the price.'}
