{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B00FCSCJB8', 'answerTime': 'Mar 2, 2014', 'unixTime': 1393747200, 'question': 'Also, what is the widest width this will fit of stroller handles and the steepest incline?', 'answer': "Hi Jess, The widest width of handles that the organizer can accommodate would be approx 20 inches (50cm). There's not really a way to describe the steepest incline handles the organizer can take because it depends on factors like how you have set up the main baby carriage (facing towards vs away), the way you attach the main velcro straps (we have a Youtube video showing how this is done), and how much weight you place in the organizer. That said, our testing shows that the Easy Stroller Mate can sit fairly stable on models with steep incline handles. And while it's difficult to say with 100% certainty whether it would perfectly your model, I would wager it fits more securely than the vast majority of other organizers we've seen. I hope this helps in your decision, along with the knowledge that you're covered by our No Fuss Guarantee - if it doesn't fit simply return it for a full refund. Many thanks, Matt - StarPack Team Member"}
