{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B00FG6G7XM', 'answerTime': 'Dec 20, 2013', 'unixTime': 1387526400, 'question': 'what\'s the real cost of "roving cove safe edge and corner cushion - 15ft. value pack" amazon has listed it for $999.99?', 'answer': "Hi Dan, thank you for your question. The regular list price of our Safe Edge Cushion is $24.99, but it often sells for less than that. The current price was set temporarily so that the listing would remain active while more inventory is received. We expect the Safe Edge Cushion to be available again at its regular price next week. Please check back in a week's time. Thank you and we apologize for the inconvenience. Mayapple Baby / Roving Cove"}
{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B00FG6G7XM', 'answerTime': 'Apr 29, 2014', 'unixTime': 1398754800, 'question': 'is it stick to brick fireplace?', 'answerType': '?', 'answer': 'Hi Crystal M., Thank you for your question and for your interest in Roving Cove Safe Edge Cushions. Yes, they will stick to brick fireplaces/hearths. Here are some comments from Amazon customers who have reviewed the product (you can find these by clicking on Customer Reviews): "Very nice product,easy to install and sticks well to my brick fireplace." -By SCOTT NOBLE "This was very easy to install and it doesn\'t seem to be going anywhere anytime soon. It even stuck to the brick around our fireplace." -By Brent J Carey "We stuck this on our fireplace, and it has not moved at all. So, if it will stick to bricks, I\'m sure it will stick to any smooth surface with no problem." -By Michelle "Stuck very securely to stone fireplace. \'this now baby-proofed. Easy to use and shape to irregular surfaces." -By Allison D McGuffie "This works great for our fire place does what its supposed to do! Easy to apply and does not do damage to fireplace." -By Dorothy Zuniga Thank you! Mayapple Baby / Roving Cove'}
