{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B00FG6G7XM', 'answerTime': 'Nov 22, 2014', 'unixTime': 1416643200, 'question': 'is there a way to buy the tape separately? (lost it) :(', 'answerType': '?', 'answer': 'Hi Boaz S., Thank you for your purchase of Roving Cove Safe Edge & Corner Cushions. The 3M double-sided tape that is included with our cushions is not available for retail. However, as others have mentioned you could purchase extra-strength double-sided tape at an office or hardware store. For now, just email us at info@mayapplebaby.com and we will send you some tape at no charge. Thank you, Mark, Mayapple Baby / Roving Cove'}
{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B00FG6G7XM', 'answerTime': 'Apr 4, 2014', 'unixTime': 1396594800, 'question': 'Could this work on a rectangle coffee table that has a beveled edge?', 'answerType': '?', 'answer': 'Hi A. Naim, Thank you for your interest in Roving Cove Safe Edge & Corner Cushions. The cushions should stick on a beveled edge. If you -- or anyone else who purchased our cushions -- need extra 3M double-sided tape, please email us at CustomerCare@MayappleBaby.com and we will send some to you. Thank you so much! Mayapple Baby / Roving Cove'}
