{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B00FLXBJ92', 'answerTime': 'Mar 29, 2014', 'unixTime': 1396076400, 'question': 'How does this gate expand to different size openings? Mine is 61"?', 'answer': 'It comes in five pieces.The main piece is the section with the door. Then there is the left and right side that you\'ll add to the door piece. You could stop there if that\'s big enough and these two side pieces are also by a few inches. If this is still not long enough then you can add the additional two extra sides. Those too can be adjuasted a few inches also. Then, there are some screws that screw into the gate, on both sides and the top and bottom and these screws will fit into the little bracket/screw holders you install on the wall. *You mention that your gate is only 61", I hope you rec\'d all five pieces.'}
