{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B00FXR5RY4', 'answerTime': 'Nov 17, 2014', 'unixTime': 1416211200, 'question': 'what are the dimensions of the changing pad that is included in this clutch? good for 1.5 yrs old?', 'answer': "Hi! Mmmm...this is a pretty small purse. Changing pad is smaller than ones you'd get with a regular diaper bag. This literally fits one diaper, a few wipes, tiny changing pad and a very slim wallet. I like to keep it in my car and I take it with me to the stores while my regular diaper bag sits inside. Honestly, your probably better off just getting a normal clutch type purse that's a little bigger and can fit a larger changing pad and maybe a sippy cup and snack or two. It worked for me when my LO was a baby but now that I need snacks, bibs, water, etc...I'll be on the lookout for something that is in between this purse and a diaper bag! Hope this helps!"}
