{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B00FXR5RY4', 'answerTime': 'Jun 17, 2014', 'unixTime': 1402988400, 'question': 'Can this also be used as an everyday purse? The crossbag i currently have is just way too small. I need something for on the go, but nothing too big.', 'answerType': '?', 'answer': "Hi, yes you could use this a a purse as well, but I am not sure how much you normally carry. We have had many happy customers who buy this for the mom who just has a few errands but doesn't want to carry both a full diaper bag and purse! I would say you could use it as both, but the bag would not stretch to be very wide, I would say the width on the bottom is about 1 inch. Please let me know if you have any further questions!"}
{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B00FXR5RY4', 'answerTime': 'Apr 17, 2014', 'unixTime': 1397718000, 'question': 'What is the drop length on the strap?', 'answer': 'About 22" across your body, from shoulder to hip. I\'m about 5\'8" and when adjusted to the full length of the strap the purse drops below my hip-bone, so I wear it adjusted a little higher. I am a taller person and I love the flexibility of this purse. I bought it as a small diaper bag for running errands (I also own a larger Skip Hop bag too) and love the durability of the fabric. Very cute and versatile!'}
