{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B00G2Y65BQ', 'answerTime': 'Feb 15, 2015', 'unixTime': 1423987200, 'question': 'I want to put it into carry-on bag (22x14x9inch) on my united airlines flight. Can anybody tell me its exact dimension when folded to see if it fits?', 'answer': "Without actually measuring it, I can tell you that it won't. I have 4 different carry-ons I own, of various sizes, which I use for travel depending on the length of the trip. Although it is possible to fit it in any of them, it is all you'll be able to fit as you will have to lay it in diagonally. You will not be able to lay it flat in any carry on that is allowed on board, unless you have a much wider flatter carry-on, which I have yet to see. But it does have it's own carry on case which does qualify it as it's own carry on."}
