{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B00G2Y65BQ', 'answerTime': 'Jul 17, 2014', 'unixTime': 1405580400, 'question': "How do you fold the bouncer back to it's original size? I set it up and can't re-fold it enough to fit into the box.", 'answer': 'There is a round release knob on the back that you have to turn to fold the top of the chair towards the bottom of the chair. Then there is a button on the front of the chair (just under the front of the seat) that you press and it will fold in the sides. Hope this helps!'}
