{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B00G34TIDW', 'answerTime': 'Mar 12, 2014', 'unixTime': 1394607600, 'question': "I'm trying to figure out which Britax car seat to buy. Why choose this one? Thank you!", 'answer': "The Chicco Nextfit! I exchanged two Marathon G4s for the Nextfit. The Nextfits with the nine adjustable positions leveled better in our cars, and they were easier to adjust for our two year old. Lastly, the G4 took 15-20 minutes to install rear-facing using the tether whereas the Nextfit was solidly installed in two minutes. Addendum - I also felt that the Nextfit cradled our son's better than the Marathon G4 (e.g. his head stays upright in a neutral position while asleep.) Lastly, Chicco customer service is fantastic! We need replacement parts over the years for various Chicco strollers, a play yard, and a high chair, and they always responded wonderfully!"}
