{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B00G34TIHI', 'answerTime': 'Dec 1, 2014', 'unixTime': 1417420800, 'question': "Will this fit behind the driver's seat of my chevrolet traverse? Is it very wide compared to other seats? Is there a smaller but similar britax?", 'answer': "Yes it will fit behind the driver's seat in a traverse, especially in the forward facing position. In the rear facing position, you might lose a bit of flexibility when moving your seat back but you will have plenty of leg room still. All seats are relatively the same size length wise, only the width changes, mostly in the case of the Advocate. The width of the Boulevard is comparable to other seats. The new Clicktights are slightly narrower."}
