{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B00G34TL6Q', 'answerTime': 'Mar 5, 2014', 'unixTime': 1394006400, 'question': 'What are the main differences between this model and the older Advocate G3?', 'answer': 'The biggest difference between the G3 and G4 models (that I can see) is that, in the G4 models, it is WAY easier to adjust the strap height. This saves a lot of time and frustration, believe me. If you are deciding between the two generations of models, I would definitely recommend any Britax G4 model.'}
