{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B00G34TJZ4', 'answerTime': 'Mar 18, 2014', 'unixTime': 1395126000, 'question': "I've read some of the reviews for the G3 that the straps are difficult to adjust. Anyone having the same issue(s)for this newer model? TIA", 'answer': 'The G3 had tiny straps on the back of the larger straps that were designed to tear in an accident so you know when the car seat needs to be replaced. These often got hung up and made adjustment difficult. They abandoned these on the G4 which makes the straps easier to adjust. I had both seats and am glad they made the change. Not sure if the length is different.'}
