{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B00G34TIKU', 'answerTime': 'Jan 28, 2014', 'unixTime': 1390896000, 'question': 'What is the difference between this and the G3 model?', 'answer': 'The G4 has a 65 pound weight limit while the G3 has a 70 pound weight limit. There is an infant insert designed for the G4 series for a baby up to 22 lbs. At this time, the G3 is less expensive than the G4 but I would certainly go on desired features over the price (just my take). I hope this answer is helpful. Glad to try and research and answer any other questions you have about the Britax. If it helps any, I love my G4 but I have not had the G3.'}
