{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B00G3XR8US', 'answerTime': 'May 1, 2015', 'unixTime': 1430463600, 'question': 'is this good enough for everyday use in nyc, like on the bus and subway?', 'answerType': 'Y', 'answer': 'Yes, this is exactly the reason we decided to go with this stroller---because it seems to be designed with NYC life in mind. It is also great from traveling on planes and other. Between the traditional City Mini and the City Mini GT---I think I like better the City Mini (2011 version)--although we only used the GT (2014 version) for a few months because our daughter grew out of using strollers on a regular basis. Overall these are great strollers and would highly recommend them!'}
