{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B00G3XR8PS', 'answerTime': 'Apr 22, 2014', 'unixTime': 1398150000, 'question': "What's the difference between this new version and the prior version? There's a $120 price difference, it is worth the difference?", 'answer': "The only difference's are the logo has been changed, and the shoulder strap no longer hooks in to the front using a hook. This is a plus and a minus, the plus side is it would be more comfortable for the child, the downside is the new design is a bit harder to get to and change the position, not that hard to do. The only other thing i've noticed is they have improved the buckle design. If you can get the older version I'd go with that as the price difference isn't worth it in my opinion."}
