{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B00G3XR8PS', 'answerTime': 'Oct 29, 2014', 'unixTime': 1414566000, 'question': 'Hi! The description on a site (momstrollerreviews) specifies is not for newborns. I consider getting it for a newborn. Can someone please tell why not', 'answer': "It's pretty big for a newborn. We got one for our newborn but we bought an attachment that allows you to clip your infant car seat into the stroller securely. Without this attachment, this would not be a good infant stroller. They make the attachment for many of the different car seat brands so I'd recommend doing some research on whether they make the car seat adaptor for the car seat you are planning to buy so you'll have an entire system that is compatible."}
