{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B00GCHT1ZK', 'answerTime': 'Mar 17, 2014', 'unixTime': 1395039600, 'question': 'what is the difference with 2014 model vs 2013?', 'answer': 'The 2014 is my first clek foonf - as I understand the magnetic sides are gone - no big deal for me- I understand they removed the magnets because of customer feedback - the other difference is the longer - 2 position crotch strap the 2014 has - apparently if you buy older versions you might need to buy this separately and replace - I think something about the setup for the rebound bar is easier - it was very easy but again I cannot say the older ones were hard- I love it! Our baby is 10 months old - we researched for 2 months and decided on this car seat - the release straps are so easy to allow for ease in buckling her in - then one tug on the strap and it is ready - I watched the utube video to install.'}
{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B00GCHT1ZK', 'answerTime': 'Aug 5, 2014', 'unixTime': 1407222000, 'question': 'Hello, what is the difference between Shadow and Black Drift? Are they both 2014 model? Thanks!', 'answer': "Yes, they are both 2014. The Shadow is made with that special fabric that repels stains. Black Drift is the only Clek Foonf that isn't made with the special fabric. That is why it is cheaper. I have the Drift and I am still very happy with the quality of the fabric. But my baby doesn't eat or drink in the car. If he did, I would have bought the Shadow instead."}
