{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B00GHM88HW', 'answerTime': 'Sep 24, 2014', 'unixTime': 1411542000, 'question': 'How many reclining positions does this seat/stroller have?', 'answer': 'Infinite really. It is very maneuverable. All you have to do is depress the levers to adjust the rotation or recline of the seat. The seat can hold any recline position and face any direction once the lever is released. Little ones can sit straight up, lay down, or degree in between. Keep in mind that when facing forward, the seat can recline a good deal but it cannot recline all the way down because the seat will eventually hit the handle bars of the stroller base. To reline all the way down, the seat must be facing a direction where the stroller base handle bars will not get in the way--for example, rear facing position. Hope this helps.'}
