{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B00GS1H526', 'answerTime': 'Nov 14, 2014', 'unixTime': 1415952000, 'question': 'I have a three year old and a baby on the way. Can I use the booster seat portion of this seat for my older child while still giving baby what it need', 'answerType': '?', 'answer': 'Not sure the exact question. But if you buy two seats this would work perfect for both of them! If you are asking to split the car seat up then no. But this is perfect for a new baby it comes with infant cushion you may need to but extra head support but it will hold them in well. And will work for toddler as well.'}
