{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B00GU07FLQ', 'answerTime': 'Dec 17, 2014', 'unixTime': 1418803200, 'question': "Is the hard board going to work with the Kendall crib by Pottery Barn? the mattress' frame is not solid, is open (wires).", 'answerType': '?', 'answer': 'Our mattress frame is not from the pottery barn but it is all wires, the only solid is the frame of the crib. What the mattress sits on is basically a metal lattice that is springy. I think that is pretty common for cribs. So the hard board will work. But we realized after purchasing the hard board anything stiff would have worked in its place. But regardless of if you choose to user the hard board or a piece of plywood or something similar I definatley recommend the monitor. Its been a lifesaver. Our little one never slept well on his back. He loves his tummy and now that he can turn over he moves to his stomach in the night. The monitor lets us sleep soundly knowing we will know if he isnt breathing.'}
