{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B00H8MSFE6', 'answerTime': 'Nov 6, 2014', 'unixTime': 1415260800, 'question': "How stable is this chair? I have a very wiggly little one and I'm worried the legs will wobble or the chair will tip.", 'answer': "My granddaughter is 8 months old and over 20 lbs, so large for her age. She's also very wiggly and constantly moving and I've had no problems with her in the high chair, no wobbling or tipping at all. I do, however, usually use the large tray positioned fairly close to her, which does help to restrict any extreme movement. I'm very happy with this chair, and would recommend it."}
