{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B00H8MSK1Y', 'answerTime': 'Nov 25, 2014', 'unixTime': 1416902400, 'question': 'How can I buy a second base for a second car?', 'answer': 'This is a convertible seat, so it goes rear facing and forward facing. They are not made with a base, it is most convenient to have one for each car. They are heavy, and not something you are going to want to take in and out. They are great seats though!'}
