{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B00I6IGG1A', 'answerTime': 'Jun 11, 2014', 'unixTime': 1402470000, 'question': 'Why do other sites and/or Ebay have stock available but not Amazon?', 'answer': 'This carrier is long past release date, (it came out in March) but keeps selling out. Sellers are getting them as they become available. Right now, one Amazon seller has it in black only and no one else (including the Ergobaby store) has it. Next week might be different. Ergobaby is supposed to get more units in grey "mid June" and more in black in July. Please be wary of Ebay sellers on pricey sold-out hot baby items like this. There are a lot of fakes circulating and bad stitching can mean your baby falls. Ebay is great if you\'re getting a terrific price on some older clothes or something, but new high price items may be frauds.'}
