{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B00IAVJDHC', 'answerTime': 'Jun 26, 2014', 'unixTime': 1403766000, 'question': 'Is each portion of the decal on a different line? I would like to spread out the words rather than it be in "paragraph" form...', 'answerType': '?', 'answer': "It does come in paragraph form, but you'd be able to cut each line individually and stick it on piece by piece."}
{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B00IAVJDHC', 'answerTime': 'Jun 26, 2014', 'unixTime': 1403766000, 'question': 'Are the words a decent size? I would like to spread them across a long wall and surround it with picture frames. Thank you!', 'answerType': '?', 'answer': 'Hello! and no unfortunately, no they are not at all. However, I got a sticker of a large camera with hands and added a smile pretty quote on the bottom. And that seemed to the trick on my large wall.'}
