{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B00IBZ8ADK', 'answerTime': 'Mar 15, 2014', 'unixTime': 1394866800, 'question': 'How is this different from the other conversion kits? This one seems to have the sealing rings but is it otherwise the same as the one made by philips?', 'answer': "The Philips kit has two converters for bottles, and two converters for VIA cups. The Maymom kit has four converters for bottles but no converters for VIA cups. Both bottle converters are the same. Maymom's kit also includes the sealing rings. They are all BPA free. Hope this helps."}
