{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B00IM8G038', 'answerTime': 'Mar 25, 2015', 'unixTime': 1427266800, 'question': 'Is it worth getting this vs the pack n play for the extra couple inches? My 2 year old is getting too big for the pnp.', 'answer': 'Not for this reason. It actually seems narrower than pnp. But the mattress is better/softer/more comfortable, and its 10 times easier to set up/fold than pnp.'}
