{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B00IRP67MK', 'answerTime': 'Jun 25, 2014', 'unixTime': 1403679600, 'question': "My diapers have started to smell almost like grass, and no matter what I do I can't get the smell out. Any suggestions?", 'answer': "I know this sounds weird, but it works! Put all your diapers in the washer and do one rinse cycle. After it's done add 2 tbsp of the blue dawn dish soap and do a hot or warm wash cycle. Then rinse them 3-5 times after that. Your diapers probably just need stripped =)"}
