{'questionType': 'yes/no', 'asin': 'B00KDKKD1I', 'answerTime': 'Dec 21, 2014', 'unixTime': 1419148800, 'question': "Do you sell a toddler pillow protector case? I ordered the angel baby a pillow case for it (400 thread count) but it's not the envelope style.", 'answerType': '?', 'answer': "Hi Jennifer, We don't offer a pillow protector case, but we are coming out with envelope style pillowcases very soon. Please send us an email via our website at www.LittleSleepyHeadPillows.com if you are still interested and we will notify you when they are available! Thank you so much! Chris Owner, Little Sleepy Head Pillows"}
{'questionType': 'open-ended', 'asin': 'B00KDKKD1I', 'answerTime': 'Sep 19, 2014', 'unixTime': 1411110000, 'question': 'Do you make toddler pillows that are not as firm or thick as others? My son is very picky. :(', 'answer': 'Hi. We have a "love your pillow\'s fluff or we will change it" guarantee! The amount of "fluff" can be a very personal thing as it seems you know! Feel free to send me an email directly if you want to discuss specifics, otherwise please know that you can purchase with confidence. If you find our original pillow has too much or too little for your son, we will make one just for you! Thank you!'}
